<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CH" style="id">- Pogoro Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Mirandu ya shaka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Shitabu sha pili sha Mirandu ya Shaka</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Mirandu</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Mira</para>
  <para style="mt2">Shitabu sha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mirandu ya shaka</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGULERU</para>
  <para style="ip">Shitabu sha 1 na sha 2 sha Mirandu ya shaka shibagula vipinga vya wazewi kwanjira Adamu mpaka Ibrahimu na ntambu ya yanjiti isi ya wantu wa Israeli mpaka Waisraeli pawawuyiti kulawa muuhamisiwu kwawatolitwi kuwera wamanda. Kwanjira shaka ashi Mirandu ya shaka shitakulira historia ya wantu wa Israeli kulawa kumalilira mirandu ya mfalumi Sauli mpaka mji gwa Yerusalemu paguhalibisiwitwi na wantu wa Babeli. Muvitabu vyoseri avi vya Mirandu ya shaka, mlemba katakulira nentu kuusu mirandu ya numba nkulu ya Mlungu aku Yerusalemu. Dawudi katanditi vintu vivuwa toziya ya kunyawa numba nkulu ya Mlungu (1 Mirandu ya shaka 28-29) Na kulawa panu Selemani mwana gwa Dawudi ndo yakanyawiti (2 Mirandu ya shaka 2-7). Mlemba gwa Vitabu vya Mirandu ya shaka katakulira ntambu yayihalibisitwi numba nkulu ya Mlungu na vyombu vyakuyi ntambu yavitolitwi (2 Mirandu ya shaka 36:15-21). Upeleru wa msitari gwa shitabu sha 2 Mirandu ya shaka (36: 23) ilanguziya pota kufifa numba nkulu ya Mlungu ntambu hayinyawiwi kayi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yagaweraamu mushitabu sha 2 Mirandu ya shaka:</para>
  <para style="io">Shipandi 1-9 shitakula kuusu kulikala na ukolamlima wa Selemani, mfalumi gwa Israel.</para>
  <para style="io">Shipandi 10-36 shitakulira isi ya Israeli na Yuda ntambu yayibagulitwi, viravilii itakulira stoliya ya wafalumi ntambu yawakolitimlima Yuda kulawa shaka ashi mpaka ukolamlima pawukankalitwi.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CH 1" />
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Selemani kankuluwa luhala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 3:1-15">1 Wafalumi 3:1-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 1:1" />Hangu Selemani, mwana mpalu gwa mfalumi Dawudi, kaligangamaziyiti muufalumi wakuyi na toziya Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwakuyi, kaweriti pamuhera nayomberi, kamtekelera na kumtenda kaweri makulu nentu.<verse eid="2CH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 1:2" />Mfalumi Selemani kawashemiti Waisraeli woseri na wakulu wa mashonta woseri wa vipinga vya maelufu na vya mamiya na watoza na wakulu woseri wa Israeli na wakulu wa kaya. <verse eid="2CH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 1:3" />Su Selemani kawalagalira kagendi pamuhera nawa mpaka pahala pa kutambikira aku Gibeoni. Kagenditi nawa kulii toziya panu ndo pahala paliweriti liringu linanagala lyakalinyawiti Musa ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu kushiwala aku. <verse eid="2CH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 1:4" />Mfalumi Dawudi kaweriti kala kalijega Lisadiku lya lipatanu lya Mlungu kulawa Kiriyati Yearimu mpaka kuliringu lyakanyawiti aku Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 1:5" />Ntambu iraa shitalawanda sha shaba shashinyawitwi na Bazaleli, mwana gwa Uri na mzukulu gwa Huri, viraa shiweriti aku Gibeoni kulongolu Kuliringu Linanagara lya Mtuwa Mlungu. Palii mfalumi Selemani na wantu woseri wamluwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 1:6" />Selemani kakweniti pahala pampindi papaweriti shitalawanda sha shaba shashiweriti palongolu Paliringu Linanagala na kalaviyiti tambiku elufu yimu za kulunguziwa pampindi pa shitalawanda ashi.<verse eid="2CH 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 1:7" />Pashiru panu, Mlungu kamlawiriti Selemani na kumgambira, “Gunduwi shoseri shagufira, naneni hanikupanani.”<verse eid="2CH 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 1:8" />Selemani kamgambira Mlungu, “Gumtendiriti tati gwangu Dawudi ufiru mkulu na guntenda kuwera mfalumi pahala pakuyi. <verse eid="2CH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 1:9" />Vinu, gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, gutendi lipatanu lyaku lyagutakuliti kwa Dawudi tati gwangu. Toziya gunumika weri mfalumi kwa wantu awa yawawera wavuwa yawawalangikandiri gambira madikudiku. <verse eid="2CH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 1:10" />Hangu, nikuluwa gumpanani luhala na umani su wezi kuwalonguziya wantu waku weri, hangu ndo gaa yakaweza kuwalonguziya wantu waku yawawera wavuwa hangu?”<verse eid="2CH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 1:11" />Mlungu kamwankula Selemani, “Toziya mlandu agu gwaguluwiti gulawa mmoyu mwaku nagwenga gunduwandiri lunda na vintu vitangala na ligoya, pota kuluwa wankondu walaguwi, pota kuluwa gulikali mashaka mavuwa, kumbiti guluwa luhala na umani su kuwalonguzi weri wantu waneni yanikupanani guweri mfalumi gwawu, <verse eid="2CH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 1:12" />hanikupanani luhala na umani. Viraa, hanikupanani ulunda na vintu vitangala na ligoya nentu kuliku mfalumi yumonga yoseri yakaweriti pamberi pa gwenga na yanakaweri mfalumi pagwenga.”<verse eid="2CH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulunda na uwezu wa mfalumi Selemani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 10:26-29">1 Wafalumi 10:26-29</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 1:13" />Su, Selemani kawukiti pahala panu pa kuguwira, aku Gibeoni, paliweliti na Liringu Linanagala na kawuya Yerusalemu kulii kawakolamlima Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 1:14" />Selemani kajojoniriti mbutuka za kukwegwa na farasi elufu yimu na miya msheshi na farasi elufu lilongu na mbili, weni kawatuliti mumiji yana vituwu vya mbutuka za kukwegwa na farasi na zimonga kazituliti aku Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 1:15" />Mfalumi Selemani kongeriti feza na zahabu ziweriti zivuwa gambira mabuwi kumji gwa Yerusalemu na mbawu za mitera ya miyelezi iweriti ivuwa gambira mikuyu pasi pavigongu pa Yudea. <verse eid="2CH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 1:16" />Farasi wa Selemani walawiti Misri na kilikia, watenda ushuwuzi wakuyi wawahemeriti kulawa aku. <verse eid="2CH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 1:17" />Wahemeriti mbutuka yimu ya kukwega na farasi kulawa Misri handa kilu saba za feza na kila farasi yumu handa kilu mbili za feza. Viraavirii wawawuziti farasi awa na mbutuka zakuyi kwa wafalumi wa Hiti na Sria.<verse eid="2CH 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CH 2" />
  <para style="s">Matandiru ga kunyawa Numba nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 5:1-18">1 Wafalumi 5:1-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 2:1" />Mfalumi Selemani kaamuwiti kunyawa Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu yeni hakaguwirwi amu na viraa kalinyawira mweni liboma. <verse eid="2CH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 2:2" />Selemani kawatuliti wapalu elufu sabini wapapi visanka na wapalu elufu semanini waweri wasongoli mabuwi kulugongu na wamonga elufu tatu na miya sita waweri wagolokera wawu.<verse eid="2CH 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 2:3" />Shakapanu, Selemani katumiti ulagilagi awu kwa mfalumi Hiramu gwa Tiru, kamgambira, “Guntenderi na neni ntambu yagumtendiriti tati gwangu Dawudi, pagumjegiriti vipingiri vya miyerezi vya kunyawira liboma lyakuyi. <verse eid="2CH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 2:4" />Vinu, sambira nanji kunyawa numba ya kumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwangu. Haniyilaviyi kwa Mtuwa, nayeni hayiweri pahala pa kutumiziya ubani wa kununkira nentu kulongolu kwakuyi, shakapanu hapaweri pahala pa mabumunda gagalaviwitwi kulongolu kwakuyi mashaka goseri na tambiku za kulunguziwa mandawira na pashimihi na viraa mumashaka ga kwoyela na mulyezi kulawa na misambu imonga ya Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwetu, ntambu yakawalagaliriti Waisraeli mashaka goseri. <verse eid="2CH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 2:5" />Numba yanfira kunyawa hayiweri nkulu ng'anji, toziya Mlungu gwetu ndo mkulu nentu kuliku wamlungu wamonga woseri. <verse eid="2CH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 2:6" />Kumbiti kwahera muntu yakaweza kumnyawira numba payiwera mpindi zyeni zimtosheyandiri, pota mpindi za kumpindi nentu. Naneni ndo gaa, ata nimnyawiri numba? Ira hera pahala pa kutumiziya ubani kulongolu kwakuyi. <verse eid="2CH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 2:7" />Su, Vinu gunjegeri muntu yakadaha kunyawa vyombu vya zahabu na vya madini ga feza, shaba na shuma na nguwu za rangi ya zambalawu na za rangi nsheri na za buluwu, viraavirii yakamana, kuherepiziya su yomberi hakatendi lihengu pamuhera na wanyawa yawawera muisi ya Yuda na Yerusalemu, weni tati gwangu Dawudi kawasyaguliti. <verse eid="2CH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 2:8" />Viravilii gunjegeri mbawu za miyerezi na miberoshi na misandali kulawa Lebanoni, toziya nivimana handa wantumintumi waku ndo wagangamala nentu wa kusalanga mbawu aku Lebanoni. Na wantumintumi wa neni hawalitangi pamuhera na wantumintumi waku, <verse eid="2CH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 2:9" />su wansalangiri mbawu zivuwa, toziya numba nkulu yanfira kunyawa ndo nkulu na yakulikangasha. <verse eid="2CH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 2:10" />Toziya wantumintumi waku, awa maselemara hawasalangi mbawu, handaviyi tani elufu mbili za nganu yaziponditwi na tani elufu mbili za shayili na lita laki msheshi za divayi na lita laki msheshi za lipaki lya mizeyituni.”<verse eid="2CH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 2:11" />Mfalumi Hiramu gwa Tiru, kamwankula Selemani kwa luhamba, pakalonga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 2:11">“Toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kawafira wantu wakuyi, kakutenda gwenga guweri mfalumi gwawu. <verse eid="2CH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 2:12" />Kakwiswi Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, yakanyawiti kumpindi na pasi panu! Kampanana mfalumi Dawudi, mwana mpalu yakana luhala na umani, ayu hakamnyawiri Mtuwa Mlungu Numba Nkulu na kulinyawira liboma lyakuyi. <verse eid="2CH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 2:13" />Vinu nikulagalilira muntu kana umani nentu na mahala, litawu lyakuyi Huramu Abi, <verse eid="2CH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 2:14" />yomberi mawu gwakuyi kalawa likabila lya Dani na tati gwakuyi kaweriti mwenikaya gwa Tiru. Yomberi kana umani uvuwa wa kutendera zahabu na feza na shaba na shuma na mabuwi na mitera na rangi ya zambalawu na buluwu, nsheri na nguwu nfufu ziherepa. Kayi ndo mgangamala na yakaweza kuherepiziya na kushora kulawa mukila shintu shoseri shakapananwa. Yomberi hakalitangi pamuhera na wantu na mafundi walii wa mkulu gwangu Dawudi, tati gwaku. <verse eid="2CH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 2:15" />Vinu, mtuwa gwangu avi ndo vintu vyagulongiti; nganu na shayili na lipaki lya mizeyituni na divayi, nikuluwa guvijegi kwa wantumintumi waku, <verse eid="2CH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 2:16" />na twenga hatusalangi mbawu ntambu yagufira kulawa aku Lebanoni, shakapanu hatuzitawi pamuhera ziyeruki mmashi mpaka Yopa. Kulawa aku haguzijegi Yerusalemu.”<verse eid="2CH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu yakwanja kunyawa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 6:1-38">1 Wafalumi 6:1-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 2:17" />Shakapanu Mfalumi Selemani kalagaliriti wahenga woseri yawalikaliti muisi ya Israeli wawalangwi handa Dawudi, tati gwakuyi ntambu yakawawalangiti. Kuweriti na wahenga laki yimu na hamsini na tatu elufu na miya sita. <verse eid="2CH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 2:18" />Muwahenga awa Selemani kawasyaguliti wantu elufu sabini kawapananiti lihengu lya kupapa vintu na wantu semanini elufu kwa lihengu lya kusongola mabuwi kulugongu na wantu elufu tatu miya sita waweri wagolokera.<verse eid="2CH 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 3:1" />Shakapanu mfalumi Selemani kanjiti kunyawa Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu aku Yerusalemu palugongu Moria kweni Mtuwa Mlungu kamlawiriti Dawudi, tati gwakuyi, pahala peni Dawudi kaweriti kapasyagula, kuluwaga lwa kukomera viboga lwa Orinani muntu gwa likabila lya Yebusi. <verse eid="2CH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 3:2" />Mfalumi Selemani kanjiti kunyawa Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu mwezi gwa pili mushinja sha msheshi sha ukolamlima wakuyi. <verse eid="2CH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 3:3" />Numba Nkulu yakanyawiti Selemani, iweriti na utali wa mita ishilini na saba na upana mita tisa. <verse eid="2CH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 3:4" />Shumba sha pahala pa kwingilira shiweriti na utali wa mita tisa, teratera na upana wa numba ayi, kugenda kumpindi kuweriti mita hamsini na msheshi. Vibambaza vyakuyi vigibikitwi kwa zahabu iherepa uwega wa mngati. <verse eid="2CH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 3:5" />Ligeleri ligibikitwi kwa mbawu za mitera ya miberoshi na kumatika kwa zahabu iherepa na isongolitwi mumitera ya mitendi na minyororu. <verse eid="2CH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 3:6" />Mfalumi Selemani kayiherepeziyiti Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu kwa mabuwi gaherepa ga beyi nkulu. Zahabu yakatendiriti ilawiti muisi ya Parivaimu. <verse eid="2CH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 3:7" />Kamatika Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu yoseri kwa zahabu. Boriti zakuyi na vizingiti vyakuyi na vibambaza vyakuyi na migomi yakuyi. Muvibambaza musongolitwi viwumbi vyana mbapatiru vyavilifana na makerubi. <verse eid="2CH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 3:8" />Kayi kapanyawiti Pahala Pananagala Nentu. Utali wakuyi uweriti mita tisa, teratera na upana wakuyi weni viraa uweriti na mita tisa. Yomberi katenderiti nentu ya tani ishilini ya zahabu iherepa kushimatika shumba ashi. <verse eid="2CH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 3:9" />Misumari ya zahabu yawayitendiriti iweriti handa nusu kilu. Viraavirii kavimatika vyumba vyoseri vya kumpindi kwa zahabu.<verse eid="2CH 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 3:10" />Mfalumi Selemani kanyawiti vinyagu viwili za viwumbi vyana mbapatiru vyavilifana na makerubi kwa mbawu, kavimatika kwa zahabu na kuvitula Pahala Pananagala nentu. <verse eid="2CH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 3:11" />Kila shiwumbi shiweriti na mbapatiru mbili zyaziweriti handa mita msheshi na nusu na mita mbili na robu kila lupapatiru. Lupapatiru lumu lushinkuliti shibambaza sha uwega umu wa shumba sha pili lushinkulana na shiwumbi gwa pili. <verse eid="2CH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 3:12" />Ntambu iraaayi lupapatiru lumu lwa shiwumbi gwa pili lushinkuliti shibambaza uwega umonga wa shumba na lupapatiru lya pili lushinkula shiwumbi sha kwanja pakati pa shumba. <verse eid="2CH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 3:13" />Utali wa mbapatiru mbili za viwumbi wawili awa uweriti handa mita msheshi na nusu. Wagolokiti pawalola kulijeleri likulu. <verse eid="2CH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 3:14" />Kanyawiti lipaziya lya nguwu nfufu iherepa yawasoniti kwa ubunda wa buluwu na zambalawu na njeri. Lipaziya ali lilembeziwitwi weli kwa viwumbi vyana mbapatiru kwa ubunda ulaauli.<verse eid="2CH 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mpanda mbili za shaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 7:15-22">1 Wafalumi 7:15-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 3:15" />Mfalumi Selemani kanyawiti mpanda mbili za shaba, kila yimu iweriti na mita lilongu limu na mhanu na nusu, kazituliti kulongolu kwa Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu. Kila lupanda lumu luweriti na lijenjeri pampindi pakuyi lwana utali wa handa mita mbili na nusu. <verse eid="2CH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 3:16" />Kanyawiti mikufu na kuyitula pampindi pa mpanda azi. Shakapanu kasongola mabwajubwaju ga makomamanga miya na kagatula pampindi pamikufu ayi. <verse eid="2CH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 3:17" />Kazigolosiyiti mpanda azi palongolu pa Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu, yimu uwega wa kusika na imonga uwega wa kushana. Mpanda ilii ya uwega wa kusika kayishemiti Yakini na ilii ya uwega wa kushana kayishemiti Bowazi.<verse eid="2CH 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CH 4" />
  <para style="s">Vintu mu Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 7:23-51">1 Wafalumi 7:23-51</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 4:1" />Mfalumi Selemani kanyawiti shitalawanda sha shaba, shiweriti na utali wa mita tisa na upana mita tisa na kugenda pampindi mita msheshi na nusu. <verse eid="2CH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 4:2" />Shakapanu kanyawiti vulu, yana upana wa mita msheshi na nusu kulawa uwega umu mpaka uwega umonga na kwa kugenda pasi mita mbili na robu na upana wa mzyengetu mita kumi na tatu na nusu. <verse eid="2CH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 4:3" />Pasi pa ukingu kuzyengeta vulu ayi, wapondangiti vinyagu vya wang'ombi shipalu waweriti migenderanu, mgenderanu gumu pa gumonga. Mahepeziya aga gatenditwi pamuhera na seemu zimonga za vulu ayi. <verse eid="2CH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 4:4" />Na vulu ayi ituritwi pampindi pa vinyagu vya wang'ombi shipalu lilongu na mbili wa shaba, watatu walola kushana na watatu kusika walola kwaguzyeta mshenji, watatu kwagulawa mashenji. <verse eid="2CH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 4:5" />Unenepa wa ukingu wakuyi uweriti sentimeta saba na nusu. Ukingu wakuyi uweriti gambira ukingu wa shikombi na gambira uluwa wa ungalangala. Vulu azi zingira mashi lita elufu sitini. <verse eid="2CH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 4:6" />Viraavirii kanyawiti mabeseni lilongu ga kugululira vinofu vya nyama yavitenderitwi mutambiku za kulunguziwa. Mabeseni aga, mhanu kagatuliti kusika mwa Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu na mhanu kagatula kushana mwa Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu. Vulu nkulu ilii iweriti wankunawira watambika.<verse eid="2CH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 4:7" />Shakapanu kanyawiti vintambi lilongu vya zahabu ntambu yakalagaliritwi, kavituli palijeleri lya Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu, mhanu kazituliti uwega wa kusika mwa Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu na muhanu zimonga kazituliti uwega wa kushana. <verse eid="2CH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 4:8" />Shakapanu kanyawiti viraa meza lilongu, kazituliti palijeleri lya Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu mhanu uwega wa kumliwu na mhanu uwega wa kumshigi. Shakapanu kanyawiti mabeseni miya ga zahabu.<verse eid="2CH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 4:9" />Kanyawiti lijeleri lya mngati lya watambika na lijenjeri limonga likulu lya kunja na migomi ya ligeleri lyeni kayimatika kwa shaba, <verse eid="2CH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 4:10" />na vulu ilii kayituliti pashisoku sha kusika kwagulawa mshenji mwa Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu ayi.<verse eid="2CH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 4:11" />Huramu viraavirii kanyawiti viwiga na visomeru na mabeseni. Hangu ndo ntambu yakamaliriti lihengu lyakapananitwi na mfalumi Selemani kalitendi Munumba Nkulu ya Mlungu, <verse eid="2CH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 4:12" />mpanda mbili na mabeseni mawili gawera pampindi pa mpanda, nyavu mbili za kuherepiziya mituwi miwili ayi yayiweriti pampindi pa mpanda, <verse eid="2CH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 4:13" />viraa kuweriti na mishoru ya uluwa ga mabwajubwaju yagashemwa mikomamanga miya msheshi kwajili ya nyavu mbili azi, mishoru ya uluwa wa mabwajubwaju yagashemwa makomamanga aga gaweriti mumisitari miwili mukila wavu, su kuherepiziya mabeseni galii mawili ga majenjeri yagaweriti pampindi pakila mpanda, <verse eid="2CH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 4:14" />viraavirii kanyawiti matololi lilongu ga kupapila mabeseni gakuyi lilongu, <verse eid="2CH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 4:15" />na mabeseni galii yashemitwi baali na vinyagu vya wang'ombi shipalu lilongu na mbili pasi pa mabeseni aga, <verse eid="2CH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 4:16" />shakapanu kanyawa viwiga na mabeseni na visomeru na vyombu vimonga vyoseri vya Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu. Huramu Abi kamyawiriti mfalumi Selemani vintu vyaviweriti vya shaba yayikuwitwi.<verse eid="2CH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 4:17" />Vintu vyoseri avi mfalumi kavinyawiti kululanda lwa Yoridani, pahala pa litapaka lya ukaka lyaliweriti pakati pa Sukoti na Sereda. <verse eid="2CH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 4:18" />Selemani kavinyawiti vyombu vivuwa nentu, hangu uzotopa wa shaba yayitendiritwi kunyawira vintu vyoseri avi imanikandiri.<verse eid="2CH 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 4:19" />Viraavirii Selemani kanyawiti vintu vyoseri vyaviweriti Munumba Nkulu ya Mlungu, shitawanda sha zahabu na meza ya zahabu yakutulira mabumunda mananagala, <verse eid="2CH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 4:20" />vintambi vya vikoloboyi vya zahabu iherepa za kulangalira palongolu pa pahala Pananagala nentu ntambu yayilagaliritwi, <verse eid="2CH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 4:21" />mishoru ya uluwa na vikoloboyi na kolewu, vilavilii viweriti vya zahabu iherepa nentu, <verse eid="2CH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 4:22" />mikasi na mabeseni na masiniya ga kutumiziya ubani na vipalira motu na migomi ya pahala Pananagala nentu na ligomi lyakwingilira Kunumba Nkulu ya Mlungu. Vyoseri avi vinyawitwi kwa zahabu iherepa nentu.<verse eid="2CH 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 5:1" />Hangu mfalumi Selemani kamaliriti lihengu lyoseri lya Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu. Shakapanu Selemani kajega vintu vyoseri vyeni Dawuda tati gwakuyi kaweriti kavilaviya kwa Mlungu. Vintu avi ndo, feza na zahabu na vyombu vivuwa, kavitula muluhanja lya Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu.<verse eid="2CH 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lisandiku lya Lipatanu lyangujegwa mu Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 8:1-9">1 Wafalumi 8:1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 5:2" />Shakapanu mfalumi Selemani kawashema aku Yerusalemu wakulu woseri wa makabira na nkolu za Israeli walijegi lisanduku lya lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu kulawa mulushi lwa Dawudi, lweni lushemwa Siyoni kulijega Kunumba Nkulu ya Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 5:3" />Wantu woseri wa Israeli waliwoniti kulongolu kwa mfalumi mumsambu gwa mwezi gwa saba. <verse eid="2CH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 5:4" />Walonguziya woseri wa Israeli pawasokiti, Walawi wapapiti lisanduku lya lipatanu. <verse eid="2CH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 5:5" />Walawi na watambika walihamiziyiti Lisanduku lya Lipatanu na Liringu Linanagali na vyombu Vinanagala vyoseri vyaviweriti mliringu amu. <verse eid="2CH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 5:6" />Mfalumi Selemani na shipinga sha Israeli wajonjonikiti kulongolu Kulisanduku lya Lipatanu shakapanu walaviyiti tambiku za wang'ombi na wakondolu yawawalangikandiri. <verse eid="2CH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 5:7" />Shakapanu watambika waliyingiziya Lisanduku lya Lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu pahala pakuyi, mshumba sha kati sha numba, pahala Pananagala nentu, walituliti pasi pa mbapatiru za viwumbi virii. <verse eid="2CH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 5:8" />Viwumbi walii wana mbapatiru wayalikiti mbapatiru zawu pampindi papatulitwi lisandiku, hangu lisanduku na mipiku ya kujegera iweriti pasi pa mbapatiru. <verse eid="2CH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 5:9" />Toziya mipiku ayi iweriti mitali nentu, mpeleru zakuyi ziweziti kuwoneka kulawa Pahala Pananagala kulongolu kwa shumba sha mngati, kumbiti isinditi kuwoneka kulawa uwega wa kunja. Mipiku ayi yakali pahala panu mpaka leru. <verse eid="2CH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 5:10" />Kwanitindiri na shintu mngati mwa lisanduku lya lipatanu, ila kuweriti vibawu viwili virii vya mabuwi vyeni Musa kavituliti amu kulii kulugongu Horebu, pahala Mtuwa Mlungu pakatenditi lipatanu na wantu wa Israeli pawalawiti Misri.<verse eid="2CH 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uweru wa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 5:11" />Shakapanu Watambika walawa Pahala Pananagala palii, toziya watambika woseri yawaweriti palii pota kulishera vipinga vyawu, waweriti walitakasiya, <verse eid="2CH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 5:12" />Walawi woseri wawera wakwimba, pakawera Asafu, Hemani na Yedutuni pamuhera na Walawi na wana wawu wapalu na walongu wawu, pawawera wavala nguwu zawu nfufu ziherepa ugawu pawapapa matowazi na vinanda na vinubi, wagolokiti uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji mushitalawanda. Watambika miya ishilini yawaweriti wankugomba lipenga waweriti pamuhera na womberi. <verse eid="2CH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 5:13" />Wimba, pawafatwa na maziwu yagalinganira ga mapenga, matowazi na vyombu vimonga vya msambu, wamzyumi Mtuwa Mlungu kwa kwimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CH 5:13">“Toziya yomberi ndo muheri</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CH 5:13">na mafiru gakuyi gahera upeleru.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 5:13">Shaka ashi numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu imemiziwitwi liwundi. <verse eid="2CH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 5:14" />Watambika wasinditi kutenda mahengu gawu amu toziya ya liwundu ali na uweru wa Mlungu umemiziwa munumba ya Mlungu.<verse eid="2CH 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CH 6" />
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Selemani kankuwabwelera wantu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 8:12-21">1 Wafalumi 8:12-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 6:1" />Shakapanu mfalumi Selemani kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CH 6:1">“Mtuwa Mlungu, kalongiti kuwera</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CH 6:1">hakalikali muluwindu totolu.<verse eid="2CH 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 6:2" />Nakaka nikunyawira numba Nanagala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CH 6:2">pahala pakulikala gwenga mashaka goseri.”<verse eid="2CH 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 6:3" />Shakapanu mfalumi kawagalambukiriti wantu woseri wa Israeli pawawera wagoloka, kawatekelera. <verse eid="2CH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 6:4" />Kalongiti, “Kakwiswi Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, toziya kwa likakala lyakuyi katenda shakamgambiriti tati gwangu Dawudi. <verse eid="2CH 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 6:5" />Pakalonga, kwanjira mashaka galii niwawusiyi wantu waneni kulawa muisi ya Misri, nsyagulitindiri mji goseri mumakabila ga Israeli su wanyawiri numba ya kunguwira neni na syagulitindiri muntu yoseri kaweri mkulu gwa wantu waneni Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 6:6" />Kumbiti nigusyagula mji gwa Yerusalemu guweri mji gweni hanguwirwi na nimsyagula Dawudi kawakolimlima wantu waneni Israeli.”<verse eid="2CH 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 6:7" />“Hangu, tati gwangu Dawudi kafiliti kunyawa numba ya kuguwirwa Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 6:8" />Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti tati gwangu Dawudi, toziya mlandu gwa kunyawira neni Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu guweriti mumoyu mwaku ndo iherepa kufira kutenda hangu. <verse eid="2CH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 6:9" />Kumbiti gwengandiri hagunyawi numba ayi, ila gwakuinyawa numba ayi ndo mwana gwaku yagumwiwula gamweni.”<verse eid="2CH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 6:10" />“Vinu Mtuwa Mlungu katenda shilii shakatakuliti, toziya neni wera mfalumi pahala pa tati gwangu Dawudi na nishikalira shiti sha ufalumi sha Israeli ntambu yakalongiti Mtuwa Mlungu, shakapanu hanyawi numba yakumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 6:11" />Munumba Nkulu ya Mlungu amu ntula Lisanduku lya Lipatanu, lyeni mngati mwakuyi kwana lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu lyakalitenditi na wantu wa Israeli.”<verse eid="2CH 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Selemani kankumluwa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 8:22-53">1 Wafalumi 8:22-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 6:12" />Shakapanu, Selemani kagolokiti kulongolu kushitalawanda sha Mtuwa Mlungu na kulongolu kushipinga shoseri sha wantu wa Israeli, kanyasuliti mawoku gakuyi pampindi na kuluwa. <verse eid="2CH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 6:13" />Selemani kaweriti kanyawa shintambi sha shaba. Utali na upana wakuyi uweriti mita mbili na robu na kugenda kumpindi uweriti mita yimu na robu. Kashituliti shintambi ashi pakati pa shiwanja. Kakweniti kushintambi na kusuntamala kulongolu kushipinga shoseri sha Israeli, kanyasuliti mawoku gakuyi pampindi. <verse eid="2CH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 6:14" />Kalonga, “Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, kwahera Mlungu yumonga handa gwenga kumpindi ama pasipanu. Gwenga ndo Mlungu gwaminika toziya kutenda lipatanu lyaku na guwalanguziya mafiliru gaku wantumintumi waku yawalikala pawakujimira kwa moyu gwawu goseri. <verse eid="2CH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 6:15" />Nakaka gutenda shagutakuliti kwa ntumintumi gwaku tati gwangu Dawudi, kwa mlomu gwaku gwagutakuliti na kwa liwoku lyaku gutenda ntambu yayiwera leru.”<verse eid="2CH 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 6:16" />Vinu, gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, “Nikuluwa viraa gutendi shilii shagumgambiriti ntumintumi gwakuyi Dawudi tati gwangu, palii pagulongiti, mashaka goseri haguweri na mwiwuka gwa kulikala mshiti sha ufulumi sha Israeli, payiwera shiyiwuku shaku pawafata kwa waminika mukila shintu shawashitenditi handa gwenga ntambu yagutenditi. <verse eid="2CH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 6:17" />Vinu, gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, nikuluwa gutendi goseri gagumgambiriti ntumintumi gwaku Dawudi.”<verse eid="2CH 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 6:18" />“Kumbiti, gwee Mlungu, hashi nakaka hagulikali na wantu pasipanu? Ata mpindi zyeni, pota mpindi za kumpindi nentu zikutosheyandiri, hayiweri hashi Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu ayi yanikunyawira hayikutosiyi? <verse eid="2CH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 6:19" />Ata hangu, gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwangu, neni ntumintumi gwaku. Nikuluwa gumpikiniri na gutendi ganikuluwa leru. <verse eid="2CH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 6:20" />Guyiloleri Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu ayi paluwala na pashiru, pahala peni gusyagula wantu waku hawakuguwili. Gumpikaniri neni ntumintumi gwaku paniza panu kukuguwira. <verse eid="2CH 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 6:21" />Gupikanili shanikuluwa neni ntumintumi gwaku na shawakuluwa wantu waku Israeli pawaluwa agawu pawalola pahala panu. Gupikanili gatuluwa kulawa kumpindi na pagupikanirakala gutulekeziyi vidoda vyetu.”<verse eid="2CH 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 6:22" />“Muntu pakamtendera vidoda muyaguyi na pakajegwa kapati kulirapa palongolu pa shitalawanda shaku Mnumba Nkulu ya Mlungu ayi na pakalirapa kahera likosa, <verse eid="2CH 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 6:23" />su gupikanili kulawa kumpindi aku, nakuwatoza wantumintumi waku. Muntu yakawera na likosa gumtozi kwa likosa lyakuyi, muntu yakahera likosa gumleki na gumpanani lifupu kulawirana na waminika wakuyi.”<verse eid="2CH 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 6:24" />“Wantu waku Israeli pawakomangwa na wankondu wawu, toziya ya vidoda vyawatendiriti na womberi pawalonga woya vidoda kwa gwenga na kukuyira gwenga na pawaluwa kulekiziwa na gwenga guwalekeziyi vidoda vyawu Munumba Nkulu ya Mlungu ayi, <verse eid="2CH 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 6:25" />su, gupikanili kulawa kumpindi aku. Gulegiziyi vidoda vyawu na guwawuziyi muisi yaguwapananiti womberi na wambuyi wawu.”<verse eid="2CH 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 6:26" />“Mvula payitowandiri toziya watenda vidoda na pawaluwa agawu pawalola pahala panu na kulijimira litawu lyaku, shakapanu pawaleka vidoda vyawu, pawaluwa, <verse eid="2CH 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 6:27" />guwapikaniri kulawa kumpindi aku na guwalekeziyi vidoda vyawu wantumintumi waku wantu waku wa Israeli, agawu paguwafunda kufata njira yaku iherepa na gutowi mvula muisi yaku ayi yeni guwapanana wantu waku iweri lunda yawu.”<verse eid="2CH 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 6:28" />“Handa pasipanu kwana njala ama ulweri wa tawuni ama kuyuma ama ulweli wa vimeru, ama wanjombi ama vikwitakwita ama payiwera wantu waku wazyengetwa na wankondu wawu mumji gwawu goseri gulii, payiwera kwana likomangu lyoseri ama ulweli woseri, <verse eid="2CH 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 6:29" />shondi gupikinili maluwa ga muntu yoseri ama wantu waku woseri wa Israeli, kila muntu pakavimana ntabika yakuyi na hinginika yakuyi pakakuluwa agawu pakatalipiyiti mawoku gakuyi kulola Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu ayi. <verse eid="2CH 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 6:30" />Su, gupikanili kulawa kumpindi kwaku. Guwalekeziyi vidoda, viraa gumtenderi kila muntu ntambu yakafiruwa kutenderwa, toziya ndo gwenga hera yagugamana maholu gamumoyu mwa wantu woseri. <verse eid="2CH 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 6:31" />Hangu hawakujimili na kuzigendera njira zaku shaka shoseri pawalikala muisi yaguwapananiti wambuyi wetu.”<verse eid="2CH 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 6:32" />“Ntambu iraayi shaka muntu mhenga yakalawira muwamu mwa wantu waku Israeli hakizi kuluwa munumba ayi kulawa isi ya kutali toziya kapikanira ukulu waku na likakala lyaku, shakapanu kizi na kuluwa Kunumba Nkulu ya Mlungu ayi, <verse eid="2CH 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 6:33" />nikuluwa gumupikaniri kulawa kumpindi na gumpanani mhenga ayu shoseri shakakuluwa su wantu woseri pasipanu wakumani na kukujimira ntambu yawatenda wantu waku wa Israeli na viraavirii wavimana handa Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu ayi yanyawiti ndo yakumguwira.”<verse eid="2CH 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 6:34" />“Wantu waku pawagenda munkondu kulikomanga na wankondu wawu, poseri paguwajega munkondu na womberi pawakuluwa agawu pawalola mji agu yagusyaguliti na Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu yanyawiti kwajili ya litawu lyaku, <verse eid="2CH 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 6:35" />nikuluwa gupikinili galii gawakuluwa paguwera kumpindi aku na guwapanani ukanka nkondu aku.”<verse eid="2CH 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 6:36" />“Shaka wantu pawakutendera vidoda, toziya kwahera muntu yakatendandiri vidoda na paguwakalalira na kuwaleka wakomangwi na wankondu wawu, mpaka wajegwi lopola mpaka isi ya kutali ama ya pakwegera: <verse eid="2CH 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2CH 6:37" />handa pawawera aku kuluhamira hawaliwuyi kwa rohu yawu yoseri na kuleka vidoda na kuluwa walekiziwi vidoda vyawu, pawalonga, tutendera vidoda na twenga twagamira nakamu tutenda makontola, <verse eid="2CH 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2CH 6:38" />handa pawaleka vidoda kwa moyu gwawu goseri na kwa rohu yawu yoseri pawawera muluhamira na handa hawakuluwi pawalola isi yawu, isi yaguwapananiti wambuyi wawu, mji agu yagugusyaguliti na Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu yaniyinyawiti kwajili yaku: <verse eid="2CH 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2CH 6:39" />shondi gupikanili kumpindi aku kwaguwera gupikinili galii gawaluwa na guwapanani teratera ntambu yagufira, guwalekeziyi wantu waku weni wakutendera vidoda.”<verse eid="2CH 6:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2CH 6:40" />“Vinu gwee Mlungu gwangu, gutuloli na gwanki maluwa gatuluwa pahala panu. <verse eid="2CH 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="2CH 6:41" />Vinu gugoloki gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, gwingili pahala paku pa koyera gwenga pamuhela na lisanduku lya lipatanu lya makakala gaku. Watambika waku gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, wapati ulopola na wananagala waku wanemeleri uheri waku. <verse eid="2CH 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="2CH 6:42" />Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, nagumlema mswagwa lipaki gwaku. Guholi ufiru waku kwa ntumintumi gwaku Dawudi.”<verse eid="2CH 6:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CH 7" />
  <para style="s">Numba nkulu ya Mlungu yankulumikwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 8:62-66">1 Wafalumi 8:62-66</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 7:1" />Mfalumi Selemani pakamaliliti kuluwa kwakuyi, motu gusulukiti kulawa kumpindi na gulunguziyiti nakamu vintu vyavilaviwitwi na tambiku za kulunguziwa, shakapanu uweru wa Mtuwa Mlungu umemiziya Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 7:2" />Toziya uweru wa Mlungu umemiti Munumba Nkulu ya Mlungu ayi, watambika wasinditi kwingira amu. <verse eid="2CH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 7:3" />“Wantu woseri wa Israeli pawawoniti motu gusuluka kulawa kumpindi na uweru wa Mtuwa Mlungu umemiziya Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu ayi, wasuntamaliti makukama, wamguwira na kulonga mayagashii Mtuwa Mlungu, pawalonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 7:3">toziya yomberi ndo muheri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 7:3">na Ufiru wakuyi ulikala mashaka goseri.” <verse eid="2CH 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 7:4" />Shakapanu mfalumi Selemani na wantu woseri wamlaviliriti Mlungu tambiku. <verse eid="2CH 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 7:5" />Na Selemani kamlaviliriti Mtuwa Mlungu, wang'ombi elufu ishilini na mbili na wakondolu laki yimu na elufu ishilini. Hangu ndo Selemani na wantu wakuyi ntambu yawailumikiti Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 7:6" />Watambika wagolokiti pahala peni pawalagaliritwi kugoloka na Walawi wagolokiti pawawera na vyombu vya msambu vya Mtuwa Mlungu vyakanyawiti mfalumi Dawudi kwajili ya kulonga mayagashi Mtuwa Mlungu. Shakapanu wimbiti, “Toziya ufiru wakuyi wa mashaka goseri!” Ntambu yakawalagaliriti Dawudi. Watambika wagombiti mapenga aku Waisraeli woseri pawaweri wagoloka.<verse eid="2CH 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 7:7" />Mfalumi Selemani kalulumika luwaga lwaliweriti kulongolu Kunumba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu, toziya peni ndo pakalaviyiti tambiku za kulunguziwa ya mabenangu na lipaki na tambiku za ponga toziya pashitalawanda sha shaba patoshayandiri kwa tambiku zoseri azi.<verse eid="2CH 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 7:8" />Hangu Selemani kwa shaka sha mashaka saba katenditi msambu gwa mabenangu pamuhera na lijojoniku likulu lya wantu woseri wa Israeli wantu walawiti Lebo Hamati uwega wa kushana mpaka lushemba lwa Misri. <verse eid="2CH 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 7:9" />Mulishaka lya nani, wajojonikiti kutenda guwira ya gweka pamashaka saba zyawatenderiti kutakasiya meza ya malaviwu na shakapanu waweriti na mashaka saba gamonga ga msambu, <verse eid="2CH 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 7:10" />Mulishaka lya ishilini na tatu lya mwezi gwa saba, mfalumi Selemani kawagambiriti kwaheri wantu wagendi ukaya kwawu, pawanemelera na kukalamuka mumoyu mwawu toziya ya maheri geni Mtuwa Mlungu kawapananiti Dawudi na wantu wakuyi Israeli.<verse eid="2CH 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlungu kankumlawira kayi Selemani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 9:1-9">1 Wafalumi 9:1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 7:11" />Su, mfalumi Selemani kamaliliti kunyawa Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu na liboma, kafanikiwiti kutenda goseri galii gakafiriti kuyitendera Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu na liboma. <verse eid="2CH 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 7:12" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamlawiliti Selemani pashiru, kamgambira “Mpikanira luwa yaku na nipasyagula pahala panu paweli Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu ya kundavilira tambiku. <verse eid="2CH 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 7:13" />Paniwima mvula ama paniwajegera wanjombi walii vimeru vyawu ama pawagapata malweri makulu, <verse eid="2CH 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 7:14" />handa wantu waneni yawashemwa kwa litawu lyangu pawalinanagaziya na pawaluwa na pawansakula na kuleka njila zawu zidoda, su, neni haniwapikanili kulawa kumpindi, haniwalekezi vidoda zawu na kuyinemeziya isi yawu. <verse eid="2CH 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 7:15" />Vinu haniyiloleli Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu ayi na kupikanira maluwa yagatendeka pahala panu, <verse eid="2CH 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 7:16" />niyisyagula na kuyitakasiya Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu ayi su wantu waneni wanguwiri neni panu mashaka goseli. Haniyiloleli na kuyifira mashaka goseli. <verse eid="2CH 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 7:17" />Na gwenga, handa paguntendera kwa uwaminika ntambu yakatenditi tati gwaku Dawudi, pagutenda goseli ganikugambiriti na kugajimira, <verse eid="2CH 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 7:18" />na neni hanishigangamiziyi shiti shaku sha ufalumi ntambu yantenditi lipatanu na tati gwaku Dawudi, palii panimugambiriti, hapeni gukosi muntu gwa kukolamlima israeli. <verse eid="2CH 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 7:19" />Kumbiti pamleka kunfanta, na kuleka lagiru zyangu zyaniwapananiti na amuri zyaniwapananiti na kugenda kuwatendera wamlungu wamonga na kuwaguwira, <verse eid="2CH 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 7:20" />toziya ayi neni haniwalaviyi kulawa isi ayi yaniwapananiti. Viraavirii na Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu yeni ayi niyilumika kwajili yangu haniyilemi na kuyitenda shintu sha kujongelwa na kubeziwa na wantu wa isi zoseri.”<verse eid="2CH 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 7:21" />“Na kwa Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu ayi nkwisuwa, kila yakapita pakwegera hakalilimuki na kukosiya, ntambugaa Mtuwa Mlungu katenda hangu kwa wantu awa na kwa numba ayi? <verse eid="2CH 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 7:22" />Wantu wamonga hawankuli, toziya wamlekiti Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa wambuyi wawu yakawalaviyiti muisi ya Misri, walikolelana na wamlungu wamonga, wayiguwira na kuyitendera. Hangu Mtuwa Mlungu kawajegela matenduwa goseri aga.”<verse eid="2CH 7:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CH 8" />
  <para style="s">Mpatiru zyamonga za Selemani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 9:10-28">1 Wafalumi 9:10-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 8:1" />Mivinja ishilini, yeni Selemani kanyawiti Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu na liboma payipititikala, <verse eid="2CH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 8:2" />Selemani kayinyawiti syayi miji yakapananitwi na Huramu, shakapanu kawapanana Waisraeli miji ayi walikali amu. <verse eid="2CH 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 8:3" />Shakapanu Selemani kagenditi Hamati Zoba na kugulopola mji agu, <verse eid="2CH 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 8:4" />na kagunyawa mji gwa Tadimori aku kushiwala. Kainyawiti syayi miji ya Hamati yayiweriti hanja. <verse eid="2CH 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 8:5" />Viraavirii Selemani kanyawiti miji ayi: Beteli Horoni ya uwega wa pampindi na Beti Horoni ya uwega wa pasi, miji yana maboma, vibambaza na migomi mikulu yayiwera na ngwiniliziwu, <verse eid="2CH 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 8:6" />mji gwa Baalati na miji yakuyi yoseri ya hanja, mbutuka zakuyi za kukwegwa na farasi wakuyi na shoseri shakafiliti kunyawa mu Yerusalemu, Lebanoni ama kumonga mu ufalumi wakuyi. <verse eid="2CH 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 8:7" />Wantu wamonga woseri yawawera ndiri Waisraeli yawasigaliti muwamu mwa Wahiti na Waamoni na Waperizi na Wahivi na Wayebusi, <verse eid="2CH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 8:8" />Viraavirii wiwuka wawu weni Waisraeli wawaagamiziyandiri, Selemani kawatendiziyiti mahengu ga kukakaniziya na hangu ndo ntambu yawatenda mpaka vinu. <verse eid="2CH 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 8:9" />Kumbiti muwamu mwa wantu wa israeli, Selemani kamtendandiri muntu yoseri kuwela mmanda kwaajili ya lihengu lyakuyi, Waisraeli waweliti mashonta na kawatenda kuwera wakulu wa mashonta wakuyi na wakulu wa mbutuka zakuyi za kukwega na farasi na wakwena farasi wakuyi. <verse eid="2CH 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 8:10" />Ayi ndo walanga ya wagolekera wakulu yakawatuliti mfalumi Selemani: Waweliti miya mbili na hamsini, yawaweliti wankuwalonguziya wantu.<verse eid="2CH 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 8:11" />Selemani kamwamisiya mhinga Farao mfalumi gwa Misri, kulawa mji gwa Dawudi, kamjega kunumba yakamnyawiliti. Kalongiti, “Mdala gwangu hapeni kalikali munumba ya Dawudi mfalumi gwa Israeli toziya pahala poseri lisanduku lya Mtuwa Mlungu liweliti pahala panu ndo pananagala.”<verse eid="2CH 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 8:12" />Selemani kamlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku ya kulunguziya torosu pampindi pa shitalawanda shakamnyawiriti Mtuwa Mlungu kulongolu kumdamu gwa numba nkulu ya Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 8:13" />Kalaviyiti tambiku azi ntambu yakalagaliritwi na Musa kila lishaka nanagala zyeni ndo, msambu gwa lyezi kulawa na misambu mitatu ya kila shinja yeni ndo msambu gwa mabumunda yagalekerwandiri simika, msambu gwa majuma na msambu gwa visasa. <verse eid="2CH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 8:14" />Kafata malagalira ga Dawudi tati gwakuyi, kapangiti zamu za kila lishaka za watambika na za Walawi pawalitanga watambika kukwisa na kugatenda mahengu gawu. Viraa kawatula walolela kumigomi yoseri, toziya ndo ntambu yakalagaliriti Dawudi, muntu gwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 8:15" />Womberi wagalekandiri malagaliru ga mfalumi Dawudi gakawagambiliti watambika na Walawi kuusu mlandu goseri na kuusu luhanja.<verse eid="2CH 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 8:16" />Mahengu goseri ga Selemani gakatenditi gapera kwanjira libuwi lya liyanjiru lya numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu mpaka payimalilikiti kunyawiwa. Hangu numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu imalilikiti.<verse eid="2CH 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 8:17" />Shakapanu Selemani kagenditi Esioni Geberi na Eloti yayiweriti kumpwani mwa isi ya Edomu. <verse eid="2CH 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 8:18" />Huramu kamjegeliti meri yazilongoziwitwi na wakulu wa meri wakuyi na wantu yawamana mirandu ya bahari. Womberi pamuhera na wamashonta wa Selemani, wagenditi mpaka Ofiri na kulawa aku watoliti zahabu, wamjegela mfalumi Selemani kilu elufu lilongu na mhanu.<verse eid="2CH 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CH 9" />
  <para style="s">Malikiya gwa Sheba kankumtyangira Selemani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 10:1-10">1 Wafalumi 10:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 9:1" />Malikiya gwa Sheba pakapikaniliti zyuma za Selemani, kagenditi Yerusalemu su kumjela Selemani kwa makosiwu makamala. Kalilongoziyiti na wantumintumi wakuyi, pamuhela na ngamiya yawapapiti utuli, zahabu zivuwa nentu na mabuwi ga beyi nkulu. Na pakasokiti kwa Selemani, Kamkosiya makosiyu ga mirandu yoseri yayiweliti mumoyu mwakuyi. <verse eid="2CH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 9:2" />Selemani kagankula makosiyu goseri, pakaweritindiri na mlandu goseri gwakasinditi kumgambira. <verse eid="2CH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 9:3" />Malikiya gwa Sheba pakawoniti luhala lwa Selemani na Numba zyakakaweliti kazinyawa, <verse eid="2CH 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 9:4" />kayi pakaloliti shiboga shashitanditwi pameza pakuyi na kuwona wakulu yawaweriti pasi pa Selemani ntambu yawakaliti pameza na wantumintumi wakuyi ntambu yawamtenderiti na ntambu yawavaliti na ntambu yawampananiti vyakulanda ntambu yawalaviyiti tambiku za kulunguziya torosu zyakazilaviyiti Selemani Munumba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu, pakawoniti goseri kalikangasha nentu.<verse eid="2CH 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 9:5" />Su, kamgambira mfalumi, “Goseri gampikiniliti muisi mwangu kwajili ya mahengu gaku na luhala lwaku vyoseri ndo vya nakaka! <verse eid="2CH 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 9:6" />Kumbiti nsinditi kujimira visoweru vyawu mpaka pansokiti na kuliwonera namweni na vinu ng'ambilitwi shididini hera, luhala lyaku na ukulu waku ndo nentu ya galii gampikiniriti. <verse eid="2CH 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 9:7" />Mbaka wantu waku! Mbaka wakulu wa mashonta waku weni wagoloka kulongolu kwaku na kupikanira luhala lwaku! <verse eid="2CH 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 9:8" />Kazyumwi Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu waku, mweni kafiliziwa na gwenga, kakutula pashiti shakuyi sha ufalumi, guweli mfalumi gukoli pahala pa Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwaku. Toziya ya Mlungu gwaku kawafira Waisraeli na kuwagangamaziya mashaka goseri, kakutula gwenga guweri mfalumi gwawu su gwenderezi yagafiruwa na yagawera maheri.”<verse eid="2CH 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 9:9" />Shakapanu kampananiti mfalumi nentu ya kilu elufu msheshi za zahabu na sha utuli uvuwa nentu na mabuwi ga beyi nkulu. Hakweni lawili utuli handa awu malikiya gwa Sheba kampananiti mfalumi Selemani.<verse eid="2CH 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 9:10" />Ntambu iraa, wantumintumi wa Huramu pamuhela na wantumintumi wa Selemani yawajegiti zahabu kulawa Ofiri, wajegiti viraa mbawu ziherepa na mabuwi ga beyi nkulu. <verse eid="2CH 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 9:11" />Selemani katenderiti mbawu ziherepa azi kunyawara nkweneru za numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu na liboma na viraavirii kanyawiti vinubi na malimba ga wimba. Vintu handa avi havyeniwoneka nakamu muisi ya Yuda.<verse eid="2CH 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 9:12" />Mfalumi Selemani kampananiti malikiya gwa Sheba kila shintu shakafiliti na kampananiti nentu kutali na vintu vyakamjegeliti mfalumi. Shakapanu malikiya kawukiti kawuya muisi yakuyi pakawera pamuhela na wantumintumi wakuyi.<verse eid="2CH 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lunda za mfalumi Selemani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 10:14-25">1 Wafalumi 10:14-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 9:13" />Kila shinja, Selemani kajegeritwi zahabu handa kilu elufu ishilini na tatu, <verse eid="2CH 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 9:14" />paguleka vintu vimonga na zahabu yakajegiti kulawa kwa yawatenda biyashala na washuwuzi. Villavirii wafalumi woseri wa Arabiya na wakulu wa wakolamlima wamjegeliti Selemani feza na zahabu. <verse eid="2CH 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 9:15" />Mfalumi Selemani kanyawiti ngawu nkulu miya mbili za zahabu yayiponditwi, kila ngawu iweriti imatikwa zahabu handa kilu saba. <verse eid="2CH 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 9:16" />Viraa kanyawiti ngawu ndidikandidika miya tatu, kila yimu ityeremikitwi zahabu yayiwera handa kilu ntatu, shakapanu mfalumi kazitula muliboma lyaliweriti kulidowi lya Lebanoni.<verse eid="2CH 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 9:17" />Viraavirii mfalumi kanyawiti shiti sha ukulu kwa kutendera kumelemetiziwa magoli ga ndembu na kashimatikira kwa zahabu ihelepa nentu. <verse eid="2CH 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 9:18" />Shiti ashi shiweriti na gweneru sita na shiti sha zahabu sha kutulira magulu, vyoseri avi viweriti vikolaniziwa pamuhela na shiti ashi sha ufalumi na kila uwega kuweriti na pahala pa kutulira mawoku, shakapanu shiweriti na vinyagu viwili vya simba pakwegera na pahala pa kutulira mawoku. <verse eid="2CH 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 9:19" />Paweliti na vinyagu lilongu na mbili vya simba yawagolokiti pa upeleru pa kila gweneru. Shiti handa ashi hasheni nyawiwi na mfalumi yoseri.<verse eid="2CH 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 9:20" />Vikombi vyoseri vya mfalumi Selemani viweliti vya zahabu na vyombu vyoseri vyaviweliti muliboma lya kulidowi lya Lebanoni viweliti vya zahabu iherepa. Kuweriti kwahera shintu shashinyawitwi kwa madini ga feza toziya madini ga feza gawoneka kuwera shintundiri mushaka sha mfalumi Selemani. <verse eid="2CH 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 9:21" />Selemani kaweliti na meli zyaziweriti zyangugenda mpaka Tarishishi na wantumintumi wa Huramu na kila pavipita vinja vitatu, meli azi ziwuyiti pazimjegera zahabu na feza na magoli ga ndembu, wamayani na mpongu yawawashema tawusi.<verse eid="2CH 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 9:22" />Mfalumi Selemani kawapititi wafalumi woseri wa pasipanu kwa ulunda na kwa luhala. <verse eid="2CH 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 9:23" />Wafalumi wa isi zoseri waweriti wafiriti kumgendera Selemani su kupikanira luhala lyakuyi lwakapananitwi na Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 9:24" />Kila shinja yumu gwawu kamjegela mafupu aga mfalumi: vyombu vya madini ga feza na vya zahabu, nguwu na vintu vya kulikomangira nkondu na utuli na farasi na punda farasi.<verse eid="2CH 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 9:25" />Mfalumi Selemani kaweliti na visasa elufu msheshi vya kutulira farasi na mbutuka na mashonta yawakwena farasi elufi lilongu na mbili, weni kawatuliti mumiji yana pahala pa kutulira mbutuka za kukwegwa na farasi aku Yerusaremu. <verse eid="2CH 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 9:26" />Selemani kawakolitimlima wafalumi woseri yawaweliti kwanjira lushemba Eufarati, mpaka isi ya Wafiristi na Mpaka mumbaka na Misri <verse eid="2CH 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 9:27" />Su Selemani katenditi madini ga feza gawonekani handa shintundiri handa mabuwi aku Yerusalemu, mitera ya miyerezi kayitenditi kuwera ivuwa handa mikuyu yayiwera aku pasi pa lugongu lwa Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 9:28" />Selemani kajegelitwi farasi yawahemelitwi kulawa Misri na isi zimonga.<verse eid="2CH 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upeleru wa ukolamlima wa mfalumi Selemani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 11:41-43">1 Wafalumi 11:41-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 9:29" />Mirandu imonga yakatenditi mfalumi Selemani, kulawa lyanjiru mpaka upeleru, ilembitwi muvitabu vya visoweru vya mbuyi gwa Mlungu Natani, na mu umbuyi wa Ahiya gwa Shilu, na mu malola ga Ido mbuyi gwa Mlungu, viraavirii kana visoweru vya Yeroboamu mwana gwa Nebati. <verse eid="2CH 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 9:30" />Selemani kakolitimlima isi yoseri ya Israeli kwa vinja arobaini pakawera Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 9:31" />Shakapanu Selemani kahowiti na kufintirwa mumji gwa Dawudi, tati gwakuyi. Rehoboamu, mwana gwakuyi, kakolitimlima pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="2CH 9:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CH 10" />
  <para style="s">Makabila ga kushana wankumgalambuka Rehoboamu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 12:1-20">1 Wafalumi 12:1-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 10:1" />Shakapanu, Rehoboamu kagenditi Shekemu, aku Waisreili woseri waweliti wajojonika su kumtenda yomberi kaweli mfalumi. <verse eid="2CH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 10:2" />Na Yerubowamu mwana gwa Nebati pakapatiti visoweru vya mlandu agu kaweriti kankali kankulikala Misri kweni katugiliti kumtira Selemani, hangu kawuya kulawa Misri. <verse eid="2CH 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 10:3" />Kumbiti makabila ga kushana watumiti wantu kugenda kwa Rehoboamu kumshema. Woseri waweriti pamuhela wamgendera Rehoboamu na kumgambira, <verse eid="2CH 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 10:4" />“Tati gwaku katupananiti visanka vizotopa su gutupungulili visanka avi aga, natwenga hatukutenderi gwenga.”<verse eid="2CH 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 10:5" />Rehoboamu kawawankula, “Mgendi huti pashaka panu mashaka matatu muwuyi kayi.” Hangu wantu awa wawukiti.<verse eid="2CH 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 10:6" />Shakapanu, mfalumi Rehoboamu kafiliti wazewi wamgambi weni waweriti wamgambiziya Selemani tati gwakuyi, pakaweliti kankali mkomu, kawakosiya, “Su mng'ambiziyi niwapanani lyankulu gaa wantu awa?”<verse eid="2CH 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 10:7" />Wazewi awa wamwakula, “Paguwawonera lusungu wantu awa na pagufira kuwanemiziya na kutakula nawa visoweru vihelepa, panu hawaweri wantumintumi waku mashaka goseri.”<verse eid="2CH 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 10:8" />Kumbiti Rehoboamu kalemiti shakagambilitwi na wazewi na kagenda kuyowera na wantemba wayaguwi weni waweliti watakuziya wakuyi. <verse eid="2CH 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 10:9" />Shakapanu kawakosiya, “Mwenga mwankulaviya litakulu gaa su tuwezi kuwawankula wantu awa yawang'ambiriti, gupunguli visanka vyeni tati gwaku katupananiti?”<verse eid="2CH 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 10:10" />Wantemba walii yawaweriti pamuhera nayu wamwakula, “Wantu yawakugambiriti Tati gwaku katupapiziya visanka vizotopa, gutupungulili shisanka ashi, gwenga guwagambili hangu, shala shangu sha upeleru ndo shinenepa kuliku shunu sha tati gwangu. <verse eid="2CH 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 10:11" />Tati gwangu kawapapiziya visanka vizotopa, kumbiti neni haniwapapiziyi shisanka shizotopa kuliku avi. Tati gwangu kawakomiti kwa ntomontu, kumbiti neni haniwakomi kwa ntomontu zyana misontu.”<verse eid="2CH 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 10:12" />Mulishaka lya tatu Yerobowamu pamuhela na wantu walii wa makabila ga kushana wawuyiti kwa Rehoboamu ntambu yakawalagaliliti. <verse eid="2CH 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 10:13" />Rehoboamu kabeziya litakulu lyakapananitwi na wazewi na kawankula kwa kukalipa, <verse eid="2CH 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 10:14" />kulinganira na shilii shawamgambiriti wantemba wayaguyi kalonga, “Tati gwangu kawapapiziyiti visanka vizotopa, kumbiti neni haniwapapiziyi shisanka shizotopa kuliku ashi. Tati gwangu kawakomiti kwa ntomontu, kumbiti neni haniwakomi kwa ntomontu zyana misontu.” <verse eid="2CH 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 10:15" />Su mfalumi kawapikinirandiri wantu awa toziya mlandu agu gulawa kwa Mlungu su Mtuwa Mlungu kashitendi shisoweru shakuyi shakamgambiliti Yerebowamu, mwana gwa Nebati kwa kupitira Ahiya muntu kulawa mji gwa Shilu.<verse eid="2CH 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 10:16" />Kumbiti wantu wa makabila ga kushana pawawoniti handa mfalumi kalema kuwapikinira wamwankula hangu, “Twapamu ndiri na Dawudi? Twenga twahera uhala kwa mwana gwa Yese? Kila yumu kawuyi kuliringu lyakuyi, mwenga makabila ga kushana. Gwee Dawudi guyiloleri weri numba yaku gamweni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 10:16">Hangu wantu woseri wa Israeli wawuyiti kumalingu gawu. <verse eid="2CH 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 10:17" />Kumbiti Rehoboamu kakolitimlima wantu wa Israeli yawakaliti pahala pa mji gwa Yuda.<verse eid="2CH 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 10:18" />Shakapanu mfalumi Rehoboamu kamtumiti Hadoramu yakaweriti mgolokera gwa lihengu lya kukakanika, kumbiti wantu wa makabila ga kushana wamgumiti kwa mabuwi, wamlaga. Panu Rehebowamu pakakweniti mbutuka yakuyi katugira Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 10:19" />Su wantu wa makabila ga kushana walemiti kukolwamlima na lukolu lwa Dawudi mpaka leru.<verse eid="2CH 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CH 11" />
  <para style="s">Shemaya kankulaviya umbuyi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 12:21-24">1 Wafalumi 12:21-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 11:1" />Rehoboamu pakasokiti Yerusalemu, kawajojonira na kuwatanda wamashonta yawamana kulikoma nkondu laki yimu na semanini kulawa makabila ga Yuda na Benjamini, walikomangi na Waisraeli, su kagawuziyi makabila ga kushana muwukolamlima wakuyi. <verse eid="2CH 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 11:2" />Kumbiti ulagilagi wa Mlungu umwiziliti Shemaya muntu gwa Mlungu, ulonga, <verse eid="2CH 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 11:3" />“Mmugambili Rehoboamu mwana gwa Selemani, mfalumi gwa Yuda na Waisraeli woseri mu Yuda na Benjamini kuwera, <verse eid="2CH 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 11:4" />Neni Mtuwa nonga, namgenda kulikomanga na walongu wenu. Kila muntu kawuyi ukaya kwakuyi, toziya mlandu agu gulawa kwa neni.” Su wajimiliti ulagilagi wa Mtuwa Mlungu, wawuyiti ukaya na wagendandiri kulikomanga na Yeroboamu.<verse eid="2CH 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rehoboamu kankunyawa vibambaza kuzyengeta miji ya Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 11:5" />Rehoboamu kalikaliti Yerusalemu na kanyawiti shibambaza na kuyizyengeta miji ayi yayiweriti muisi ya Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 11:6" />Miji yayinyawitwi ndo, Beterehemu na Etamu na Tekoya, <verse eid="2CH 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 11:7" />Beti Suri na Soko na Adulamu, <verse eid="2CH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 11:8" />Gati na Maresha na Zifu, <verse eid="2CH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 11:9" />Adoraimu na Lakishi na Azeka, <verse eid="2CH 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 11:10" />Sora na Ayaloni na Hebroni. Miji ayi ndo yayizengetiziwa shibambaza mumji gwa Yuda na Benjamini. <verse eid="2CH 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 11:11" />Kayizyengetiriti shibambaza miji ayi na mngati amu kawatula wakulu wa mashonta na hanja za viboga na lipaki lya mizeyituni na divayi. <verse eid="2CH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 11:12" />Mungati mwa kila mji, katuliti ngawu na migowa na kuyitenda miji ayi kuwera igangamala nentu. Hangu wantu wa Yuda na Benjamini walonguziwitwi na yomberi.<verse eid="2CH 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Watambika na Walawi wankuhamira Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 11:13" />Watambika na Walawi woseri kulawa makabila goseri ga kushana wahamiriti Yuda na waweriti pamuhera na Yeroboamu. <verse eid="2CH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 11:14" />Walawi wagalekiti malambu gawu ga kulolelera na vintu vyawu vimonga, wagenda Yuda na Yerusalemu, toziya Yeroboamu na wana wakuyi wawaberiti kumtendera Mtuwa Mlungu handa watambika wa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 11:15" />Yeroboamu kalisyagulira watambika wakuyi mweni watendi lihengu kushitalawanda sha kuguwira sha pampindi pakutambikira wamlungu na vinyagu vya mbuzi na ng'ombi vyakalinyawiriti. <verse eid="2CH 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 11:16" />Wantu woseri yawana moyu gwa kumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, kulawa makabila goseri ga kushana, walilonguziyiti na Walawi mpaka Yerusalemu wamlaviliri tambiku Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa wambuyi wawu. <verse eid="2CH 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 11:17" />Wawugangamaziyiti ufalumi wa Yuda na kwa shaka sha vinja vitatu, wawera pamuhera muukolamlima wa Yeroboamu mwana Selemani, weni uwera ugangamala na walikala ntambu yawalikaliti mashaka ga mfalumi Dawudi na mashaka ga mfalumi Selemani.<verse eid="2CH 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaya ya Rehoboamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 11:18" />Rehoboamu kayugiti mdala yawamshemiti Mahalati, mhinga gwa Yeremoti, Yeremoti ayu kaweriti mwana gwa Dawudi. Mawu gwakuyi Yeremoti wamshemiti Abihaili mhinga gwa Eliyabu, mwana mpalu gwa Yese. <verse eid="2CH 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 11:19" />Mahalati kamwiwuliriti Yeroboamu wana watatu wapalu, Yeushi na Shemaria na Zahamu. <verse eid="2CH 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 11:20" />Shakapanu, Rehoboamu kamyugiti Maaka mhinga gwa Abisalomu na yomberi kamwiwuliriti wana wapalu msheshi, Abiya na Atai na Ziza na Shelomiti. <verse eid="2CH 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 11:21" />Rehoboamu kayugiti wadala lilongu na nani na wadala wa kunja sitini, kalela wana wapalu ishilini na nani na wana wahinga sitini. Muwamu mwa wadala wakuyi woseri na wadala wa kunja, kamfiliti nentu Maaka mhinga gwa Abisalomu. <verse eid="2CH 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 11:22" />Rehoboamu kamsyagula Abiya, mwana gwa Maaka, kawalonguziya walongu wakuyi, toziya kafiliti kumtenda kaweli mfalumi. <verse eid="2CH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 11:23" />Rehoboamu katenditi mlandu gwa luhala, pakawapalasiya wamu wa wana wakuyi muisi yoseri ya Yuda na Benjamini kawatula mumiji yoseri yayizengekitwi liboma. Kawapananiti viboga vivuwa na viraavirii kawayugiziya wadala wavuwa.<verse eid="2CH 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CH 12" />
  <para style="s">Mashonta ya Misri wankuyikankala isi ya Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 14:25-28">1 Wafalumi 14:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 12:1" />Su ukolamlima wa Rehoboamu pawuweliti uligangamaziya na kuwera na makakala, yombeli pamuhela na Waisraeli woseli woyiti kufata lagiru za Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 12:2" />Toziya wamjimirandiri Mtuwa Mlungu, mfalumi gwa Misri yawamshemiti Shishaki kagukomangiti mji gwa Yerusalemu mushinja sha mhanu wa ufalumi wa Rehoboamu, <verse eid="2CH 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 12:3" />kiziti na mbutuka za kukwengwa na farasi elufu yimu na miya mbili, wakwena farasi sitini elufu na wamashonta wavuwa nentu yawawalangikandiri wa, Libiya na Sukii na Isiopia waweriti pamuhera na yomberi kulawa Misri. <verse eid="2CH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 12:4" />Mfalumi Shishaki Kayilopoliti miji ya Yuda yayizyengetiziya liboma na kasoka mpaka Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2CH 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 12:5" />Shakapanu mbuyi gwa Mlungu Shemaya kamgenderiti mfalumi Rehoboamu na wakulu wa Yuda, yawatugiriti Yerusalemu kwa kumtira Shishaki, kawagambira, “Mtuwa Mlunga kalonga hangu, mwenga mundeka neni na neni niwaleka mwenga mkolwimlima na Shishaki.”<verse eid="2CH 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 12:6" />Wakulu wa Israeli na wafalumi wawoniti shidoda shawatenditi, walonga, “Shakatenda Mtuwa Mlungu ndo teratera.”<verse eid="2CH 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 12:7" />Mtuwa Mlungu pakawoniti kuwela wavimana shawatenditi, katakuliti kayi na mbuyi Shemaya, kamgambira, “Toziya wamana shawatenditi, hapeni niwagamaziyi, ila haniwalopoli ula vinu. Hapeninigusulusilili mji gwa Yerusalemu maya yangu nkulu kupitira Shishaki, <verse eid="2CH 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 12:8" />Kumbiti hawaweri wamanda wa Shishaki na weni hawavimani handa ndo iherepa kuntendera neni kuliku kuwatendera wafalumi wa pasipanu.”<verse eid="2CH 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 12:9" />Su, mfalumi Shishaki gwa Misri kagukomangiti mji gwa Yerusalemu, kayitoliti vintu vyoseri vyaviweriti Munumba Nkulu ya Mlungu na vintu vyoseri vyaviweriti muliboma. Katoliti kila shintu pamuhera na ngawu za zahabu zyakanyawiti mfalumi Selemani. <verse eid="2CH 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 12:10" />Hangu mfalumi Rehoboamu kanyawiti ngawu zimonga za shaba pahala palii ngawu za zahabu pazitolitwi na kawatula walolera waliloleri ligomi lya liboma. <verse eid="2CH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 12:11" />Kila shaka mfalumi pakagenditi Munumba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu walolera wazikoliti ngawu azi na shakapanu waziwuziya mushumba sha walolera. <verse eid="2CH 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 12:12" />Mfalumi Rehoboamu pakalinanagaziyiti, Mtuwa Mlungu kaleka kumkalalira na kamwagamiziyandiri. Nentu ya aga, isi ya Yuda iweriti na ponga.<verse eid="2CH 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upeleru wa ukolamlima wa mfalumi Rehoboamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 12:13" />Hangu mfalumi Rehoboamu kagangamaziyiti ufalumi wakuyi aku Yerusalemu. Kanjiti kayikolamlima isi ya Yuda pakaweliti na vinja arubayini na yimu na kakolitimlima kwa shaka sha mashaka lilongu na saba kumji gwa Yerusalemu, mji gweni Mtuwa Mlungu kagusyagula muwamu mwa makabila goseri ga Israeli guweri pahala pakumguwira yomberi. Mawu gwakuyi Rehoboamu wamshemiti Naama, kulawa isi ya Amoni. <verse eid="2CH 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 12:14" />Rehoboamu katenditi makontola, toziya kafilitindiri kumsakula Mtuwa Mlungu kwa moyu.<verse eid="2CH 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 12:15" />Matendu goseri ga mfalumi Rehoboamu kwanjira kwanja mpaka upeleru galembitwi mushitabu sha mbuyi Shemaya na mlola Ido, galembitwi kulinganira na nkolu. Rehoboamu na Yeroboamu waweriti wankulikomanga nkondu kila shaka. <verse eid="2CH 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 12:16" />Shakapanu Rehoboamu kahowiti na kufintirwa kumji gwa Dawudi na Abiya mwana gwakuyi, kakolitimlima pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="2CH 12:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CH 13" />
  <para style="s">Abiya na Yeroboamu wankulikomanga nkondu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 15:1-8">1 Wafalumi 15:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 13:1" />Abiya kanjiti kukolamlima Yuda mushinja sha lilongu na nani sha ukolamlima wa mfalumi Yeroboamu. <verse eid="2CH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 13:2" />Kakolitimlima kwa shaka sha vinja vitatu pakawela Yerusalemu. Mawu gwakuyi kaweliti Maaka mhinga Urieli gwa Gibea.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 13:2">Shakapanu kulawiriti nkondu pakati pa Abiya na Yerobowamu. <verse eid="2CH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 13:3" />Abiya kalitanditi kulikomanga nkondu na lishonta lya wanjagira wagangamala laki msheshi na Yeroboamu kamgendera na lishonta lyakuyi lya wanjagira wagangamala laki nani.<verse eid="2CH 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 13:4" />Mfalumi Abiya kagolokiti pampindi pa lugongu Semaraimu, lwaluwera pakati pa vigongu vya Efraimu, kambotera Yeroboamu na waisraeli wa makabila ga kushana, “Gumpikanili gwee Yerobowamu na wantu woseri wa Israeli! <verse eid="2CH 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 13:5" />Hashi, muvimanandiri handa Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, katuliti lipatanu lya mashaka goseri na Dawudi kuwera wafalumi woseri wa Israeli hawalawi muwiwuka wakuyi? <verse eid="2CH 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 13:6" />Kumbiti Yeroboamu mwana gwa Nebati ntumintumi gwa Selemani, mwana gwa Dawudi kamgalambukiti mkulu gwakuyi. <verse eid="2CH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 13:7" />Shakapanu, kashijojoniriti shipinga sha wangesera na wantu wazigizigi na womberi wamzyangazyanga Rehoboamu mwana gwa Selemani, kutenda galii gawafiliti womberi nayomberi kawezitindiri kuwabelera toziya kaweriti kankuwatira. <verse eid="2CH 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 13:8" />Vinu mwenga mfira kuubela ufalumi wa Mtuwa Mlungu yawuwera mumawoku ga wantu wa wiwuka wa Dawudi, toziya mwana mashonta wavuwa na shinyagu sha zahabu sha mwana gwa ng'ombi, vyakavinyawiti Yeroboamu viweri wamlungu wenu? <verse eid="2CH 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 13:9" />Muwawinga watambika wa Mtuwa Mlungu, walii wana wa Aruni, na wana wa Walawi na kulisyagulira maweni watambika wenu ntambu yawatenda wantu wa maisi gamonga. Yoseri yakiza kwamwenga kulilumika na mwana gwa ng'ombi shipalu ama kondolu shipalu, kawera mtambika gwenu kwa vintu vyeni ndo wamlungundiri.”<verse eid="2CH 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 13:10" />“Kumbiti kwa uwega wa twenga, Mtuwa Mlungu, ndo Mlungu gwetu, pota tumlekandiri. Kayi twanawa watambika wa wiwuka wa Aruni weni wankumtendera Mtuwa Mlungu na weni wankutangwa na Walawi. <verse eid="2CH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 13:11" />Kila lishaka mandawira na paliwala, watambika wankumlavilira tambiku za kulunguziwa na tambiku za kutumiziwa ubani yawununkira nentu, shakapanu watula mabumunda meza nanagala na mabumunda yagalaviwitwi kulongolu kwa Mlungu na mwankuyakiziya vikoloboyi vyakuyi mushintambi sha zahabu na kuyiyakiziya vikoloboyi vyakuyi kila pashimihi. Twenga twankugafata malagaliru ga Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwetu, kumbiti mwenga mmuleka. <verse eid="2CH 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 13:12" />Mlungu kapamuhera na twenga, yomberi katulonguiziya. Wambika wakuyi wakola kala mapenka gawu kutugombera twanji nkondu na mwenga. Mwenga wantu wa makabila ga kushana ga Israeli, moyi kulikomanga nkondu na Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa wambuyi wenu. Hapeni mukanki!”<verse eid="2CH 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 13:13" />Kumbiti shaka ashi, Yeruboamu kaweliti kawatuma wamu wa mashonta wakuyi wawakomangi kwa kumbeli mashonta wa Yuda, agawu wamashonta wakuyi wamonga wawakomangi uwega wa kulongolu. <verse eid="2CH 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 13:14" />Wamashonta wa Yuda pawaloliti kumbeli, wasindukiti kuwona wakomagwa, su wamliliriti Mtuwa Mlungu na watambika wagombiti mapenka gawu. <verse eid="2CH 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 13:15" />Su wamashonta wa Yuda wagomba filimbi kulanguziya kuwera kwana nkondu na pawatenditi hangu, Mlungu kamkankiti Yeroboamu na lishonta lyakuyi lya wantu wa makabila ga kushana ga Isreali kulongolu kwa Abiya na wantu wa Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 13:16" />Wantu wa makabila ga kushana ga Israeli wawatiriti wantu wa Yuda na Mlungu kawatula mumawoku mwawu wantu wa Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 13:17" />Abiya na lishonta lyakuyi wawakomangiti nentu wantu wa makabila ga kushana ga Israeli na wawakankiti na kuwalaga wamashonta laki mhanu yawaweliti muwamu mwa wamashonta wagangamala nentu mu Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 13:18" />Hangu, wantu wa Yuda wapatiti ukanka kwa wantu wa Israeli toziya wamtumbiriti Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa wambuyi wawu.<verse eid="2CH 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 13:19" />Abiya kamwingiti Yeroboamu na kampoka miji ya Beteri na Yeshana, Efroni pamuhera na vijiji vyaviweliti pambwega na miji ayi. <verse eid="2CH 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 13:20" />Yeroboamu kawezitindiri kuwera na makakala, kayi shaka sha ukolamlima wa Abiya. Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamkomiti nayomberi kahowa.<verse eid="2CH 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 13:21" />Kumbiti Abiya kendereyiti kuwera na makakala. Kayuga wadala lilongu na msheshi, kapatiti wana wapalu ishilini na wawili na wana wadala lilongu na sita. <verse eid="2CH 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 13:22" />Matendu gamonga ga ukolamlima wa Abiya, mahengu gakuyi na visoweru vyakuyi, vilembitwi mu shitabu sha maholu yagalembitwi na mbuyi gwa Mlungu Ido<verse eid="2CH 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2CH 14" />
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Asa kankuwakanka wamashonta wa Isiyopia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 14:1" />Upeleru, Abiya kahowiti na kufintilwa mumji gwa Dawudi na Asa mwana gwakuyi kawera mfalumi pahala pakuyi. Shaka sha Asa, kuweliti na ponga muisi kwa shaka sha vinja lilongu. <verse eid="2CH 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 14:2" />Asa katenditi maheri na yagamfiriziya Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwakuyi. <verse eid="2CH 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 14:3" />Kavibomuliti vitalawanda vya shihenga na pahala pa kuguwira wamlungu wamonga, kabomoliti vindwalingu vya mabuwi na kuvidumuladumula vinyagu vya mlungu Ashera. <verse eid="2CH 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 14:4" />Kawalagalira wantu wa Yuda wamsakuli Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa wambuyi wawu na kujimira malagalira gawu na lagiru zawu. <verse eid="2CH 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 14:5" />Viraavirii kawuyisiti pahala poseri pa kuguwira wamlungu wamonga na shitalawanda sha kutumiziya ubani kulawa mumiji yoseri ya Yuda, shakapanu ufalumi wakuyi uweriti na ponga pasi pa ukolamlima wakuyi. <verse eid="2CH 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 14:6" />Kanyawiti miji yana liboma mumiji yoseri ya Yuda shaka ashi sha ponga. Kwahera muntu yakalikomangiti nayu muvinja avi toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kampananiti ponga. <verse eid="2CH 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 14:7" />Nayomberi kawagambira wantu wa Yuda, “Tunyawi miji ayi shakapanu tuyizyengetiziyi shibambaza na amu tunyawi vindwalingu na tutuli migomi yana ngwiligiziwu. Isi yankali mumawoku mwetu toziya tugatenda gakafira Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwetu na vinu tulikala kwa ponga.” Su wanyawa na wamalira kunyawa. <verse eid="2CH 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 14:8" />Mfalumi Asa kaweriti na lishonta lya wanjagira laki tatu kulawa mlikabila lya Yuda, wana ngawu na migoha na wamonga laki mbili na semanini elifu kulawa likabila lya Benjamini, yawawera na ngawu na pindi. Woseri waweriti wamashonta yawaweziti kulikomanga nkondu weri.<verse eid="2CH 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 14:9" />Zera, muntu gwa Isiopia kayikomangiti isi ya Yuda pakawera na lishonta lya wanjagira milioni yimu na mbutuka za kukwegwa na farasi miya tatu, kagenda mpaka kasoka pahala papashemwa Maresha. <verse eid="2CH 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 14:10" />Asa kalawa kagenda kulikomanga na yomberi. Mashonta goseri mawili walitanda na wanja kulikomanga mululalanda lya Sefata pakwegera na Maresha. <verse eid="2CH 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 14:11" />Panu Asa kamlililiti Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwakuyi, pakalonga, “Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, kwahera yumonga handa gwenga, Yakaweza kulitanga lishonta lyaliwerandiri na likakala na lishonta lididika. Gututangi, gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwetu, toziya twenga tukutumbira gwenga na kwa litawu lyaku twinza kulikomanga na lishonta ali likulu. Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu gututangi, gwenga ndo Mlungu gwetu na kwahera muntu yoseri yakaweza kukukanka gwenga.”<verse eid="2CH 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 14:12" />Su, Mtuwa Mlungu kawakanka wamashonta wa Isiyopia kulongolu kwa Asa na lishonta lyakuyi wantu wa Yuda. Shakapanu lishonta lya Isiyopia watuga. <verse eid="2CH 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 14:13" />Asa pamuhera na wamashonta wakuyi wawafatiti mpaka Gerari, wawalagiti wamashonta wa Isiyopia wavuwa ng'anji na kasigalandiri hata yumu, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kawaposholiti pamuhera na lishonta lyakuyi. Lishonta lya Yuda lipokiti vintu vivuwa ng'anji. <verse eid="2CH 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 14:14" />Lihalibisiyiti miji yoseri yayiweriti pakwegera na Gerari, Toziya wantu yawalikaliti mumiji ayi waweriti wankumtira Mtuwa Mlungu. Lishonta litoliti lunda zivuwa kulawa mumiji ayi toziya kuweriti kwana lunda zivuwa nentu. <verse eid="2CH 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 14:15" />Lishonta liwakomangiti walolera wa wankanyama, litoliti wakondolu wavuwa na ngamiya. Shakapanu liwuyiti Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2CH 14:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2CH 15" />
  <para style="s">Asa kankuwawuziya wantu wamguwiri Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 15:1" />Rohu gwa Mlungu kamwizira Azariya mwana gwa Odedi, <verse eid="2CH 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 15:2" />nayomberi kalawa kugenda kumwanka mfalumi Asa, kamgambira, “Gumpikanili, gwee mfalumi Asa na wantu woseri wa Yuda na Benjamini! Mtuwa Mlungu kapamuhera na mwenga payiwera hamuweri pamuhera na yomberi. Pammusakula, Hamumwoni, kumbiti pamumleka nayomberi hakawaleki. <verse eid="2CH 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 15:3" />Kwa shaka shitali vinu, Waisraeli wakaliti pota ya Mlungu gwa nakaka na pota watambika wa kuwafunda na pota lagiru. <verse eid="2CH 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 15:4" />Kumbiti pawapatiti ntabiku, wamwuyira Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, wamsakula, shapanu wampata. <verse eid="2CH 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 15:5" />Mumashaka aga, kwahera muntu yakaweza kwingira ama kulawa kwa ponga toziya paweritindiri na ponga, ntabiku zivuwa ziwagaziyiti muisi zoseri. <verse eid="2CH 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 15:6" />Watabikiti nentu, isi yimu ilikomangiti na isi imonga na mji gumu gulikomanga na mji gumonga, toziya Mlungu kawatenditi waweri ntabiku za kila ntambu. <verse eid="2CH 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 15:7" />Kumbiti mwenga mligangamaziyi, pota namleweleka toziya hampati lifupu kwa lihengu lyamulitenda.”<verse eid="2CH 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 15:8" />Asa pakapikaniliti visoweru avi, vya umbuyi wa Azariya mwana gwa Odedi, kapatiti makakala. Kavibomoliti vinyagu vyoseri vya kukalaziya muisi yoseri ya Yuda na Benjamini na kulawa mumiji yoseri yakayilopoliti muisi ya vigongu vya Efraimu. Viraa, kanyawiti kayi shitarawanda sha Mtuwa Mlungu shashiweriti muligeleri lya numba nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="2CH 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 15:9" />Wantu wavuwa kulawa Efraimu na manasi na Simeoni wiziti kulikala mu ufalumi wakuyi, toziya wamwoniti Mlungu ka pamuhera na yomberi, Asa kawashema wantu woseri awa pamuhera na wantu wa Yuda na Benjamini, <verse eid="2CH 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 15:10" />na woseri walijojoniriti Yerusalemu mumwezi gwa tatu gwa shinja sha lilongu na mhanu sha ukolamlima wakuyi Asa. <verse eid="2CH 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 15:11" />Lishaka ali, wamlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku za wang'ombi miya saba na wakondolu elufu saba kulawa mulopola zilii zyawalopoliti. <verse eid="2CH 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 15:12" />Shakapanu watenditi lipatanu lya kuwera hawamjimili Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Wambuyi wawu, kwa moyu gwawu goseri na kwa rohu yawu yoseri, <verse eid="2CH 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 15:13" />na muntu yoseri yakamjimirandiri Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli kalaguwi, kaweri mndemba, ama mzewi, mwana mpalu ama mwana mdala. <verse eid="2CH 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 15:14" />Walilapiriti kwa Mtuwa Mlungu kwa kubotanga, pawagomba lipenga na miluli. <verse eid="2CH 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 15:15" />Wantu woseri wa Yuda waweriti na nemeleru nentu toziya walilapiti kwa moyu goseri. Wamsakula Mtuwa Mlungu kwa moyu gwawu goseri shakapanu wampata. Na Mtuwa Mlungu kawapanana ponga kulawa wega zoseri.<verse eid="2CH 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 15:16" />Mfalumi Asa viraavirii kamwusiyiti Maaka bibi gwakuyi muukulu wakuyi wa mawu malikiya, toziya kanyawiti shinyagu sha kukaliziya sha mlungu mdala Ashera. Asa kashikatanga na kushiposholaposhola na kushilunguziya shinyagu ashi, aku kululalanda lwa lushemba Kidironi. <verse eid="2CH 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 15:17" />Kumbiti ata hangu kawusiyitindiri pahala pakutambikira wamlungu wamonga mu Israeli pahalibisiwandiri, kumbiti mweni kaweriti na moyu mwaminika kwa Mlungu muukomu wakuyi woseri. <verse eid="2CH 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 15:18" />Kaviwuziyiti vintu vya zahabu na feza Munumba Nkulu ya Mlungu vyeni mweni na tati gwakuyi wavilumikiti. <verse eid="2CH 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 15:19" />Paweritindiri na nkondu kayi muisi mpaka shinja sha selasini na mhanu sha ukolamlima wa wakuyi Asa.<verse eid="2CH 15:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2CH 16" />
  <para style="s">Yuda na Israeli zyankulikomanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 15:17-22">1 Wafalumi 15:17-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 16:1" />Mushinja sha selasini na sita sha ukolamlima wa mfalumi Asa, Baasha, mfalumi gwa Israeli, kayikomangiti isi ya Yuda na kwanja kulinyawa liboma kuguzyengeta mji gwa Rama su muntu yoseri nakaweza kulawa pota kwingira muisi ya Asa mfalumi gwa Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 16:2" />Su mfalumi Asa katola feza na zahabu kulawa luhanja lya numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu na kuliboma, kazijega Damasiku kwa mfalumi Beni Hadadi gwa isi ya Aramu, kalonga, <verse eid="2CH 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 16:3" />“Tutendi mapatanu ga kuwera pamuhera pakati pangu na gwenga ntambu yakatenditi tati gwangu na tati gwaku. Guloli kakujegera feza na zahabu na lipatanu lyagulituliti gwenga na mfalumi Baasha gwa Israeli lisoki paupeleru na yomberi kawusiya lishonta lyakuyi kwaneni.”<verse eid="2CH 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 16:4" />Panu mfalumi Beni Hadadi kajimiliti shakalongiti mfalumi Asa, kawatumiti wakulu wa mashonta wakuyi kuyikomanga miji ya Israeli. Naweni wayilopoliti miji ya Iyoni na Dani, Abeli Maimu na miji yoseri ya Nafutali yayiweriti na luhanja lwa viboga. <verse eid="2CH 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 16:5" />Mfalumi Baasha pakapatiti visoweru vya makomangu aga, kalekiti kugunyawa mji gwa Rama, kalekiti lihengu ali. <verse eid="2CH 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 16:6" />Shakapanu mfalumi Asa kawalagaliriti wantu woseri wa Yuda, wahamisiyiti mabuwi na mbawu kulawa Rama, vintu vyeni Baasha kavitenderiti kunyawira. Shakapanu Asa katendera vintu avi kunyawira liboma kumji gwa Geba na liboma kumji gwa Mizipa.<verse eid="2CH 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuyi gwa Mlungu Hanani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 16:7" />Shaka ashi, mbuyi Hanani kamgenderiti mfalumi Asa gwa Yuda, kamgambira, “Toziya gumtumbiriti mfalumi gwa Shamu na guleka kumtumbira Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwaku, lishonta lya mfalumi gwa Sria likupota kulawa kumawoku mwaku. <verse eid="2CH 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 16:8" />Hashi, gulyaruwa shashilawiliti kwa Wakushi na Walibiya waweritindiri lishonta lyanalikakala na mbutuka na wakwenafarasi? Hata hangu pagumtumbiriti Mtuwa Mlungu, yomberi kakutangiti kuwakomanga. <verse eid="2CH 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 16:9" />Mtuwa Mlungu kapaloleriti weri pasipanu poseli, su kuwapanana makakala walii yawawera waminika kwakuyi. Gwenga gutenda mlandu gwa shingari mahala, hangu kwanjira vinu na kwendeleya haguweri na nkondu.” <verse eid="2CH 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 16:10" />Visoweru avi vimtenditi Asa kamkalaliriti nentu mlola Hanani, ata kamtatira mligereza. Mushaka shiraashi, Asa kanjiti kuwatabisiya nentu wamu wa wantu.<verse eid="2CH 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupelera kwa ukolamlima wa Asa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 15:23-24">1 Wafalumi 15:23-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 16:11" />Mirandu yakatenditi Asa, kulawa lyanjiru mpaka uperelu, galembitwi mushitabu sha Wafalumi wa Yuda na Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 16:12" />Mushinja sha selasini na tisa sha ufalumi wakuyi, Asa kaweriti na ulweli wa magulu, kalwaliti nentu. Kumbiti ata shaka ashi, Asa kamuwuyirandiri Mtuwa Mlungu kamtangi, kumbiti kalisakulira utanga kulawa kwa waganga. <verse eid="2CH 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 16:13" />Upeleru Asa kahowiti mushinja sha arobayini na yimu sha ukolamlima wakuyi. <verse eid="2CH 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 16:14" />Kafintiritwi mulisembi lyakaweriti kalibawiriti mweni mulitalawu, aku mumji gwa Dawudi. Wamgonjekiti mungati mwa lijeneza lyaliweliti wamemiziya uturi wa kila ntambu, shakapanu wapambiti motu mkulu nentu toziya ya kumdayilira.<verse eid="2CH 16:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2CH 17" />
  <para style="s">Yehoshafati katulwa kuwera mfalumi gwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 17:1" />Yehoshafati mwana gwa Asa kakolitimlima pahala pa tati gwakuyi, kaligangamaziyiti pakalikomangiti na Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 17:2" />Kawatuliti mashonta gakuyi mukila miji yoseri ya Yuda yayizyengetwa na liboma na mumiji imonga ya Yuda na mumiji ya Efraimu yeni Asa tati gwakuyi kayilopoliti. <verse eid="2CH 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 17:3" />Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti pamuhera na Yehoshafati toziya muvinja vyakuyi vya kwanja katenditi gakatenditi Dawudi mbuyi gwakuyi pota kuwaguwira wamlungu Baali. <verse eid="2CH 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 17:4" />Yomberi kamsakuliti Mlungu gwa Tati gwakuyi na kuzijimira lagiru zakuyi, pota kafatandiri matendu makontola gawatenditi wantu wa Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 17:5" />Mtuwa Mlungu, kawugangamaziyiti ufalumi gwa Yuda mumawoku mwa Yehoshafati na wantu woseri wamjegeliti lifupu, hangu kaweliti mlunda nentu na yakapananitwi ligoya nentu. <verse eid="2CH 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 17:6" />Moyu gwakuyi gufiriti nentu kumtendera Mtuwa Mlungu na nentu ya aga, kapahalibisiyiti pahala pampindi pawupeleru pakuguwira wamlungu wamonga na vinyagu vya Ashera, mlungu gwa shidala muisi ya Yuda.<verse eid="2CH 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 17:7" />Mushinja sha tatu sha ukolamlima wakuyi, Yehoshafati kawatumiti wakulu awa: Beni Haili na Obadiya na Zekaria na Netaneli na Mikaya. Wawafundi wantu yawalikala mumiji ya Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 17:8" />Viraavirii walilonguziyiti na Walawi tisa na watambika wawili. Walawi awa waweliti Shemaya na Netania na Zebadia na Asaheli na Shemiramoti na Yehonatani na Adoniya na Tobia na Tobi Adoniya na viraavirii Watambika Elishama na Yehoramu waweriti pamuhera nawa. <verse eid="2CH 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 17:9" />Washitoliti Shitabu sha lagiru sha Mtuwa Mlungu, watyanga nashi mumiji yoseri ya Yuda agawu pawawafunda wantu.<verse eid="2CH 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukulu wa Yehoshafati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 17:10" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawatula lyoga wafalumi woseri yawaweriti pakwegera na Yuda, womberi watiriti kulikomanga nkondu na mfalumi Yehoshafati. <verse eid="2CH 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 17:11" />Wafilisti wamu wamjegeriti mfalumi Yehoshafati lifupu pamuhera na feza zivuwa, na Waarabu wamonga naweni wamjegera wakondowu shipalu elufu saba na miya saba na mbuzipongu. <verse eid="2CH 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 17:12" />Mfalumi Yehoshafati kendereyiti kuwera mkulu ng'anji. Kanyawiti liboma na miji yana hanja, <verse eid="2CH 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 17:13" />hangu kaweriti na hanja nkulu mumiji ya Yuda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 17:13">Aku Yerusalemu, katuliti wanjagira wa mashonta makambaku, <verse eid="2CH 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 17:14" />aga ndo matawu kulinganira na nkolu za watati wawu: Adina kaweriti mkulu gwa likabira lya Yuda. Pasi pakuyi, kuweriti na wamashonta laki tatu. <verse eid="2CH 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 17:15" />Gwapili muukulu kaweriti Yehohanani, pakawera na wanjagira laki mbili na semanini elufu, <verse eid="2CH 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 17:16" />na gwa tatu kaweliti Amasiya mwana gwa Zikiri kaweriti na wanjagira makambaku laki mbili. Amasiya kalilaviya mweni kumtendera Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 17:17" />Mkulu gwa shipinga sha wamashonta, yawalawiti mulikabila lya Benjamini kaweriti Eliyada, lishonta kagangamala pakawera na wamashonta laki mbili, wana mbindi na ngawu. <verse eid="2CH 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 17:18" />Yakafatiti kaweriti Yehozabadi, yakaweliti na wamashonta laki yimu na semanini elufu yawalitanditi kala kwa nkondu. <verse eid="2CH 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 17:19" />Wamashonta woseri awa waweriti wankumtendera mfalumi aku Yerusalemu na viraavirii mfalumi katuliti wamashonta wamonga mumiji imonga ilii yana liboma poseri muisi ya Yuda.<verse eid="2CH 17:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2CH 18" />
  <para style="s">Mbuyi gwa Mlungu Mikaya kankumberiziya Ahabu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 22:1-28">1 Wafalumi 22:1-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 18:1" />Mfalumi Yehoshafati gwa Yuda pakaweriti kala muntu mlunda na kana ligoya, katenditi lipatanu na Ahabu, kafiliti mwana gwakuyi kamyugi mhinga gwa Ahabu mfalumi gwa Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 18:2" />Vinja vivuwa pavipititi Yehoshafati kagenditi Samaria kumtyangira mfalumi Ahabu. Ahabu kamshinjiriti Yehoshafati kondowu na ng'ombi wavuwa, kwa ligoya lyakuyi pamuhera na wantu yawaweriti pamuhera na yomberi, shakapanu Ahabu kamzyangazyanga kagendi nayu kugukomanga mji gwa Ramoti Gileyadi. <verse eid="2CH 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 18:3" />Ahabu mfalumi gwa Israeli kamkosiya Yehoshafati mfalumi gwa Yuda, “Hashi, hagugendi na neni kugukomanga mji gwa Ramoti Gileyadi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:3">Yehoshafati kankula, “Yina, neni na pamuhera na gwenga, viraa wamashonta waneni ndo handa wamashonta waku. Hatuweri pamuhera na gwenga munkondu.” <verse eid="2CH 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 18:4" />Viraavirii mfalumi Yehoshafati kamgambira mfalumi gwa Israeli, “Kumbiti gumkosiyi uti Mtuwa Mlungu shakutenda.”<verse eid="2CH 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 18:5" />Shakapanu, Ahabu kawashemiti wambuyi wa Mlungu yawaweriti miya msheshi kawakosiya, “Hashi, tugendi twakagukomangi mji gwa Ramoti Gileyadi, ama ng'endindiri?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:5">Womberi wamwankula, “Gugendi! Mlungu hakakupanani ukanka!”<verse eid="2CH 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 18:6" />Kumbiti Yehoshafati kakosiya, “Hashi, panu kwahera mbuyi yumonga gwa Mtuwa Mlungu mweni tuweza kumkosiya shakutenda?”<verse eid="2CH 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 18:7" />Mfalumi Ahabu gwa Israeli kamwankula Yehoshafati, “Kankali yumu, Mikaya mwana gwa Imla. Tuweza kumkosiya Mtuwa Mlungu shintu shakutenda kupitira yomberi. Kumbiti nimkalalira toziya yomberi katungandiri mlandu mheri.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:7">Yehoshafati kamgambira, “Iherepandiri mfalumi kulonga hangu.”<verse eid="2CH 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 18:8" />Su, Ahabu mfalumi gwa Israeli kamshemiti mkulu yumu na kumgambira, “Gunjegeri Mikaya mwana gwa Imla ulaavinu.”<verse eid="2CH 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 18:9" />Shaka ashi, mfalumi gwa Israeli pamuhera na Yehoshafati, mfalumi gwa Yuda, waweriti walikaliti muviti vyawu vya ufalumi pawakala kuluwaga lwa kukomera viboga muligomi lya kwingira kumjini Samalia, shaka ashi wambuyi woseri waweliti wankulaviya umbuyi wawu kulongolu kwawu. <verse eid="2CH 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 18:10" />Shakapanu yumu gwa Wambuyi awa, Sedekia mwana gwa Kenaana, kalinyawira magoli ga shuma, kalonga, “Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu. Kwa magoli aga, hakawawuziyi kumbeli Wasiria mpaka kuwagamiziya.” <verse eid="2CH 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 18:11" />Wambuyi wamonga woseri waweriti wankulaviya umbuyi ulaawu walonga, “Gugendi gwakagukomangi Ramoti Gileyadi, Mtuwa Mlungu hakakutendi gumkanki mfalumi ayu.”<verse eid="2CH 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 18:12" />Shaka ashi, mlagilagi ulii yakagenditi kumshema Mikaya kamgambiriti, “Guloli wambuyi woseri wankulonga mfalumi hakakanki na gwenga gutendi handa womberi, gumtungiri maheri.”<verse eid="2CH 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 18:13" />Kumbiti Mikaya kamwankula, “Nililapa kwa Mtuwa Mlungu yakawera mkomu, hanimgambili shili hera shakang'ambiriti Mtuwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="2CH 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 18:14" />Su, Mikaya pakasokiti kulongolu kwa mfalumi, mfalumi kamkosiya, “Hashi, tugendi kulikomanga nkondu aku Ramoti Gileadi ama ng'endindiri?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:14">Mikaya kamwankula, “Gugendi gwakakanki, Mtuwa Mlungu hakagutuli mji agu mumawoku mwaku.”<verse eid="2CH 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 18:15" />Kumbiti mfalumi kamkosiya, “Hanikulapiri mala ninga handa kila pagulonga naneni kwa litawu lya Mtuwa Mlungu, gutakuli ganakaka?”<verse eid="2CH 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 18:16" />Shakapanu Mikaya kamwankula, “Niwawoniti wantu woseri wa Israeli walipalasiya mumigongu handa wakondolu yawahera mlolera. Na Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga, wantu awa wahera mlongoziya, guwareki wawuyi kila muntu ukaya kwakuyi kwa ponga.”<verse eid="2CH 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 18:17" />Panu mfalumi gwa Israeli kamkosiya Yehoshafati, “Nikugambirandiri, nakaka hapeni katungi maheri kwaneni, ila madoda hera?”<verse eid="2CH 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 18:18" />Shakapanu Mikaya kalonga. “Vinu gupikanili shisoweru sha Mtuwa Mlungu. Nimwona Mtuwa Mlungu kalivaga mushiti shakuyi sha ufalumi na agawu lishonta lya wantumintumi wa kumpindi ligoloka wamzyengeta uwega wa kumliwu na kumshigi. <verse eid="2CH 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 18:19" />Mtuwa Mlungu kakosiya, ndo gaa hakamzyangizyangi Ahabu mfalumi gwa Israeli kagendi kakagamili aku Ramoti Gileyadi? Kila yumu kankula ntambu yakaliholiti. <verse eid="2CH 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 18:20" />Shakapanu, shamshera yumu kagoloka kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, kalonga, neni hanimzyangizayangi.’ Mtuwa Mlungu kamkosiya, kwa ntambu gaa? <verse eid="2CH 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 18:21" />Nayomberi kankula, hang'endi na kuwatenda wambuyi wakuyi woseri walongi mpayu. Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira, gwenga guweza kumzyangazyanga, gugendi gwakatendi hangu.”<verse eid="2CH 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 18:22" />“Hangu Mtuwa Mlungu kawatenda wambuyi waku woseri watakuli mpayu. Su madoda gakupati gwenga!”<verse eid="2CH 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 18:23" />Panu mbuyi Sedekia mwana gwa Kenaana kamsegelera Mikaya, kamlapula likofi lyamulisaya shakapanu kamkosiya, “Kwanjira ndii Rohu gwa Mtuwa Mlungu kandeki hashi neni na kiza kuyowera na gwenga?”<verse eid="2CH 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 18:24" />Mikaya kamwankula, “Lishaka pagwingiraku mushumba sha mng'anti kulififa panu ndo haguvimani.”<verse eid="2CH 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 18:25" />Mfalumi Ahabu kalagalira, “Mmubati Mikaya mmuwuziyi kwa Amoni, mkulu gwa mji na kwa Yoashi, mwana gwa mfalumi. <verse eid="2CH 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 18:26" />Guwagambiri wamtatiri muligereza na kumliyiziya mabumunda shididni na mashi, mpaka pambuya poneka”<verse eid="2CH 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 18:27" />Mikaya kalonga, “Paguwuya mkomu, Mtuwa Mlungu kayowerandiri naneni.” Shakapanu kendereya kulonga, “Mwawoseri mwenga hamgaholi aga!”<verse eid="2CH 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Ahabu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 22:29-35">1 Wafalumi 22:29-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 18:28" />Shakapunu, mfalumi Ahabu kagenditi pamuhera na Yehoshafati mfalumi gwa Yuda kugukomanga mji gwa Ramoti Gileyadi. <verse eid="2CH 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 18:29" />Mfalumi Ahabu kamgambira Yehoshafati, “Pang'enda mnkondu hanvali nguwu za ntambu iraayi, kumbiti gwenga haguvuli nguwu zaku za shifalumi.” Hangu mfalumi gwa Israeli kagenda munkondu pota kuvala nguwu za shifalumi.<verse eid="2CH 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 18:30" />Mfalumi gwa Sria kaweriti kawalagalira wakulu wa mashonta wakuyi yawagolokeriti mbutuka zakuyi za kukwegwa, kawagambira, “Namlikomanga na muntu yoseri ulii kaweri shonta gwa ntambu iraa ama mkulu gwawu, mwenga mmukomangi mfalumi gwa Israeli hera.” <verse eid="2CH 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 18:31" />Wakulu wa mashonta walonguziya mbutuka za nkondu pawamwoniti Yehoshafati, walonga' “Nakaka ayu ndo mfalumi gwa Israeli.” Hangu, wagalambuka wamkomangi, kumbiti Yehoshafati kamlilira Mtuwa Mlungu na Mtuwa Mlungu kamtanga. Mlungu kawajega kutali nawawera pakwegera na yomberi. <verse eid="2CH 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 18:32" />Wakulu wa mashonta yawalonguziya mbutuka za nkondu pawavimaniti handa kaweritindiri mfalumi gwa Israeli, wamlekiti kumfata, wawuya. <verse eid="2CH 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 18:33" />Kumbiti shonta yumu gwa Sria kawunika upindi wakuyi pota kuvimana kamguma msali mfalumi gwa Israeli palii kushiwungiru sha nguwu ya shuma. Panu Ahabu kamgambira dereva gwa Mbutuka yakuyi, “Gugalambuli mbutuka gumbusiyi munkondu, nyagu ntenduwa nentu.” <verse eid="2CH 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 18:34" />Makomangu gendereyiti paluwala poseri, na mfalumi gwa Israeli kaweriti kaliyegeka mumbutuka agawu pakawalola wamashonta wa Wasiria mpaka pashimihi. Shakapanu mushaka sha pashimihi pamberi pa mshenji kuzyeta, kahowiti.<verse eid="2CH 18:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2CH 19" />
  <para style="s">Mbuyi gwa Mlungu Yehu kankumkalipira Yehoshafati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 19:1" />Mfalumi Yehoshafati gwa Yuda kawuyiti mkomu kuliboma lyakuyi kumjini Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 19:2" />Kumbiti mbuyi gwa Mlungu Yehu mwana gwa Hanani, kagenditi kumwanka mfalumi, kamkosiya, “Hashi, gulihola ndo iherepa kuwatanga wakontola na kuwafira yawamkalalira Mtuwa Mlungu? Hangu maya ga Mlungu hagakwizili kwa galii gagutenditi. <verse eid="2CH 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 19:3" />Kumbiti, kwana maheri tunga mngati mwakuyi. Guviwusiyiti kala vinyagu vyoseri vya Ashera na mlungu gwa shidala na gukamalira ng'anji kumsakula Mlungu kwa moyu gwaku goseri.”<verse eid="2CH 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yehoshafati kankuwasyagula walonguziya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 19:4" />Mfalumi Yehoshafati kakaliti Yerusalemu, kumbiti kankali kankuwatyangira wantu wa Beeri Sheba ya kusika, mpaka kuisi ya vigongu vya Efraimu. Katenditi hangu su kuwapanana moyu wantu wamuwuyiri Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa wawambuyi wawu. <verse eid="2CH 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 19:5" />Kasysaguliti walonguziya mumiji yoseri ya Yuda yayizyengetwa na liboma, <verse eid="2CH 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 19:6" />kawagambira, “Muloleriweri nentu pamtoza, toziya mtozandiri ntambu yawafira wantu kumbiti mtoza ntambu yakafira Mlungu na yomberi ka pamuhera na mwenga pamtoza. <verse eid="2CH 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 19:7" />Su, vinu mumtiri Mtuwa Mlungu, pamtoza mliloleriweri toziya ya Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwetu katoza ntambu yakafira yomberi, kamwonerandiri muntu yoseri pota swinda.”<verse eid="2CH 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 19:8" />Viraavirii aku mjini Yerusalemu, Yehoshafati kasyaguliti Walawi wamu na watambika na wakulu wa nkolu zoseri za Waisraeli waweri watoza, wawatozi wantu yawalema kukola lagiru lya Mtuwa Mlungu na watozi ndewu za wantu weni yawalikaliti aku Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 19:9" />Kawalagalira ntambu ayi, “Mtendi mahengu genu kwa waminika na kwa moyu gwenu goseri agawu pamumutira Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 19:10" />Kila mala walongu wenu woseri kulawa mumiji yawalikala pawawajegera masitaka gaweri ga kulaga ama kukolandiri lagiru ama kukolandiri amuli ama malagalira, mwenga muwaberi na wamtendera Mtuwa Mlungu vidoda. Pamtendandiri ntambu ayi, maya gakuyi hagawizili mwenga na walongu wenu, kumbiti pamutenda lihengu lyenu weri mwenga hapenimuweri na vidoda. <verse eid="2CH 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 19:11" />Amaria, mtambika mkulu, yomberi hakalonguziyi mahengu goseri yagawera ga lagiru za Mtuwa Mlungu na Zebadia mwana gwa Ishimaeli, mkulu gwa likabila lya Yuda hakalonguziyi mahengu goseri ga mfalumi na Walawi haweri wakulu wenu. Mtendi kwa moyu goseri na Mtuwa Mlungu hakaweri pamuhera na woseri walii yawatenda maheri.”<verse eid="2CH 19:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2CH 20" />
  <para style="s">Yehoshafati kankuwakanka Waedomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 20:1" />Pa shaka, mashonta ga Mowabu na Waamoni pamuhera na wamu wa Wameuni, wiziti kulikomanga na Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 20:2" />Wantu wamu wamgendera mfalumi Yehoshafati wamgambira, “Lishonta likulu liza kukukomanga kulawa Edomu, kumwambu Kubahali ya Munu. Vinu walopola kala Hasasoni Tamari.” Ali ndo litawu limonga lya Engedi. <verse eid="2CH 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 20:3" />Yehoshafati kakolitwi na lyoga, kamluwiti Mtuwa Mlungu kamlonguziyi. Kawabwelera wantu woseri muisi ya Yuda woyi kuliya. <verse eid="2CH 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 20:4" />Wantu wiziti Yerusalemu kulawa miji yoseri ya Yuda, walijojonira su kumluwa Mtuwa Mlungu kawatangi. <verse eid="2CH 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 20:5" />Yehoshafati kagolokiti palongolu pa lijojoniru lya wantu wa Yuda na Yerusalemu kulongolu kuluwaga lyasyayi lwa Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu, <verse eid="2CH 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 20:6" />kaluwa kwa kubotanga pakalonga, “Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, Mungu gwa wambuyi wetu, hashi gwenga ndo Mlungu gwa kumpindi! Gwenga guzikolamlima falumi zoseri pasipanu, gwana uweza na makakala, kwahera muntu yakaweza kulikomanga na gwenga. <verse eid="2CH 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 20:7" />Gwenga Mtuwa Mlungu gwetu, yaguwawingiti wenikaya wa isi ayi shipindi wantu waku Israeli pawingiriti muisi ayi, guwapanana wiwuka wa ganja gwaku Abrahamu, isi iweri yawu mashaka goseri. <verse eid="2CH 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 20:8" />Nawomberi walikali amu na kukunyawira Numba Nkulu yaku kwaligoya lyaku pawalonga, <verse eid="2CH 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 20:9" />handa ntabiku payitwizira, iweri nkondu, malweri madoda, ama njala, su twizi na kugoloka kulongolu Munumba ayi yayinyawitwi kwa ligoya lyaku, hatukulilili muntabiku zyetu na gwenga haguwapikaniri na kutulopola.”<verse eid="2CH 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 20:10" />“Vinu wantu wa Amoni na Mowabu na walugongu Seiri, wantu awa guwaberiti wambuyi wetu nawazikomanga isi zawu pawalawiti Misri, hangu wazewi wetu wapititi kutali nawalaguwa, <verse eid="2CH 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 20:11" />guloli, ntambu yawatulipa, wiza kutuwusiya muisi yaku yagutupananiti iweri lunda yatwenga. <verse eid="2CH 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 20:12" />Gwee ndo Mlungu gwetu! Hashi hapeni guwatozi, toziya twenga twahera makakala goseri kulikongama na lishonta likulu ali lyalitwizira. Tuvimanandiri sha kutenda kumbiti masu getu gakulola gwenga gututangi.”<verse eid="2CH 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 20:13" />Wapalu woseri wa Yuda pamuhera na wadala wakuyi woseri na wana wawu, waweriti wagoloka palii kulongolu ku Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 20:14" />Su Rohu gwa Mlungu kamwiziriti yumu gwa Walawi yakaweriti panu, litawi lyakuyi Yahazieli mwana gwa Zekariya, mwana gwa Benaya, mwana gwa Yeieli, mwana gwa Matania gwa lukolu lwa Asafu. <verse eid="2CH 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 20:15" />Yahazieli kalonga, “Gumpikaniri mfalumi Yehoshafati na wantu wa Yuda na wenikaya wa Yerusalemu! Mtuwa Mlungu kawagambira hangu, namtira pota kushashatika toziya ya lishonta ali likulu. Nkondu ayi yenundiri ila ya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 20:16" />Shirawu mseleri mgendi mwakawakomangi walii yawakwena kupitira lulalanda lwa Sisi. Hamuwawoni uperelu wa lulalanda, pakwegera na shiwala sha Yerueli. <verse eid="2CH 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 20:17" />Mwenga mfiluwandiri kulikomanga nkondu ayi. Mwenga mgoloki hera shakapanu muheperi na hamwoni ntambu Mtuwa Mlungu hakawalopoli. Mwenga wantu wa Yuda na Yerusalemu namtira pota kuuya kumbeli. Mgendi mwakalikomangi nkondu shirawu na Mtuwa Mlungu hakaweri pamuhera na mwenga!”<verse eid="2CH 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 20:18" />Panu mfalumi Yehoshafati kasuntamala makukama pamuhera na wantu woseri wa Yuda na wenikaya wa Yerusalemu wamsuntamalira na kumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 20:19" />Walawi wa lukolu lwa Kohati na Kora, wagolokiti na kumzyuma Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, kwa liziwu likulu.<verse eid="2CH 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 20:20" />Shilawu yakuyi, wimuka mandawira putiputi, wagenda mpaka kushiwala sha Tekowa. Pawaweriti wanguwuka, Yehoshafati kagolokiti, kawagambira, “Mumpikaniri, mwenga wantu wa Yuda na wenikaya wa Yerusalemu! Mmujimiri Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu na mwenga hamuweli wagangamala. Muwajimiri wambuyi wakuyi na mwenga hamuweri na mpatiru.” <verse eid="2CH 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 20:21" />Yehoshafati pakalitakuziyaniti kala na wantu, mfalumi kasyaguliti wantu wamwimbili Mtuwa Mlungu, walongoleri kulongolu kulishonta pawimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CH 20:21">“Mlongi mayagashi Mtuwa Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CH 20:21">toziya ufiru wakuyi ulikala mashaka goseri!”<verse eid="2CH 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 20:22" />Pawanjiti kwimba na kumzyuma Mlungu, Mtuwa Mlungu kugakomanga mashonta ga Amoni na Mowabu wa kulugongu Seiri yawawiziti kulikomanga na Yuda. Na wamashonta awa wasinditi. <verse eid="2CH 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 20:23" />Wantu wa Amoni na wa Mowabu wawakomangiti wenikaya wa lugongu Seiri na kuwalaga nakamu. Pawamaliliti kuwalaga wenikaya wa lugongu seiri wanjiti kulikomanga weni kwa weni, walilagana. <verse eid="2CH 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 20:24" />Lisonta lya Yuda palisokiti pashindwalingu sha ulolera aku kushiwala, walilola lishonta likulu lilii, wawoniti mauti yagaweriti kila uwega. Kwahera muntu yoseri yakaponikiti.<verse eid="2CH 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 20:25" />Yehoshafati na wamashonta wakuyi wagenda kutola lopora, wawoniti vintu vivuwa vya kulikomangira na nguwu na vintu vimonga vya beyi nkulu. Kwa mashaka matatu wajegiti vintu avi, kumbiti wavimalilitindiri toziya viweriti vivuwa ng'anji. <verse eid="2CH 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 20:26" />Lishaka lya msheshi wajojonikiti mululanda lwa Beraka, aku wamzyuma Mtuwa Mlungu kwa goseri gakawatenderiti. Ndo mana lulalanda alu lushemitwi lulalanda lwa Beraka mpaka leru. <verse eid="2CH 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 20:27" />Yehoshafati kawalongoziya wamashonta wakuyi mpaka Yerusalemu kwa nemeleru, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kawakanka wankondu wawu. <verse eid="2CH 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 20:28" />Pawasokiti Yerusalemu, wagenditi magenda mpaka Kunumba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu, pawagomba malimba na vinubi na mapenka. <verse eid="2CH 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 20:29" />Wafalumi woseri waweriti na lyoga pawapikaniriti Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakawakomangiti wankondu wa Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 20:30" />Su, Yehoshafati kakolitimlima kwa ponga na Mlungu kampananiti ulolera wega zoseri.<verse eid="2CH 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upeleru wa ukolamlima wa Yehoshafati</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1KI 22:41-50">1 Wafalumi 22:41-50</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 20:31" />Yehoshafati kaweriti na vinja selasini na mhanu pakanjiti kukolamlima Yuda na kakolitimlima kulawa Yerusalemu kwa shinja sha ishilini na mhanu. Mawu gwakuyi kashemitwi Azuba mhinga gwa Shilihi. <verse eid="2CH 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 20:32" />Katenditi maheri kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakatenditi Asa tati gwakuyi. <verse eid="2CH 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 20:33" />Kumbiti kapaharibisitindiri kila pahala pampindi pa kuguwira. Wantu waweriti haweni mgalambukili na kumguwira Mlungu gwa wambuyi wawu kwa miyoyu yawu yoseri.<verse eid="2CH 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 20:34" />Mirandu imonga ya Yehoshafati, kulawa lyanjiru lya ukolamlima wakuyi mpaka upeleru, galembitwi mushitabu sha maholu ga Yehu mwana gwa Hanani, geni gaweriti mushitabu sha wafalumi wa Israeli.<verse eid="2CH 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 20:35" />Pa aga, Yehoshafati mfalumi gwa Yuda, katenditi lipatanu na Ahaziya mfalumi gwa Israeli, yakatenditi makontola gavuwa. <verse eid="2CH 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 20:36" />Wajimilirana kunyawa meri nkulu za kutendera biashara, meri azi wazinyawira aku Esiyoni Geberi. <verse eid="2CH 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2CH 20:37" />Kumbiti Eliezeri mwana gwa Dodavahu, kulawa mji gwa Maresha, kamlaviliriti umbuyi Yehoshafati, pakalonga, “Toziya gutenda lipatanu na Ahaziya, Mtuwa Mlungu hakazimegangi meri zoseri zamnyawiti.” Shakapanu meri azi zipantikapantika, hangu ziwezitindiri kutenda biashara.<verse eid="2CH 20:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2CH 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 21:1" />Shakapanu Yehoshafati kahowiti na kufintirwa pamuhera na mbuyi wakuyi mumasembi ga shifalumi mumji gwa Dawudi na Yehoramu mwana gwakuyi kakolamlima pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="2CH 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yehoramu kankukolamlima Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 8:17-24">2 Wafalumi 8:17-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 21:2" />Walongu wakuyi Yehoramu, wana wa Yehoshafati waweriti: Azaria na Yehieli na Zakaria na Azariahu na Mikaeli na Shefatia. <verse eid="2CH 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 21:3" />Tati gwawu kawapananiti lifupu likulu lya feza na zahabu na vintu vimonga vya beyi nkulu na viraa kawapananiti miji ya Yuda yana liboma. Toziya Yehoramu kaweriti shipantanjira, Yehoshafati kampananiti ufalumi kakolimlima pahala pa yomberi. <verse eid="2CH 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 21:4" />Yehoramu pakalivagiti mushiti sha ufalumi na ufalumi wakuyi pawuweriti ugangamala, kawalagiti walongu wakuyi woseri kwa ligumba na viraavirii wamu wa wakulu wa Israeli.<verse eid="2CH 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 21:5" />Yehoramu kanjiti kukolamlima pakaweriti na vinja selasini na mbili. Kakolitimlima pakawera aku Yerusalemu kwa vinja vinani. <verse eid="2CH 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 21:6" />Kazifatiti njira zidoda za wafalumi wamonga wa Israeli ntambu yatenditi mfalumi Ahabu, toziya kaweriti kamyuga mhinga gwa Ahabu. Katenditi makontola kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, <verse eid="2CH 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 21:7" />kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kafilitindiri kulwagamiziya lukolu lwa Dawudi toziya ya lipatanu lyakalitendi na Dawudi na viraavirii toziya Mtuwa Mlungu katakuliti kuwera wiwuka wa Dawudi haukolimlima mashaka goseri.<verse eid="2CH 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 21:8" />Shaka sha ukulu wa Yehoramu, wantu wa Edomu walemiti kukolwamlima na isi ya Yuda, walitulira mfalumi gwawu weni. <verse eid="2CH 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 21:9" />Su, Yehoramu pamuhera na wakulu wa mashonta na mbutuka zakuyi zyakukwega na farasi walokiti kugenda kwa Waedomu, Kumbiti Waedomu wawazyengeta na kuwakomanga na kuwankaka. <verse eid="2CH 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 21:10" />Hangu wantu wa Edomu walema kukolwamlima na Yuda mpaka vinu. Shaka shiraashi, wenikaya wa Libina naweni walemiti kukolwamlima na yomberi, toziya Yehoramu kamlemiti Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa wambuyi wakuyi. <verse eid="2CH 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 21:11" />Kayi, kanyawiti pahala pa kuguwira wamlungu wamonga mu vigongu vya Yuda na kuwatenda wenikaya wa Yerusalemu kukosa waminika na kuwapotuziya wantu wa Yuda.<verse eid="2CH 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 21:12" />Mfalumi Yehoramu kankiti luhamba kulawa kwa mbuyi gwa Mlungu Elia yalulonga hangu, “Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa mbuyi gwaku Dawudi, kalonga gwenga gutendandiri ntambu yakatenditi tati gwaku Yehoshafati, ama Asa mfalumi gwa Yuda, <verse eid="2CH 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 21:13" />kumbiti gufata njira ya wafalumi wa Israeli. Guwalongoziya wantu wa Yuda na Yerusaremu nawawera waminika kwa Mlungu handa wafalumi wa lukolu lwa Ahabu ntambu yalutenditi aku Israeli. Viraa guwalagiti walongu wakuyi na walongu wa tati gwaku weni waweriti wantu waheri nentu kuliku gwenga. <verse eid="2CH 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 21:14" />Toziya ayi, Mtuwa Mlungu hakawakomangi wantu waku, wana waku na wadala waku na kuzihalibisiya lunda zaku zoseri. <verse eid="2CH 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 21:15" />Gamwenigwenga hagulwali malweri madoda ga mtima, ulweri awu hawuwutendi utumbu waku ulawi kunja.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 21:16" />Kuweriti na Wafilisti na waarabu wavuwa yawaweriti walikala pakwegera na Waisiyopia. Mtuwa Mlungu kawasongiziyiti awa su walikomangi na Yehoramu. <verse eid="2CH 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 21:17" />Su, wayikomangiti isi ya Yuda, watola vintu vyoseri vyaviweriti munumbu ya mfalumi na kuwatola lopola wana wakuyi woseri na wadala wakuyi, ira Ahazia, mwana mpalu mpusu wamtolandiri.<verse eid="2CH 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 21:18" />Pagapititi goseri aga, Mtuwa Mlungu kamjegera mfalumi ulweri wa mtima wawuponekandiri. <verse eid="2CH 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 21:19" />Kendereyiti kulwala na ulweri wakuyi uwera wakongereka lishaka kwa lishaka na ata kusoka upeleru wa shinja sha pili utumbu wakuyi ulawa, shakapanu kahowiti kwa kutama nentu. Wantu wapambitindiri motu kulilira kuhowa kwakuyi ntambu yawatenditi kwa wambuyi wakuyi.<verse eid="2CH 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 21:20" />Yehoramu kanjiti kukolamlima pakawera na vinja selasini na mbili, kakolamlima kulawa Yerusalemu kwa shaka sha vinja vinani. Pakahowiti kwahera muntu yoseri yakamuhinginiziyiti. Shakapanu kafintiritwi mumji gwa Dawudi, kumbiti mumasembindiri ga wafalumi.<verse eid="2CH 21:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2CH 22" />
  <para style="s">Ahazia kakolamlima Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 8:25-29">2 Wafalumi 8:25-29</ref>,<ref loc="2KI 9:21-28">9:21-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 22:1" />Wenikaya wa Yerusalemu wamtenditi Ahazia, neperu gwa shipalu gwa Yehoramu, kaweri mfalumi, kakolimlima pahala pa tati gwakuyi toziya ya wakulu wakuyi woseri walagitwi na wantu tunga yawingiriti kungonjeru pamuhera na Waarabu. Hangu, Ahazia mwana gwa Yehoramu, mfalumi gwa Yuda, kawera mkolamlima. <verse eid="2CH 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 22:2" />Ahazia, kanjiti kukolamlima pakawera na vinja ishilini na mbili, kakolitimlima kulawa Yerusalemu kwa shinja shimu. Mawu gwakuyi kashemitwi Atalia, mzukulu mdala gwa mfalumi Omiri. <verse eid="2CH 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 22:3" />Toziya mawu gwakuyi kaweriti mgambiziya gwakuyi mukutenda makontola na yomberi viraa kafatiti mgenderanu gwa wiwuka wa Ahabu. <verse eid="2CH 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 22:4" />Katenditi makontola kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yawatenditi wenikaya wa mfalumi Ahabu, toziya womberi waweriti wagambiziya wakuyi pakahowiti tati gwakuyi, wamlongoziya katendi makontola. <verse eid="2CH 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 22:5" />Viraavirii kafata litakulu lyawu, kagenda pamuhera na mfalumi Yehoramu mwana gwa Ahabu mfalumi gwa Israeli kulikomanga na Hazaeli mfalumi gwa Sria aku Ramoti Gileyadi. Na Washamu wamtenditi Yoramu. <verse eid="2CH 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 22:6" />Shakapanu mfalumi Yoramu kawuya Yezireeli su kalwaziyi vironda vyakuyi vyakapatiti aku Rama, shaka shakaweriti kankulikomanga na Hazaeli mfalumi gwa Sria. Ahazia mwana gwa Yehoramu mfalumi gwa Yuda kagenda kumtyangira Yoramu mwana gwa Ahabu aku Yezireeli toziya kaweriti na malonda.<verse eid="2CH 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 22:7" />Mlungu kapangiti Ahazia kalaguwi palii pakamtyangiriti Yoramu. Toziya pakasokiti aku, kalawiti pamuhera na Yoramu kagenda kuliwona na Yehu mwana gwa Nimshi yakasyagulitwi na Mtuwa Mlungu kawalagi wantu wa kaya ya Ahabu. <verse eid="2CH 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 22:8" />Yehu pakaweriti kawatoza kaya ya Ahabu, kaliwoniti na wakulu wa Yuda pamuhera na wana wa walongu wakuyi Ahazia, yawawera wankumtendera Ahazia na Yehu kawalaga. <verse eid="2CH 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 22:9" />Shakapanu Yehu kamsakuliti Ahazia na yomberi kabatitwi pakawera kalififa aku Samaria. Womberi wamjegiti kwa Yehu na Yehu kamlaga. Wamfintiriti nshimba yakuyi toziya walongiti, “Yomberi ni mzukulu gwa Yehoshafati, mweni kamsakuliti Mtuwa Mlungu kwa moyu gwakuyi goseri.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 22:9">Hangu kasigalitindiri ata muntu yumu gwa kaya ya Ahazia mweni yakaweziti kuwera mfalumi.<verse eid="2CH 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malikiya Ataliya kankukolamlima Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 11:1-3">2 Wafalumi 11:1-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 22:10" />Atalia mawu gwakuyi Ahazia pakawoniti kuwera mwana gwakuyi kalaguwa, kalagalira kaya yoseri ya ufalumi wa Yuda walaguwi. <verse eid="2CH 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 22:11" />Kumbiti Yehosheba, mhinga gwa mfalumi Yehoramu kamtoriti kwa bada Yoashi mwana gwa Ahazia kulawa muwamu mwa wana wa mfalumi yawafilitwi kulaguwa. Kamfifiti yomberi pamuhera na yaya gwakuyi mushumba sha kutula vintu vya kugonjera Munumba Nkulu ya Mlungu. Hangu Yehosheba mhinga gwa mfalumi Yehoramu viravilii kaweriti mdala gwa mtambika Yehoyadani na viraa kaweriti dada gwakuyi Ahazia, kamfifiti mwana ayu nakalaguwa na Atania. <verse eid="2CH 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 22:12" />Yohashi kalikaliti na Yehosheba kwa vinja sita agawu pakawera kafifwa mngati mushumba ashi, shaka Atalia pakaweriti kakolamlima isi handa malikiya gwa Yuda.<verse eid="2CH 22:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2CH 23" />
  <para style="s">Atania kankuwusiwa muwukolamlima</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 11:4-16">2 Wafalumi 11:4-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 23:1" />Shakapanu, mushinja sha saba, mtambika Yehoyada kalanguziya makakala gakuyi. Katenda lipatanu na wakulu wa mashonta vipinga miya vyeni ndo: Azaria mwana gwa Yehoramu na Ishimaeli mwana gwa Yehohanani na Azaria mwana gwa Obedi na Maaseya mwana gwa Adaya na Elishafati mwana gwa Zikiri. <verse eid="2CH 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 23:2" />Wazyengeta mumiji yoseri ya Yuda pawajojonila Walawi na Wakulu wa kaya za Israeli, wagenditi mpaka Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2CH 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 23:3" />Aku shipinga shoseri shitenda lipatanu na mfalumi Munumba Nkulu ya Mlungu. Yehoyada kawagambira, “Mwana ayu mpalu gwa mfalumi! Ndo hakaweri mfalumi ntambu yakalongiti Mtuwa Mlungu kwa wiwuka wa Dawudi. <verse eid="2CH 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 23:4" />Mwenga hamtendi hangu: selusi imu ya mwenga watambika na Walawi yamwera na lihengu Lishaka lya Kwoyera, hamyiloleri migomi mikulu, <verse eid="2CH 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 23:5" />selusi imonga hayiloleri liboma na selusi yayisigaliti hamloleri Ligomi lya Lyanjiru. Wantu wamonga woseri hawaweri muluwaga lwa Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 23:6" />Nammujimira muntu yoseri kwingira Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu kumbiti wingili watambika hera na Walawi yawawera mulihengu. Awa waweza kuingira toziya womberi ndo wananagala, kumbiti wantu wamonga woseri wajimili shakalagaliriti Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 23:7" />Walawi hawamzengeti mfalumi, kila muntu na shintu sha kulikomangira mumawoku mwakuyi na muntu yoseri yakajera kwingira Munumba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu, hakalagwi. Mlikali na mfalumi poseri pakagenda.”<verse eid="2CH 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 23:8" />Walawi na wantu wa Yuda wajimiliti lagiru zoseri zyakalaviyiti mtambika Yehoyada. Kila mkulu kawatora wantu wakuyi woseri, yawaweriti wakwingira mulihengu lyawu mulishaka lya Kwoyera na walii yawaweritindiri mulihengu lishaka lya koyera, toziya Yehoyada kawajimirandiri waleki mahengu gawu. <verse eid="2CH 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 23:9" />Shakapanu mtambika Yehoyada kawapananiti wakulu wa vipinga vya mashonta miyamiya mikuki na ngawu nkulu na ndidika zyaziweriti lunda za mfalumi Dawudi, yaziweriti zitulwa Munumba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 23:10" />Shakapanu, kawaturiti wantu woseri kwanjira uwega wa kusika mpaka uwega wa kushana mwa Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu na kushizyengeta shitarawanda na kila yumu na shintu sha kulikomangira mumawoku mwakuyi, su kumlolera mfalumi. <verse eid="2CH 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 23:11" />Shakapanu Yehoyada na wana wakuyi wapalu wamlaviya kunja Yohashi mwana gwa mfalumi, wamvalisiya lijenjeri mumtuyi. Wampanana shitabu sha lagiru ya Mlungu za kulonguziya na wamtenda kaweri mfalumi. Wamumiminira lipaki mfalumi na wanemelera pawalonga, “Kalikali mashaka gavuwa Mfalumi!”<verse eid="2CH 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 23:12" />Malikiya Atalia pakapikaniriti maziwu ga wantu pawatuga na kumnemelera mfalumi kawagenderiti wantu awa yawaweriti Munumba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 23:13" />Pakasunguliliti kamwoniti mfalumi gwa syayi kagoloka pakwegera na mpanda kuligomi, aku wakulu na wagomba mapenka pawawera pakwegera na mfalumi na wenikaya woseri pawasekerela na kugomba mapenka na wimba waweriti pawagomba ngoma zawu, pawalongoziwa na wantu kwimba nyimbu za zyuma, shakapanu Asalia kadeganga nguwu zakuyi na kubota na kalonga, “Wangalambula! Wangalambula!”<verse eid="2CH 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 23:14" />Shakapanu mtambika Yehoyada kawalagaliriti wakulu wa vipinga miyamiya vya mashonta pakalonga mumlaviyi kunja mdala ayu pakati pa mashonta na muntu yoseri yakamfata kalaguwi kwa ligumba.Toziya mtambika kaweriti kalonga, “Namumlaga mngati mwa Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="2CH 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 23:15" />Su wambata Atalia wamlaviya kunja kupitira kuligomi lya farasi ya liboma, wamlagiti panu.<verse eid="2CH 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yehoyada kankuwatenda wantu wamuwuyiri Mlungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 11:17-20">2 Wafalumi 11:17-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 23:16" />Yehoyada katenditi lipatanu pakati pakuyi mweni na wantu woseri na mfalumi handa hawaweri wantu wa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 23:17" />Su wantu woseri wagenditi wayibomola numba ya kumguwira mlungu Baali na kushipantanga shitarawanda pamuhera na vinyagu zakuyi. Shakapanu kamlaga Matani, mtambika gwa mlungu Baali kulongolu mwa shitalawanda. <verse eid="2CH 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 23:18" />Shakapanu mtambika Yehoyada kawaturiti Watambika na Walawi waweri walolera wa Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakalagaliriti Dawudi na kumlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku ya kulunguziwa ntambu yawalembiti mulagiru ga Musa na pawanemelera na kwimba kulawirana na malagaliru ga Dawudi. <verse eid="2CH 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 23:19" />Viraavirii Yehoyada katuliti walolera mumigomi ya Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa, su muntu yoseri yakawera humba nakingira.<verse eid="2CH 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 23:20" />Viraavirii kawashemiti wakulu wa mashonta wa wantu miyamiya yawamanika na wakulu wa wantu pamuhera na wenikaya woseri su wamjegi mfalumi kulawa Munumba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu, wapitiliti muligomi likulu lya uwega wa kumpindi kuliboma. Shakapanu wamtula mfalumi kalivagi mushiti sha shifalumi. <verse eid="2CH 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 23:21" />Hangu wenikaya woseri wanemeleliti na mji goseri guweriti jii toziya malikiya Atalia kaweriti kalaguwa kwa ligumba.<verse eid="2CH 23:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2CH 24" />
  <para style="s">Yowashi kankuwera mfalumi gwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 12:1-16">2 Wafalumi 12:1-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 24:1" />Yoashi kaweriti na vinja saba pakanjiti kukolamlima. Kakolitimlima kwa vinja arubayini kulawa Yerusalemu. Mawu gwakuyi kashemitwi Sibia kulawa Beeri Sheba. <verse eid="2CH 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 24:2" />Yowashi katenda yagaweriti maheri palongolu pa Mtuwa Mlungu muvinja vyoseri, shaka mtambika Yehoyada pakaweriti mkomu. <verse eid="2CH 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 24:3" />Yehoyada kamyugiziya wadala wawili, na weni wamwiwuliriti wana wapalu na wadala.<verse eid="2CH 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 24:4" />Pagapititi aga Yowashi kaamuwiti kunyawa kayi Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 24:5" />Su, Kawashema watambika na Walawi na kawalagalira, “Mgendi kalongola mumiji ya Yuda, mwakajojoniri mpiya yazifiruwa kulipwa kila shinja kulawa kwa Waisraeli woseri su kunyawa kayi Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu gwenu. Mtendi kalongola.” Kumbiti Walawi watendandiri kalongola. <verse eid="2CH 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 24:6" />Hangu mfalumi kamshema mtambika mkulu Yehoyada, kamkosiya, “Ntambu gaa guwagambiziyandiri Walawi wajojoniri kodi kulawa kwa wantu wa Yuda na wantu wa Yerusalemu, ntambu yakalagaliriti Musa ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu na wantu walipi toziya ya kulitula weri Liringu Linanagala lya Mtuwa Mlungu?” <verse eid="2CH 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 24:7" />Wandundami wa Atalia, mdala ulii mkontola waweriti wameganga na kwingira mngati mwa Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu na kuvitola vintu vyoseri yavilumikitwi kwa Mtuwa Mlungu wavitoliti na kuvitendera kwa mlungu Baali.<verse eid="2CH 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 24:8" />Su, mfalumi kawahimiziya Walawi, wanyawa lisandiku lya kutulira malaviwu na kulitula kunja kuligomi likulu lya Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 24:9" />Shakapanu kawabwelera wantu woseri yawaweriti mumiji ya Yuda na Yerusalemu, handa wantu woseri wamjegeri vintu virii Musa ntumintumi gwa Mlungu kawalagaliriti wantu wa Israeli pawaweriti kushiwala. <verse eid="2CH 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 24:10" />Wakulu woseri na wantu woseri wajega kodi yawu kwa kunemelera wayituliti mlisandiku ali mpaka lisandiku limema. <verse eid="2CH 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 24:11" />Walawi pawajegiti lisandiku ali kwa wakulu wa mfalumi na womberi pawawoniti kuwera kwana mpiya zivuwa, mlemba gwa mfalumi pamuhera na muntu yakamtanga mtambika mkulu, walaviyiti mpiya yaziweriti mlisandiku, shakapanu waliwuziya kayi pahala pakuyi. Wenderiyiti kutenda hangu kila lishaka na wajojonira mpiya vivuwa.<verse eid="2CH 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 24:12" />Mfalumi na Yehoyada wawapananiti mpiya azi walii yawagolokeriti lihengu lya kunyawa kayi Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu. Na weni wawashemiti wanyawa na wasongola mbawu na waponda lyuma na wanyawa shaba wizi wayinyawa kayi Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 24:13" />Hangu mafundi awa watenditi lihengu weri, wayiwuziya Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yayiweriti makashu na wayigangamaziya. <verse eid="2CH 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 24:14" />Pawamaliliti kunyawa Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu, wamjegeriti mfalumi na Yehoyada zahabu na mpiya yayisigaliti, shakapanu vyombu vya Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu vinyawitwi kwa mpiya azi. Vintu avi vitenderitwi Munumba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu na mumalaviwu ga tambiku za kulunguziwa na mabakuli ga kutumiziya ubani na viraa vyombu vimonga vya zahabu na vya feza. Mashaka goseri Yehohada pakaweriti mkomu, wantu wendereyiti kulaviya tambiku za kulunguziwa Munumba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="2CH 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu walema kufata lagiru za Yehoyada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 24:15" />Yehoyada kawera mzewi na pakaweriti na vinja miya na selasini, kahowiti. <verse eid="2CH 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 24:16" />Shakapanu wamfintira mumji gwa Dawudi, kumasembi ga wafalumi su kulanguziya ligoya lyawu kwakuyi kwa maheri gakatenditi mu Israeli toziya ya Mlungu na Numba Nkulu yakuyi.<verse eid="2CH 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 24:17" />Yehoyada pakahowiti kala, wakulu wa Yuda wamwiziliti mfalumi Yowashi, wamzyangazyanga kafati shawamgambira nayomberi kawapikinira. <verse eid="2CH 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 24:18" />Toziya ya aga wantu waleka kuguwira Munumba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa wambuyi wawu, wanja kuguwira maashera na vinyagu. Mlungu kanitimaya na wantu wa Yuda na Yerusalemu toziya ya shidoda ashi. <verse eid="2CH 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 24:19" />Ata hangu, Mlungu kawatumiti wambuyi kuwaberiziya su wamwuyiri Mtuwa Mlungu, kumbiti womberi wawapikinirandiri. <verse eid="2CH 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 24:20" />Panu Rohu gwa Mlungu kamwiziriti Zekaria mwana gwa mtambika Yehoyada nayomberi kagoloka kulongolu kwa wantu, kawagambira, “Mtuwa Mlungu kawakosiya ntambugaa mleka kujimira lagiru zakuyi? Vinu hapamuweri na mpatiru! Toziya mmuleka Mtuwa Mlungu nayomberi viraa kawaleka mwenga!” <verse eid="2CH 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 24:21" />Kumbiti wantu wafiriti kumlaga na kwa lagalira ya mfalumi wamgumanga mabuhi kuligeleri lya Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu mpaka wamlaga. <verse eid="2CH 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 24:22" />Mfalumi Yowashi kagalyaluwa maheri goseri gakatenderitwi na Yehoyada na tati gwakuyi Zekaria su kamulaga mwana gwakuyi. Pakaweriti pakwegera na kuhowa, kalonga, “Mtuwa Mlungu na kayiloli mirandu ayi na kawuziliri.”<verse eid="2CH 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upeleru wa ukolamlima wa Yowashi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 24:23" />Upeleru wa shinja, lishonta lya Wasiria lilikomangiti na Yowashi na kukanka Yuda na Yerusalemu. Wawalagiti wakulu woseri, walopola lopola zivuwa na kumjegera mfalumi gwa Damasiko. <verse eid="2CH 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 24:24" />Tembera lishonta lya Sria liweriti lididika, Mtuwa Mlungu kawatenditi walikanki lishonta likulu lya wantu wa Yuda, toziya wantu wa Yuda awa wamleka Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa wambuyi wawu. Hangu, Mlungu kamtoziti Yoashi kupitira Wasiria. <verse eid="2CH 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 24:25" />Wasiria pawawukiti, wamlekiti Yoashi kakomangwa nentu, wakulu wakuyi wapangiti wamlagiri pashitanda shakuyi su kuwuzilira ntambu yakamlagiti mwana gwa mtambika Yehoyada. Shakapanu kafintiritwi mumji gwa Dawudi, kumbiti kumasembindiri ga wafalumi. <verse eid="2CH 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 24:26" />Wantu yawamtenderiti upyota waweriti Zabadi mwana gwa mdala mwenikaya gwa wantu wa Amoni litawu lyakuyi Shimeati na Yehozabadi mwana gwa mdala mwenikaya gwa wantu wa Mowabu litawu lyakuyi Shimriti. <verse eid="2CH 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 24:27" />Visoweru vya wana wakuyi wapalu Yoashi za kunyawa kayi Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu na umbuyi woseri yawulawirana na yomberi vilembitwi mushitabu sha wafalumi. Amazia mwana gwakuyi kakolitimlima pahala pa tati gwakuyi.<verse eid="2CH 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="2CH 25" />
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Amaziya gwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 14:2-6">2 Wafalumi 14:2-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 25:1" />Amaziya kaweriti na vinja ishilini na mhanu pakanjiti kukolamlima, kakolitimlima kwa shaka sha vinja ishilini na tisa kumji gwa Yerusalemu. Mawu gwakuyi kashemitwi Yehoadani yakalawira Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 25:2" />Katenditi yagawera maheri kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu kumbiti katendandiri kwa moyu gwakuyi goseri. <verse eid="2CH 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 25:3" />Ufalumi wa Amaziya pawanjiti kuligangamaziya muukulu kawalagiti wantumintumi yawamlagiti mfalumi Yowashi, tati gwakuyi. <verse eid="2CH 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 25:4" />Kumbiti kawalagitindiri wana walii yawamlagiti tati gwakuyi, ntambu yagalembitwi mushitabu sha lagiru lya Musa, palii Mtuwa Mlungu pakalagaliriti, “Walera wakuyi hapeniwalaguwi kwavidoda vyawatenditi wana wawu na mwana hapenikalaguwi kwa vidoda vyawavitenditi walera wawu ila kila muntu hakalagwi kwa vidoda vyakuyi vyakatenditi.”<verse eid="2CH 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkondu mu Edomu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 14:7">2 Wafalumi 14:7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 25:5" />Mfalumi Amaziya kawajojonira wapalu wa makabila ga Yuda na Benjamini, kawatuliti muvipinga gwekagweka kulinganira na nkolu zawu na aku kawatula pasi pa wakulu wa mashonta yawalonguziyi wantu elufu yimuyimu na wakulu wamonga yawalonguziya wantu miyamiya. Kulinganira na nkolu zawu. Shakapanu kawalanga wantu walii wana vinja ishilini na kwendeleya, kapatiti walanga ya wantu laki tatu. Woseri waweriti wantu wayaweriti kala kugenda kunkondu, waweriti wagangamala wa kutendera migowa na ngawu. <verse eid="2CH 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 25:6" />Kayi kakodishiti wamashonta wamonga makambaku elufu yimu kulawa Israeli, kwa shiyasi sha handa kilu elufu tatu za feza. <verse eid="2CH 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 25:7" />Kumbiti muntu gwa Mlungu kamgenderiti kamgambira, “Gwee mfalumi, nagugenda munkondu pamuhera na awa wamashonta wa Israeli, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kapamuherandiri na twenga na wantu wa Israeli, na kapamuherandiri na wantu woseri awa wa Efraimu. <verse eid="2CH 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 25:8" />Hangu, ata paguwera mgangamala munkondu, Mlungu hakakutendi gusindi kulongolu kwa wankondu waku, toziya Mlungu kanaga makakala ga kukutanga ama kukugusiya.”<verse eid="2CH 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 25:9" />Amazia kamkosiyiti muntu ayu gwa Mlungu, “Vinu tutendi hashi na mpiya zoseri zyeni tuwalipiti kala wamashonta wa Israeli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 25:9">Muntu gwa Mlungu kamwankula, “Mtuwa Mlungu kaweza kukupanana mpiya nentu ya azi.” <verse eid="2CH 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 25:10" />Su Amazia kawalekera wamashonta yakawakoditi kulawa Efraimu wawuyi ukaya kwawu. Su wawuya ukaya kwawu agawu pawawakalalira nentu wantu wa Yuda.<verse eid="2CH 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 25:11" />Amazia kalipananiti moyu kalilongoziya lishonta lyakuyi mpaka lulalanda lwa Munu. Aku kalikomangiti na kuwalaga wamashonta elufu lilongu wa Edomu. <verse eid="2CH 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 25:12" />Wawabatiti wamashonta elifu lilongu wawakweniziya pampindi pa unenemu na wawagumira pasi mumatalawu,womberi wapantika vipandivipandi.<verse eid="2CH 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 25:13" />Shaka shilaashi, wamashonta wali wa Waisraeli weni Amazia kawaleka wawuyi ukaya kwawu yakawaleweleriti nakagenda nawu kunkondu, wagenditi na kuyikomanga miji ya Yuda, kulawa Samaria mpaka Beti Horoni, wawalagiti wantu miya tatu na walopoliti vintu vivuwa ng'anji.<verse eid="2CH 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 25:14" />Amazia pakawuyiti kuwakanka wantu wa Edomu, kawajegiti wamlungu wa wantu wa aku Seiri kayitenditi kuwera wamlungu wakuyi, kayisuntamalira na kuyitumizilira ubani. <verse eid="2CH 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 25:15" />Aga gamkaliziya ng'anji Mtuwa Mlungu, katumiti mbuyi kwa Amazia. Mbuyi ayu kamkosiyiti Amazia, “Ntambugaa gwankuwaguwira wamlungu wa wantu wamonga, weni wawezandiri kuwalopola wantu wakuyi kulawa mumawoku mwaku?”<verse eid="2CH 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 25:16" />Kumbiti ata kenimaliliri kuyowera, Amazia kamdumula, kamgambira, “Gunyamalili! Tukutendandii mtakuziya gwa mfalumi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CH 25:16">Hashi gufira kulaguwa?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CH 25:16">Mbuyi ayu kalonga, “Nivimana kuwera Mlungu kafira Kukulaga toziya gutenda goseri aga na gubeziya shantakuliti neni, shakapanu kanyamala.”<verse eid="2CH 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkondu mu Israeli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 14:8-20">2 Wafalumi 14:8-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 25:17" />Su, Amazia mfalumi gwa Yuda kalongiti na wantu wakuyi, shakapanu kawutumiti ulagilagi kwa Yehoashi, mwana gwa Yehoahazi mwana gwa Yehu mfalumi gwa Israeli, kamgambira, “Gwizi tulikomangi.” <verse eid="2CH 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 25:18" />Kumbiti Yehoashi mfalumi gwa Israeli kamjegeriti ulagilagi Amazia pakalonga, “Shaka shimu, misontu ya mbigili ya Lebanoni iyigambiriti Mwerezi gwa aku Lebanoni, gumyugiziyi mhinga gwaku mwana gwangu!’ Kumbiti shigongolu gwa kuntuntu kapititi palii na katimbanga misontu ayi. <verse eid="2CH 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 25:19" />Gwenga Amazia gulonga guwakanka Waedomu na gulidumba. Kumbiti nikugambira gulikali pakaya paku! Ntambu gaa gulisakulila ntabiku zyakukwagamiziya gwenga gamweni pamuhera na wantu waku wa Yuda?”<verse eid="2CH 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 25:20" />Kumbiti Amazia kapikiniritindiri ashi na Mtuwa Mlungu katenditi hangu su kalaguwi mumawoku mwa Yehoashi, toziya Amazia kawaguwiriti wamlungu wa Edomu. <verse eid="2CH 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 25:21" />Hangu Yehoashi, mfalumi gwa Israeli kakweniti kalikomanga na Amazia, mfalumi gwa Yuda. Yehoashi na Amazia mfalumi gwa Yuda waliwoniti sheni kwa sheni aku Beti Shemeshi, muisi ya Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 25:22" />Waisraeli wawakomiti wantu wa Yuda na kila yumu katugiriti ukaya kwakuyi. <verse eid="2CH 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 25:23" />Hangu Yehoashi mfalumi gwa Israeli kambatiti Amazia mfalumi wa Yuda, mwana gwa Yehoashi, mwana gwa Ahazia aku Beti Shemeshi, kamjegiti mpaka Yerusalemu. Aku, kashibomoliti shibambaza sha Yerusalemu, kwanjira ligomi la Efraimu mpaka ligomi la pambwega, utali wakuyi uweriti mita miya mbili. <verse eid="2CH 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 25:24" />Katoliti zahabu yoseri na feza ata na vitu vyoseri vyaviweriti mu Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu pasi pa ulolera wa Obedi Edomu, kayi katoliti ulunda woseri wa kuliboma. Viraa katola wantu yawabatitwi, shakapanu kawuya Samaria.<verse eid="2CH 25:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 25:25" />Amazia mfalumi gwa Yuda kakaliti vinja lilongu na mhanu pa kahowiti kala mfalumi Yehoashi mwana gwa Yehoahazi mfalumi gwa Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 25:26" />Mirandu imonga yoseri ya Amazia kulawa lyanjiru mpaka upeleru ilembitwi mu shitabu sha visoweru za Wafalumi wa Yuda na Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 25:27" />Shitendu sha kumlaga Amazia shitenditwi aku Yerusalemu kwanjira pakamlekiti Mtuwa Mlungu, su katugira Lakishi. Kumbiti wankondu wakuyi wawatumiti wantu Lakishi na wamlagira aku. <verse eid="2CH 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 25:28" />Mauti gakuyi gajegitwi pampindi pa farasi na wamfintiriti Yerusalemu kumji gwa Dawudi, kwawafindilitwi wambuyi wakuyi.<verse eid="2CH 25:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="2CH 26" />
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Uzia kankukolamlima Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 14:21-22">2 Wafalumi 14:21-22</ref>,<ref loc="2KI 15:1-7">15:1-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 26:1" />Shakapanu wantu woseri wa Yuda wamtoliti Uzia mwana gwakuyi Amazia yakaweriti kana vinja lilongu na sita, wamtenda kuwera mfalumi pahala pa Amazia tati gwakuyi. <verse eid="2CH 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 26:2" />Pakahowiti tati gwakuyi kagulopuliti mji gwa Eloti na kugunyawa kayi.<verse eid="2CH 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 26:3" />Uzia kanjiti kukolamlima pakawera na vinja lilongu na sita, kakolitimlima kwa vinja hamsini na mbili aku Yerusalemu. Mawu gwakuyi kashemitwi Yekolia yakalawiti Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 26:4" />Katenditi maheri kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakatenditi tati gwakuyi Amazia. <verse eid="2CH 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 26:5" />Kamsakula Mlungu mumashaka ga Zekaria, yakaweriti kamfunda mfalumi ntambu ya kumguwira Mlungu. Shaka shoseri pakamsakuliti Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu kamtendera.<verse eid="2CH 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 26:6" />Uzia kagenditi kulikomanga nkondu na Wafiristi, kavibomola vibambaza vya mji gwa Gati na Yabine na Ashidodi. Kanyawa kayi miji yayiweriti pakwegera na Ashidodi na imonga muisi ya Filisti. <verse eid="2CH 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 26:7" />Mlungu kamtangiti kuwakanka Wafilisiti na Waarabu yawalikaliti Guribaali na Wamewuni. <verse eid="2CH 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 26:8" />Waamoni wampananiti kodi na zyuma zakuyi zigenditi mpaka Misri, toziya ufalumi wakuyi uweriti na makakala.<verse eid="2CH 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 26:9" />Shakapanu Uzia kanyawiti kayi vindwalingu mu Yerusalemu paligomi lya pabwega na ligomi lya lulalanda na pabwega pa shibambaza na kuyigangamiziya. <verse eid="2CH 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 26:10" />Viraavirii kanyawiti vindwalingu aku kushiwala, shakapanu kabawa matanda gavuwa, toziya kaweriti na wankanyama wavuwa yawaweriti kuvidunda na kululalanda. Kaweriti na walimi yawalolera mizabibu mumigongu na mulitapaka lyana mbotu toziya kafiliti nentu kulima.<verse eid="2CH 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 26:11" />Nentu ya aga, Uzia kaweriti na lishonta lyaliweriti kala kwa nkondu. Liweriti libagulwa muvipinga gwekagweka na walanga yawu itulitwi na mlemba Yeieli na mkulu gwawu Maaseya waweriti walonguziwa na Hanania, yumu gwa wakulu wa mashonta wakuyi mfalumi. <verse eid="2CH 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 26:12" />Wakulu woseri wa mashonta waweriti elufu mbili na miya sita. <verse eid="2CH 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 26:13" />Pasi pawu, kuweriti na lishonta lya wanjagira laki tatu na elufu saba miya mhanu, wana uwezu mkulu wa kumgendera mnkondu yoseri gwa mfalumi. <verse eid="2CH 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 26:14" />Uzia kawapananiti wamashonta awa ngawu na mikuki na kofia za shuma na nguwu ya shuma na upindi na nkulungu za luhembelu. <verse eid="2CH 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 26:15" />Aku Yerusalemu wantu wakuyi wamnyawiriti mashini yagatendiritwi muvindwalingu na kulawa muvisoku vya mji su kugumira misali na mabuwi makulumakulu. Zyuma zakuyi zigenditi kila pahala na makakala gakuyi gongelekiti ng'anji toziya ya utanga uvuwa wakapatiti kulawa kwa Mlungu.<verse eid="2CH 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uzia kankukomangwa toziya ya mtiti gwakuyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 26:16" />Mfalumi Uzia pakaweriti na makakala, kaweriti kalidumba na kudumba aku kumjegeriti kwagamira kwakuyi. Kamgalambuka Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwakuyi kwa kwingira Munumba Nkulu ya Mlungu, su kutumiziya ubani mushitalawanda sha kutumiziya ubani. <verse eid="2CH 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 26:17" />Kumbiti mtambika Azaria, pamuhela na watambika wamonga wagangamala semanini, wamfata mfalumi, <verse eid="2CH 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 26:18" />mngati amu wamlewelera, wamgambira, “Uzia ali lihengu lyakundiri lya kumtumizilira ubani Mtuwa Mlungu. Ndo watambika hera wa wiwuka wa Aruni weni walumikwa kutumiziya ubani. Gulawi pahala panu Pananagala, toziya gumtendera vidoda Mtuwa Mlungu na hapagupati ligoya lyoseri kulawa kwakuyi.”<verse eid="2CH 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 26:19" />Shaka ashi, Uzia kaweriti kagoloka Munumba Nkulu ya Mlungu pakwegera na shitalawanda, kabata shetezu sha kutumiziya ubani mumawoku mwakuyi. Kawakalaziya watambika na panu pakawakalaziyiti kabatitwi na ungumbula pasheni pakuyi palongolu pa watambika awa. <verse eid="2CH 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 26:20" />Azaria, mtambika mkulu na walii watambika wamonga, pawamloliti wamwona kana ungumbula pasheni pakuyi, Shakapanu watenditi kalongola kumlaviya kunja. Na mweni katenda kalongola kulawa kunja, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti kamkomanga.<verse eid="2CH 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 26:21" />Su, mfalumi Uzia kaweriti na ungumbula mpaka lishaka lya kuhowa kwakuyi. Kakaliti munumba gweka yakuyi na kabelitwi kwingira Munumba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu. Na Yotamu mwana gwakuyi, kaweriti kagolokera liboma lya mfalumi na kawalonguziya wenikaya wa isi ya Yuda.<verse eid="2CH 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 26:22" />Mirandu imonga yoseri ya mfalumi Uzia kulawa lyanjiru mpaka upeleru, ilembitwi na mbuyi gwa Mlungu Isaya mwana gwa Amozi. <verse eid="2CH 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 26:23" />Uzia kahowiti na kufintirwa pakwegera na pawawafintiritwi wafalumi, toziya walonga, “Mweni kana ungumbula”. Na Yotamu mwana gwakuyi, kakolitimlima pahala pakuyi kuwera mfalumi.<verse eid="2CH 26:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="2CH 27" />
  <para style="s">Yotamu kankukolamlima Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 15:32-38">2 Wafalumi 15:32-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 27:1" />Yotamu kaweriti na vinja ishilini na mhanu pakanjiti kukolamlima, kakolitimlima Yerusalemu kwa vinja lilongu na sita. Mawu gwakuyi kashemitwi Yerusha mhinga gwa Sadoki. <verse eid="2CH 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 27:2" />Katenditi maheri kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakatenditi Uzia tati gwakuyi, ila yomberi kingirandiri Munumba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu, kumbiti wantu wendereyiti kutenda makontola.<verse eid="2CH 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 27:3" />Yotamu kanyawiti kayi ligomi lya kushana lya Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu na katenditi lihengu likulu lya kunyawa shibambaza yashiwera pakwegera na shigongu sha Ofeli. <verse eid="2CH 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 27:4" />Shakapanu kanyawiti kayi miji kuisi ya kushigongu sha Yuda na viraa mumadowi kanyawiti maboma na vindwalingu. <verse eid="2CH 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 27:5" />Yotamu kalikomangiti nkondu na mfalumi gwa Amoni na kamkankiti. Mushinja ashi Waamoni wamlavilira ushulu wa kilu elifu tatu na miya msheshi za madini ga feza na handa tani elufu yimu za nganu na handa kilu elufu lilongu za shayiri. Waamoni wendereyiti kutenda hangu mushinja sha pili na sha tatu. <verse eid="2CH 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 27:6" />Mfalumi Yotamu kendereyiti kuwera na makakala, toziya kakaliti kwa kumjimira Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwakuyi. <verse eid="2CH 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 27:7" />Mirandu imonga yakatenditi Yotamu muwukolamlima wakuyi na nkondu zyakalikomangiti na kila shintu shakatenditi, vyoseri vilembwa mushitabu sha Visoweru vya Wafalumi wa Israeli na Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 27:8" />Yotamu kaweriti na vinja ishilini na mhanu pakanjiti kukolamlima, kakolitimlima Yerusalemu kwa vinja lilongu na sita. <verse eid="2CH 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 27:9" />Shakapanu Yotamu kahowiti na kufintirwa mumji gwa Dawudi kwawafintiritwi wambuyi wakuyi. Na Ahazia mwana gwakuyi kakolitimlima pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="2CH 27:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="2CH 28" />
  <para style="s">Ahazi kankukolamlima Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 16:1-6">2 Wafalumi 16:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 28:1" />Ahazi kanjiti kukolamlima pakaweriti na vinja ishilini, kakolitimlima kwa shaka sha vinja kumi na sita aku Yerusalemu. Yomberi, katenditindiri maheri ntambu yakatenditi Dawudi mbuyi gwakuyi, kumbiti katenditi makontola kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 28:2" />Katenditi galagalii gawatenditi wafalumi wa Israeli. Viraavirii kanyawiti vinyagu vya wamlungu Baali na kuviguwira. <verse eid="2CH 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 28:3" />Katumiziya ubani kululalanda lwa Hinomu na kuwalunguziya nakamu wana wakuyi handa tambiku, pakajera shitiba sha kukalaziya sha wantu yawawingitwi na Mtuwa Mlungu shaka Waisraeli pawaweriti wakwingira muisi. <verse eid="2CH 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 28:4" />Kalaviya tambiku na kutumiziya ubani pahala pampindi pa kuguwira wamlungu wamonga, pamigongu na pasi pa kila mtera gwana shivuniru.<verse eid="2CH 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wa Yuda wankukomangwa na Wasria na Waisraeli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 16:5">2 Wafalumi 16:5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 28:5" />Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwakuyi, kamlekiti mfalumi Ahazia kakomangwi na mfalumi gwa Sria. Wasiria wamkomiti na wawabata wantu wakuyi na kuwuya nawa Damasiku. Viraa kamtenditi kasindwi na mfalumi gwa Israeli, yakawalagiti wantu wakuyi wavuwa. <verse eid="2CH 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 28:6" />Peka mwana gwa Remalia kawalagiti wamashonta makambaku wa Yuda laki yimu na elufu ishilini mulishaka limu. Ilawiliti hangu toziya wantu wa isi ya Yuda wamlekiti Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Wambuyi wawu. <verse eid="2CH 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 28:7" />Lishonta yumu gwa Israeli yawamshemiti Zikiri shikambaku gwa Israeli, kamlagiti Maaseya, mwana gwa mfalumi Ahazi, viraavirii kawalagiti Azirikamu mkulu gwa lishonta gwa liboma na Elikana yakaweriti muntu gwa pili kwa ukulu pasi pa mfalumi. <verse eid="2CH 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 28:8" />Wamashonta wa Israeli wawatoliti lopola walongu wawu wantu wa Yuda, wantu laki mbili pawawera wadala na wana. Viraavirii wapokiti lunda zawu zivuwa na kuwuya nazi Samaria.<verse eid="2CH 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuyi gwa Mlungu Odedi kankuwakalipila wamashonta wa Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 28:9" />Kumbiti kuweriti na muntu yumu litawu lakuyi Odedi, mbuyi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu, kaweriti kalikala Samaria. Mweni kalawiti kuwanka wamashonta wa Israeli na lopola kulawa Yuda yawaweriti wankuwuya Samaria, kawagambira, “Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa wambuyi wenu, kawakalaliriti wantu wa Yuda, hangu kawaleka wabatwi na mwenga kumbiti mwenga muwalaga nakamu kwa maya, shitendu ashi shimfikila Mlungu kumpindi. <verse eid="2CH 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 28:10" />Vinu mfira kuwatenda wapalu na wadala wa Yuda na Yerusalemu waweri wamanda wenu. Kumbiti maweni mwenga mvimanandiri kuwera mmutendera madoda Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu? <verse eid="2CH 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 28:11" />Vinu mpikaniri galii ganiwagambiziya! Muwawuziyi walongu wenu na wadada wenu yamuwabatiti, toziya maya ikalipa nentu ya Mtuwa Mlungu hayiwizili.”<verse eid="2CH 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 28:12" />Wakulu wa Efraimu, ashina Azaria mwana gwa Yohanani na Berekia mwana gwa Meshilemoti na Yehizikia mwana gwa Shalumi na Amasa mwana gwa Hadilai viraa wawalongiti awa yawalawiti kunkondu <verse eid="2CH 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 28:13" />Wawagambira, “Namuwajega panu walopola awa! Tutenda kala makontola kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu viraa tumkalaziya nentu su katukomanga. Toziya gaa mfira makontola getu gongereki?.” <verse eid="2CH 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 28:14" />Hangu, wamashonta wawalekiziya wantu wawu yawawalopoliti na vintu vyawawapokiti kulongolu kwa wakulu na wantu woseri. <verse eid="2CH 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 28:15" />Wakulu walii yawakanditwi matawu gawu wawavalisiya nguwu walopola walii yawalikaliti shivula, shakapanu wawapananiti vilwatu na shiboga na virandu na kuwaswaga lipaki lya mizeituni muvilonda vyawu. Walii yawahela makaka, wawakweniziya mupunda, wawajegiti lopola woseri mpaka Yeriku, mji gwa mitendi, kwa walongu wawu, shakapanu womberi wawuya Samaria.<verse eid="2CH 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahazi kamluwa mfalumi gwa Ashuru kamtangi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 16:7-9">2 Wafalumi 16:7-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 28:16" />Shaka ashi mfalumi Ahazi kawatumiti walagilagi kwa mfalumi gwa Ashuru kamtangi, <verse eid="2CH 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 28:17" />toziya wantu wa Edomu waweriti wankwiza kayi, wayikanka isi ya Yuda, wawabatiti na kuwuka nawa. <verse eid="2CH 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 28:18" />Mushaka shiraa ashi Wafilisti wiziti kuyikomanga miji yayiweriti pasi pavigongu vya Yuda na Negebu. Wayilopola Beti Shemeshi na Ayaloni na Gederoti na Soko na Timina na Gimzu pamuhera na vijiji vyakuyi na kulikala amu. <verse eid="2CH 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 28:19" />Mtuwa Mlungu kayisulusiya isi ya Yuda toziya ya Ahazi mfalumi gwa Israeli, hangu kongera ukontola mu Yuda na kamlekiti Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 28:20" />Tigilati Pileseri, mfalumi gwa Ashuru kiziti kumgaziya pa kumtanga. <verse eid="2CH 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 28:21" />Ahazi katoliti zahabu kulawa Munumba Nkulu ya Mlungu na kuliboma na mnumba za wakulu, kampanana mfalumi gwa Ashuru handa kodi su kamtangi, kumbiti mlandu agu viraa gumtangandiri shintu.<verse eid="2CH 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makontola ga Ahazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 28:22" />Pakaweriti mumashaka gakuyi ga ntabiku, mfalumi Ahazi kendereyiti kumleka Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 28:23" />Kawalavilira litambiku wamlungu wa Damasiku yawaweriti wamkomanga kunkondu, pakalonga, “Toziya wamlungu wa Sria wawatangiti wafalumi wa wawu, haniwalavaliri tambiku pamonga hawantangi.” Kumbiti wamlungu awa wamgusiyiti Ahazi na isi yoseri Israeli yagamiriti. <verse eid="2CH 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 28:24" />Viraavirii, kavitoliti vintu vyoseri vya Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu na kavipandangapandanga, shakapanu kayitata migomi ya numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu na kulinyawira shitalawanda mukila pembi ya Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 28:25" />Mukila mji gwa Yuda, kanyawiti pahala pa mbindi pakulavilila tambiku kwa wamlungu wamonga. Kwa kutenda hangu, kamkaliziya Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Wambuyi wakuyi.<verse eid="2CH 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 28:26" />Mirandu yakuyi imonga na njira zakuyi zoseri, kulawa mwanjiru mpaka upeleru, galembitwi mu shitabu sha Wafalumi wa Yuda na Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 28:27" />Shakapanu mfalumi Ahazi kahowiti, kafintirwa kumji gwa Yerusalemu, kumbiti kafintirwandiri mumasembi ga wafalumi wa Israeli. Hezekia mwana gwakuyi, kakolitimlima pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="2CH 28:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="2CH 29" />
  <para style="s">Hezekia kankukolamlima Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 18:1-3">2 Wafalumi 18:1-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 29:1" />Hezekia kanjiti kukolamlima Yuda pakawera na vinja ishilini na mhanu, kakolitimlima pakawera aku Yerusalemu kwa vinja ishilini na tisa. Mawu gwakuyi kaweriti Abiya mhinga gwa Zekaria. <verse eid="2CH 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 29:2" />Katenditi maheri kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, ntambu yakatenditi Dawudi, mbuyi gwakuyi.<verse eid="2CH 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu yankupungwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 29:3" />Mumwezi gwa kwanja gwa shinja sha kwanja sha ukolamlima wakuyi, mfalumi Hezekia kayivugula kayi migomi ya Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu na kayinyawa kayi. <verse eid="2CH 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 29:4" />Kawingiziya kunumba ayi watambika na Walawi, Shakapanu kawajojonira muligereli uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji, <verse eid="2CH 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 29:5" />kawagambira, “Mumpikaniri mwenga Walawi! Mulipungi na muyipungi Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa wambuyi wenu. Muwusiyi vintu vyoseri vidoda vyavijimirwandiri kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 29:6" />Toziya wambuyi wetu waweriti na mtiti na kutenda makontola kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwetu. Wamleka na wagalambuziya kutali vyeni vyawu na kupatulira shisogu pahala pakakala Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 29:7" />Viravilii watatiti migomi ya ligeleri lya Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu na wazimiyiti lumuliku na watumiziyandiri ubani pota kulaviya tambiku ya kulunguziya torosu mu pahala pananagala pa Mlungu gwa Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 29:8" />Toziya ya aga, Mtuwa Mlungu kayikalaliriti nentu Yuda na Yerusalemu na galii gakawatenderiti gawakangasha na kuwatiliziya wantu woseri. Ntambu yamuliwoneriti maweni kwa masu genu. <verse eid="2CH 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 29:9" />Toziya ayi watati wetu walagitwi kunkondu na wana wetu wapalu na wahinga wetu na wadala wetu ndo malopola.”<verse eid="2CH 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 29:10" />“Vinu, neni nfira nakamu kutenda lipatanu na Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, su nakendereya kutukalalira. <verse eid="2CH 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 29:11" />Wanawangu, mgusheri mlandu agu. Toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kawasyagula mwenga su mumtenderi na muwalongoziyi wantu wakuyi na kumguwira na kumtumiziya ubani.”<verse eid="2CH 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 29:12" />Walawi awa wanjiti lihengu,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="2CH 29:12">Kulawa lukolu la kohati waweriti Mahati mwana gwa Amasayi na Yoeli mwana gwa Azaria,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="2CH 29:12">Lukolu lwa Merari kalawiti Kishi mwana gwa Abudi na Azaria mwana gwa Yehaleli,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="2CH 29:12">Lukolu lwa Gerishoni kalawiti Yowa mwana gwa Zima na Edeni mwana gwa Yowa,<verse eid="2CH 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 29:13" />Lukolu lwa Elisafani kalawiti Shimori na Yeieli, kulawa kwa wiwuka wa Asafu, Zekaria na Matania<verse eid="2CH 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 29:14" />Lukolu lwa Hemani kalawiti Zekaria na Matania,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="2CH 29:14">Lukolu lwa Yedutuni kulawiti Shemaya na Uzieli.<verse eid="2CH 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 29:15" />Awa wawajojonira Walawi wayawu, walipunga. Shakapanu wingira mngati ntambu yakafiriti mfalumi watendi, wanjiti kuyipunga Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu kulinganira na lagiru za Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 29:16" />Watambika wingira Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu, su kuyipunga na walaviya vintu vyoseri vidoda vyavimfiliriziyandiri Mlungu vyaviweriti amu. Shakapanu wavitula kuligeleri lwa Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu. Walawi watoliti vintu vidoda vyavimfiriziyandiri Mlungu na wavijega ku Lulalanda lya lushemba Kidironi.<verse eid="2CH 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 29:17" />Wanjiti lihengu lya kuyipunga Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu lishaka lya kwanja lya mwezi gwa kwanja na kusoka lishaka lya nani waweliti kala wamalira lihengu loseri na mpaka kuligeleri lya Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu. Shakapanu, watenditi lihengu kwa shaka sha mashaka manani nentu mpaka lishaka lya lilongu na sita lya mwezi agu, kila shintu shimalilikiti.<verse eid="2CH 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu yankutendwa iweri ya Mlungu kayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 29:18" />Shakapanu Walawi wamgenderiti mfalumi Hezekia wamgambira, “Tuvitula kala vintu vya vijimilwa na Mlungu Munumba Nkulu ya Mlungu pamuhela na shitalawanda sha tambiku za kulunguziya torosu na vyombu vyakuyi vyoseri na meza ya kutulira mabumunda mananagala na vyombu vyakuyi vyoseri. <verse eid="2CH 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 29:19" />Viraavirii vyombu vyoseri vyeni mfalumi Ahazi kaviwusiya shaka pakaweriti mkolamlima, palii pakamlekiti Mlungu, tuviwuziya na kuvitenda viweri vya Mtuwa Mlungu na vinu vya kulongolu ku shitalawanda sha Mtuwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="2CH 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 29:20" />Mandawira shilawu yakuyi, mfalumi Hezekia kawajojonira wakulu wa mji, shakapanu kagenda nawa Kunumba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 29:21" />Wawajega wang'ombi shipalu saba na wakondowu shipalu saba na mbuzi pongu saba, waweri litambiku lya kuwusiya vidoda kwa wantu wa lukolu lwa mfalumi na kwa pahala pananagala na kwa wantu wa Yuda. Panu mfalumi kawalagalira watambika wa wiwuka wa Aruni wawalunguziyi wankanyama awa handa tambiku pampindi pa shitalawanda sha Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 29:22" />Watambika wawalikituliti kwanja wang'ombi shipalu awa na watoliti mwazi gulii na kugumushira kushitalawanda, shakapanu walikitula wakondowu wapalu walii na watoliti mwazi gulii na kugumushira kushitalawanda na walikituliti wanakondowu walii na watoliti mwazi gulii na kugumushira kushitalawanda. <verse eid="2CH 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 29:23" />Upeleru wakuyi, wawajegiti wambuzi pongu walii wa litambiku lya kuwusiya vidoda kulongolu kwa mfalumi na wantu woseri yawaweriti panu na womberi watula mawoku gawu pampindi pa mbuzi pongu awa. <verse eid="2CH 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 29:24" />Shakapanu watambika walii wawalikitula mbuzi pongu awa na watoliti mwazi gulii na kugumishira kushitalawanda, su iweli tambiku ya kuwawusilira vidoda toziya ya ukolaniziya kwa wantu wa Israeli woseri, toziya mfalumi Hezekia kaweriti kawalagalira walaviyi tambiku za kulunguziya torosu na tambiku ya kulekiziya vidoda.<verse eid="2CH 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 29:25" />Mfalumi Hezekia kawatula Walawi mu Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu, agawu pawawera na kayamba na wamonga pawawera na vinanda na wamonga pawawera na vinubi na zezi, ntambu yayilagaliritwi na Dawudi na Gadi mbuyi gwa mfalumi pamuhera na mbuyi Natani toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kalagaliriti ali kupitira wambuyi wakuyi. <verse eid="2CH 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 29:26" />Walawi wagolokiti na wakoliti vyombu vyawu vya kwimbira vyeni Dawudi kavitenderiti na viraavirii watambika wakoliti mapenka gawu. <verse eid="2CH 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 29:27" />Shakapanu Hezekia kalagaliriti tambiku ya kulunguziya torosu ilaviwi pa shitalawanda. Pawanjiti kulaviya tambiku ayi, wantu wanjiti kumwimbira Mtuwa Mlungu na wantu awa wanjiti kugomba mapenka na vyombu vya kwimbira vya Dawudi mfalumi gwa Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 29:28" />Wantu woseri wamguwira Mtuwa Mlungu, agawu wantu pawendeleya kwimba na wana mapenka pawagomba mapenka gawu. Mirandu ayi yendereyiti mpaka pawamaliriti kulaviya tambiku za kulunguziya torosu. <verse eid="2CH 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 29:29" />Pawamaliriti kulaviya tambiku, mfalumi Hezekia pamuhera na wantu woseri yawaweriti amu wasuntamala na wamguwira Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 29:30" />Shakapanu mfalumi Hezekia na wakulu wawagambira Walawi wamwimbiri Mtuwa Mlungu kwa nyimbu za zaburi zyazilembitwi na mfalumi Dawudi na za mbuyi gwa Mlungu Asafu. Hangu wantu woseri wamkwisa Mtuwa Mlungu kwa nemeleru na kumsuntamalira na kumguwira.<verse eid="2CH 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 29:31" />Shakapanu Hezekia kawagambira wantu, “Vinu mlipunga kala kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. Msegeleri, mjegi litambiku na malaviwu ga kulonga mayagashii mu Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu.” Hangu, wantu wajega tambiku zawu na malaviwu ga kulonga mayagashi na wantu woseri yawaweriti na moyu gwa kufiraweni wajegiti tambiku za kulunguziya tolosu. <verse eid="2CH 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 29:32" />Litambiku za kulunguziya tolosu yazijegitwi na wantu woseri ziweliti wang'ombi shipalu sabini na kondowu shipalu miya moja na wana wa kondowu miya mbili. Zoseri azi ziweliti tambiku zakulunguziya tolosu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 29:33" />Wankanyama yawalumikitwi kwa tambiku ya kulunguziwa tolosi waweriti wang'ombi shipalu miya sita na kondolu na mbuzi shipalu elfu tatu. <verse eid="2CH 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 29:34" />Toziya watambika waweriti wadidini, wasinditi kuwawambula wankanyama woseri awa, hangu walongu wawu Walawi wawatangiti mpaka pawamaliliti lihengu ali na mpaka watambika wamonga pawamaliliti kulipunga, Walawi walipungiti nentu kuliku watambika. <verse eid="2CH 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 29:35" />Kuweriti na tambiku zivuwa za kulunguziya tolosi na pamuhera na lipaki lya wankanyama lya tambiku ya ponga na tambiku za kulanda zilaviwa pamuhera na tambiku za kulunguziya torosu. Hangu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 29:35">Lihengu lya kuguwira Munumba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu yanja kayi. <verse eid="2CH 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 29:36" />Mfalumi Hezekia na wantu woseri wanemeleliti nentu kwa goseri galii Mtuwa Mlungu gakawatenderiti wantu wakuyi, toziya mirandu ayi itendikiti kwa shaka shifupi.<verse eid="2CH 29:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="2CH 30" />
  <para style="s">Hezekia kankutenda matandiru ga pasaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 30:1" />Mfalumi Hezekia kawajegeriti ulagilagi wantu woseri wa Israeli na Yuda na viraa kawalembela luhamba wenikaya wa Efraimu na manase, pakawashemera woseri wizi Munumba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu yayiwera Yerusalemu, su kutenda msambu lishaka lya pasaka kwa ligoya lyakuyi Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 30:2" />Mfalumi na watanga wakuyi na wantu yawajojonikiti Yerusalemu walijimirana kutenda msambu agu gwa Pasaka mumwezi gwa pili, <verse eid="2CH 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 30:3" />msambu gutendikitindiri kwa shaka shakuyi, toziya walanga ya Watambika wavuwa waweriti wenilipungi na wantu waweriti hawenilijojoniri aku Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 30:4" />Mpangu agu gumfiriziyiti mfalumi pamuhera na wantu woseri yawaweriti walijojonira. <verse eid="2CH 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 30:5" />Hangu wamuwiti kubwera koseri muisi ya Israeli, kulawa Beeri Sheba mpaka Dani, handa wantu wizi Yerusalemu kutenda msambu gwa pasaka gwa Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli. Pasaka gambira ayi yenenemelerwi na wantu wavuwa handa awa kulawirana na ntambu yayilembitwi. <verse eid="2CH 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 30:6" />Kwa lagiru ya mfalumi, watanga wakuyi na wantumintumi wakuyi wajegiti luhamba koseri kuisi ya Israeli na Yuda. Luhamba alu luweriti na ulagilagi awu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 30:6">“Mwenga wantu wa Israeli yamponikiti pa makomangu ga wafalumi wa Ashuru. Mmuwuyili Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Abrahamu, Isaka na Israeli, su na yomberi kapati kuwawuyira. <verse eid="2CH 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 30:7" />Namwera handa wambuyi wenu na walongu wenu weni wawerandiri waaminika kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa wambuyi wawu, mweni kawakomangiti ntambu yamuwona. <verse eid="2CH 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 30:8" />Namuwela namtiti handa wambuyi wenu, ila mumujimiri Mtuwa Mlungu. Mwizi Munumba Nkulu yakuyi mweni kayipunga mashaka goseri, mumumguwiri Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu, su nakawakalalira. <verse eid="2CH 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 30:9" />Handa pamumuyira Mtuwa Mlungu, walongu weni yawalopolitwi na wana wenu, hawawonerwi lusungu na kuwaleka wawuyi muisi ayi. Toziya Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu, ndo yakalekiziya na kana lusungu na yomberi hakawanki payiwera hamumuwuyiri.”<verse eid="2CH 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 30:10" />Su, Walagilagi awa wagenditi kulawa mji gumu mpaka gumonga koseri muisi ya Efraimu na Manase, Wasokiti ata Zabuloni, kumbiti wantu wawasekiti na kuwajongera. <verse eid="2CH 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 30:11" />Ata hangu, wantu wadidini muwamu mwa makabila ga Asheri, Manasi na Zabuloni, walinanagaziya wiza Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 30:12" />Makakala ga Mlungu gaweliti gatenditi lihengu mu Yuda, kawatenditi wajimili litakulu lya mfalumi na watanga wakuyi ntambu ya malagalira ga Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="2CH 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msambu gwa Pasaka gwankutendeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 30:13" />Wantu wavuwa nentu walijojonira aku Yerusalemu mumwezi gwa pili, kutenda msambu gwa mabumunda yagalekerwandiri simika. <verse eid="2CH 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 30:14" />Wanjiti lihengu, waviwusiya vitalawanda vyoseri yaviweriti Yerusalemu na zimonga zoseri yazitenderitwi kutumuziya ubani, wapapa na kuziyasa kululalanda lwa Kidironi. <verse eid="2CH 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 30:15" />Shaka sha lilongu na msheshi lya mwezi agu wamlikitula mwanakondolu gwa pasaka. Watambika na Walawi yawalipungitindiri wawoniti soni,su walipungiti na kujega tambiku za kulunguziya tolosu Munumba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 30:16" />Watoriti mpenu zawu Munumba Nkulu kulinganira na malagalira yagaweriti lagira za Musa, muntu gwa Mlungu. Walawi wawapananiti watambika mwazi gwa tambiku na womberi wayimishira mushitalawanda. <verse eid="2CH 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 30:17" />Toziya wavuwa yawajojonikiti panu wawerandiri walipunga, Walawi wafiritwi kuwalikitula wakondowu wa Pasaka na kuwalaviya kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu kwajili yawu. <verse eid="2CH 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 30:18" />Tembera wantu, wavuwa ya walii yawalawa Efraimu na Manasena Isakari na Zabuloni, waweriti walipungandiri, ata hangu waliiti pasaka kumbeli na malagaliru. Kumbiti mfalumi Hezekia kawaluwira pakalonga, “Mtuwa Mlungu yaguwera mnanagala, gumlekeziyi kila yumu, <verse eid="2CH 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 30:19" />yakakuluwa kwa moyu gwakuyi goseri gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa wambuyi wakuyi, hata handa yomberi kaherepandiri kulinganira na lagiru ya Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu.” <verse eid="2CH 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 30:20" />Mtuwa Mlungu kajimila luwa ya Hezekia, kawalekeziya wantu hawa. <verse eid="2CH 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 30:21" />Waisraeli woseri yawaweriti walijojonira mumji gwa Yerusalemu watenditi msambu gwa mabumunda ya yagalekerwandiri simika mushaka sha saba, pawawera na nemeleru nkulu. Walawi na Watambika wamkwisiti Mtuwa Mlungu mashaka goseri, wamwimbiriti kwa makakala gawu goseri. <verse eid="2CH 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 30:22" />Mfalumi Hezekia kawakwisa na kuwatula mumoyu watambika kwa kuwera watenda guwira kwa umani uvuwa.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="2CH 30:22">Msambu gwa pili gwa pasaka</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 30:22">pa kupera shaka sha saba sha mashaka geni wantu waliyiti na walaviya litambiku za ponga na kumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa wambuyi wawu,<verse eid="2CH 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 30:23" />Lijojoniru lyoseri lijimiriti kwendeleya na msambu gwa shaka sha mashaka saba. <verse eid="2CH 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 30:24" />Mfalumi Hezekia gwa Yuda kawapananiti wantu yawajojonilwa jumla ya wang'ombi shipalu elufu yimu na kondolu elufu saba ntambu iraayi na wakulu wawapananiti wang'ombi shipalu elufu yimu na wakondolu elufu lilongu. Walanga nkulu ya watambika walipunga. <verse eid="2CH 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 30:25" />Kila muntu yakajojonikiti kasekeleliti nentu. Wantu woseri wa Yuda na watambika na walawi na walii kulawa Israeli yawiziti na wahenga yawalikala mu Israeli na Yuda, woseri wasekeleriti nentu. <verse eid="2CH 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 30:26" />Kuweriti na nemeleru nkulu Yerusalemu, toziya kwanjira makashu ga mfalumi Selemani mwana gwa Dawudi, mfalumi gwa Israeli, shintu handa ashi hashenilawiri aku Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 30:27" />Shakapanu, watambika na walawi wawaluwila wantu ntekelera zakuyi Mtuwa Mlungu, nayomberi kulawa kumpindi kagapikanira maluwa gawu na kagajimila.<verse eid="2CH 30:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="2CH 31" />
  <para style="s">Ezekia kankuwatenda wantu wamwuyiri Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 31:1" />Msambu pagumalirikiti, wantu woseri wa Israeli wagenditi mukila mji gwa Yuda, wamegangameganga mpanda za mabuwi na kudumuladumula vinyagu vya Ashera, mlungu gwa shidala na washiharibisiya viraa shitalawanda na pahala pakuguwira wamlungu wamonga. Watenditi viraa koseri mu Yuda na Benjamini na Efraimu na Manasi, mpaka pawamaliriti kuhalibisiya vyoseri. Shakapanu wawuya kumiji yawu, kila muntu kawuya ukaya kwakuyi.<verse eid="2CH 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 31:2" />Mfalumi Hezekia kawasyagula kayi watambika na Walawi muvipinga, kampananiti kila yumu gwawu lihengu lyakuyi Munumba Nkulu ya Mlungu, mahengu aga gaweriti kulaviya tambiku za kulunguziya tolosu na tambiku za ponga na tambiku za kulonga mayagashii na tambiku za kuzyuma. <verse eid="2CH 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 31:3" />Kulawirana na ulunda wakuyi mweni mfalumi kalaviya vintu, toziya ya tambiku za kulunguziya tolosu mandawira na pashimihi, tambiku za Lishaka lya Kwoyela na tambiku za kunemelera kulawa lyezi na tambiku zimonga yazilaviwitwi kulinganira na lagiru lya Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="2CH 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 31:4" />Nentu ga aga, mfalumi kawagambiriti wenikaya wa Yerusalemu walaviyi vintu vyawafiruwitwi kupananwa watambika na Walawi, su walilaviyi nakaka mumahengu ga lagiru lya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 31:5" />Palapalii kalagaliriti hangu, wantu wa Israeli walaviyiti kwa uvuwa, mabenangu ga kwanja ga viboga na divayi na lipaki lya mizeyituni na lwashi na viboga vimongavimonga vya kwanja na kayi walaviya viboga vimonga vya kumalambu na lifungu limu lya lilongu lya kila shintu. <verse eid="2CH 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 31:6" />Wantu wa Israeli na Yuda yawalikaliti mumiji ya Yuda, viraavirii wajegiti mafungu ga lilongu ga wang'ombi na wakondolu na vintu vimonga, wavitura kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. Wavitura vintu avi kwa mafungu. <verse eid="2CH 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 31:7" />Mumwezi gwa tatu wanjiti kuvipanga mumafungu na wamaliriti mumwezi gwa saba. <verse eid="2CH 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 31:8" />Mfalumi Hezekia na watanga wakuyi pawawiziti kugalola mafungu aga, wamkwisiti Mtuwa Mlungu na kuwatekelera wantu wakuyi wa Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 31:9" />Mfalumi Hezekia kawakosiyiti watambika na Walawi toziya ya mafungu aga. <verse eid="2CH 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 31:10" />Azaria mtambika mkulu yakaweriti gwa wiwuka wa Sadoki kamwakula, “Kwanjira wantu wanji kujega malaviwu gawu Munumba ya Mlungu, twana viboga vivuwu na twana shigibikiru shivuwa. Mtuwa Mlungu kawatekelera wantu wakuyi, ndo mana tupatiti vintu vyoseri avi.”<verse eid="2CH 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 31:11" />Shakapanu mfalumi Hezekia kawalagalira wanyawi luhanja Munumba ya Mtuwa Mlungu. Na womberi wanyawa, <verse eid="2CH 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 31:12" />amu watula malaviwu na lifungu limu mumafungu lilongu na vintu vyoseri vyavilaviwitwi kwa Mlungu. Shakapanu wamtula Konaniya yakalikala isi ya Lawi, kaweri mkulu na mlolera gwa vintu avi na Shimeyi mlongu gwakuyi, kaweriti kankumtanga. <verse eid="2CH 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 31:13" />Yehieli na Azazia na Nahati na Asaheli na Yeremoti na Yozabadi na Elieli na Isimakiya na Mahati na Benaya awa waweriti wankutenda lihengu lya walolera pasi pa ulonguziya wa Konaniya na Shimeyi mlongu gwakuyi. Woseri awa wasyagulitwi na mfalumi Hezekia na Azaria mkulu gwa numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 31:14" />Kore mwana gwa Imna yakaweriti kalawa Lawi, yakaweriti mlolera gwa ligomi lya kwagulawa mshenji gwa Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu, kagolokeriti malaviwu goseri gawalaviyiti kwakufira weni kwa Mlungu na kubagula tambiku yazilaviwitwi toziya ya Mtuwa Mlungu na tambiku yaziwera nanagala nakamu. <verse eid="2CH 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 31:15" />Edeni na Miniamini na Yeshua na Shemaya na Amaria na Shekania wamtangiti kutenda lihengu ali kwa waminika mumiji yimonga yawakaliti watambika. Wawabaguliriti walongu wawu Walawi viboga teratera kulinganira na vipinga vya wakulu kwa wapusu, <verse eid="2CH 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 31:16" />pota kulishera nkolu zawu zyawalembitwi. Wawabaguliriti wapalu wana vinja vitatu ama nentu weni matawu gawu gaweriti muwalangwa mwa viyiwuku na woseri walii yawaweziti kwingira Munumba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu kutenda mahengu gawu ga kila lishaka na mahengu gamonga ntambu yawafiruwitwi. <verse eid="2CH 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 31:17" />Watambika walembitwi kulinganira na kaya zawu na Walawi yawaweriti na vinja ishilini na nentu walembitwi kulinganira na lihengu lyawu ntambu yawapananitwi kutenda. <verse eid="2CH 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 31:18" />Walembitwi woseri pamuhera na wana wawu wadidini na wadala wawu na wana wapalu na wana wawu wadala, toziya kwa lihengu lyawu waweriti waminika kulipunga. <verse eid="2CH 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 31:19" />Viraavirii, muwamu mwa wiwuka wa Aruni, Watambika yawaweriti walikala mumalambu yagazyengeta miji yawu, muweriti wantu yawasyagulitwi su kubagula viboga kwa kila mpalu mukaya za watambika na kila muntu yakaweriti kalembwa muwamu mwa Walawi.<verse eid="2CH 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 31:20" />Hangu ndo mfalumi Hezekia ntambu yakatenditi maheri yagamfiriziya Mtuwa Mlungu gwa uwaminika kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwakuyi, muisi yoseri ya Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 31:21" />Kaweriti na mpatiru toziya ya lihengu lyakatenditi muuntumintumi wa Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu ama muutenderu wa lagiru na malagaliru ga Mlungu mweni kamsakula Mlungu gwakuyi na kamtendera kwa moyu gwakuyi goseri na yomberi Mlungu kamtekelera.<verse eid="2CH 31:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="2CH 32" />
  <para style="s">Lishonta lya Ashuru lyankuwatiriziya Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 18:13-37">2 Wafalumi 18:13-37</ref>,<ref loc="2KI 19:14-19">19:14-19</ref>,<ref loc="2KI 19:35-37">35-37</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 36:1-22">Isaya 36:1-22</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 37:8-38">37:8-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 32:1" />Pa mirandu yoseri ayi ya waminika wa mfalumi Hezekia, mfalumi Senekeribu gwa Ashuru kuyikangaliti Yuda. Kiziti kuyitula ng'onjeru kumiji yana liboma agawu pakalitumbira hakayitoli iweri yakuyi. <verse eid="2CH 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 32:2" />Mfalumi Hezekia pakawoniti handa mfalumi Senekeribu kiza kwa nfiru ya kuyikomanga Yerusalemu, <verse eid="2CH 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 32:3" />kayowera na watanga wakuyi na wamakambaku wa mashonta kudiwiti bwiru za mashi yaziweriti kunja kumiji na womberi wamjimira na wamtanga. <verse eid="2CH 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 32:4" />“Wawajojonira wantu wavuwa pamuhera wazidiwa bwiru zoseri pamuhera na lushemba lwalupititi pahala panu, pawalonga, ntambu gaa kuwalekiziya wafalumi wa Ashuru pawawiza wawoni mashi gaweri nduu?” <verse eid="2CH 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 32:5" />Su kugulolera mji, mfalumi Hezekia kalipanana moyu, kanyawa kayi shibambaza shoseri shashibomokiti na pampindi pakuyi kanyawa visasa vya ulolera. Uwega wa kunja kanyawa shibambaza shimonga sha pili na kagangamaziya ngereka mumji gwa Dawudi. Nentu ya aga kanyawiti vintu vya kulikomangira na ngawu zivuwa. <verse eid="2CH 32:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 32:6" />Kawaturiti wantu woseri mjini walonguziwi na wakulu wa mashonta, shakapanu kawalagalira walijojoniri paluwaga pakwegera na Ligomi likulu lya mji. Panu kawapanana wantu moyu, kawagambira, <verse eid="2CH 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 32:7" />“Muweri wagangamala. Namtira pota kwinginika kulongolu kwa mfalumi gwa Ashuru ama wamashonta wakuyi toziya yatuwera nayu ndo mkulu kuliku yakawera nayu Senakeribu. <verse eid="2CH 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 32:8" />Yomberi kana makakala ga shimuntu hera, ila twenga twana Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwetu, katutanga na kutumkomangira nkondu zyetu.” Visoweru avi vya mfalumi Hezekia viwapananiti moyu nentu wantu awa.<verse eid="2CH 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 32:9" />Pa aga Senakeribu mfalumi gwa Ashuru, yakaweriti kaguzyengeta mji gwa Lakishi pakawera na lishonta lyakuyi lyoseri, kawatumiti wantumintumi wakuyi Yerusalemu kwa Hezekia mfalumi gwa Yuda na kwa wantu woseri wa Yuda yawaweriti Yerusalemu, kalonga, <verse eid="2CH 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 32:10" />“Hangu ndo ntambu yakalongiti Senakeribu mfalumi gwa Ashuru. Hashi, mlitumbira shishi ata mlikala Yerusalemu, kumji yaguzyengetwa? <verse eid="2CH 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 32:11" />Hashi Hezekia kawapayira su kawatendi mhowi kwa njala ama kuyumiluwa pakawagambira, Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu hakawalopoli mumawoku mwa mfalumi gwa Ashuru? <verse eid="2CH 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 32:12" />Hashi ndo Hezekia ndiri yakapahalibisiti pahala pakuyi pa kuguwira wamlungu pamuhera na shitalawanda na kuwalagalira wantu woseri wa Yuda na Yerusalemu palii pakalongiti, hamguwili palongolu pa shitalawanda shimu na pampindi pakuyi hamlunguziyi tolosu tambiku zyenu? <verse eid="2CH 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 32:13" />Hashi, mvimanandiri goseri galii geni neni na wambuyi wangu gatuwatenderiti wantu woseri wa maisi gamonga? Hashi wamlungu wa isi azi zimonga ziweziti kuzikombola isi zawu kulawa mumawoku mwaneni? <verse eid="2CH 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 32:14" />Ndo mlungu gaa pakati pa wamlungu wa maisi aga yayihalibisiwa nakamu na wambuyi waneni yakaweza kuwakombola wantu wakuyi kulawa mumawoku mwaneni? Hashi namwenga mulitumbira kuwera Mlungu gwenu hakawakomboli kulawa mumawoku mwaneni? <verse eid="2CH 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 32:15" />Hezekia nakawapayira pota namgatumbira aga. Namumjimira muntu ayu, toziya kwahera mlungu gwa isi ama mfalumi yoseri yakaweziti kuwakombola wantu wakuyi mumawoku mwa mfalumi gwa Ashuru, vinu ayu Mlungu gwenu hakawezi!”<verse eid="2CH 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 32:16" />Wantumintumi wa mfalumi gwa Ashuru wamlongiti vidoda nentu Mtuwa Mlungu na Hezekia ntumintumi gwakuyi. <verse eid="2CH 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 32:17" />Mfalumi mweni kalembiti luhamba kumwigira Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu wa Israeli, kalonga, “Handa virii wamlungu wa maisi gamonga ntambu yagasinda kuwakombola wantu wawu kulawa mumawoku mwaneni, viraavirii Mlungu gwa Hezekia hapenikawezi kuwakombola wantu wakuyi.” <verse eid="2CH 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 32:18" />Wakulu awa wawagambiriti kwa kubotanga kwa luga ya Shiebrania wantu wa Yerusalemu yawaweriti mushibambaza, wafiriti kuwatula lyoga su wagutoli mji pota makakala. <verse eid="2CH 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 32:19" />Wamlongi Mlungu gwa Yerusalemu handa wamlonga mlungu gwa isi zimonga ama handa vinyagu hera yavinyawitwi kwa mawoku ga wantu!<verse eid="2CH 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 32:20" />Shakapanu mfalumi Hezekia na mbuyi Isaya, mwana gwa Amozi, wamluwiti na kumlilila Mlungu yakawera kumpindi kawatangi toziya ya mirandu ayi. <verse eid="2CH 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 32:21" />Mtuwa Mlungu katumiti ntumintumi gwa kumpindi, kagenda na kuwalaga makambaku na wamashonta na wakulu wa mashonta na wakulu mulugonjelu lwa mfalumi gwa Ashuru. Su, mfalumi gwa Ashuru kawuyiti muisi mwakuyi pakawera na soni. Palapalii pakingiriti munumba ya mlungu gwakuyi, wana wakuyi mweni wamlagiti palaapanu kwa ligumba.<verse eid="2CH 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 32:22" />Kwa njira ayi, Mtuwa Mlungu kamlopola mfalumi Hezekia na wenikaya wa Yerusalemu kulawa mliwoku lya Senakeribu mfalumi gwa Ashuru na kulawa mumawoku ga wankondu wakuyi woseri. Mlungu kawatenda walikali kwa ponga na wantu yawapakwegera wakuyi woseri. <verse eid="2CH 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 32:23" />Wantu wavuwa nentu wawiziti pawamjegera Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku aku Yerusalemu, viraa wamjegera Hezekia, mfalumi gwa Yuda lifupu lwa beyi nkulu. Hangu kulawa shaka shilii, Hezekia kazyumwa nentu na isi zimonga zoseli.<verse eid="2CH 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulidumba na kulwala kwa Hezekia</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 20:1-3">2 Wafalumi 20:1-3</ref>,<ref loc="2KI 20:12-19">12-19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 38:1-3">Isaya 38:1-3</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 39:1-8">39:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 32:24" />Mashaka aga, Hezekia kalwaliti nentu, kaweriti sambira na kuhowa. Kamluwa Mtuwa Mlungu na yomberi Mlungu kamwakula na kumpanana langiru. <verse eid="2CH 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 32:25" />Kumbiti Hezekia kalidumba kaleka kulonga mayagashi kwa Mtuwa Mlungu kwa galii maheri gakamtenderiti hangu Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti na maya na yomberi na wantu wa Yuda na wa Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 32:26" />Upeleru Hezekia kamwuyira Mtuwa Mlungu na kaleka kulitumba na wenikaya wa Yerusalemu walinanagaziya, hangu maya ga Mtuwa Mlungu gawizilandiri shaka Hezekia pakaweriti mkomu.<verse eid="2CH 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulunda na ukulu wa mfalumi Hezekia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 32:27" />Mfalumi Hezekia kaweliti mlunda nentu na kapanananitwi ligoya na wantu. Kalinyawilira luhanja lwa feza na zahabu na mabuhi ga beyi nkulu na vintu vya kununkira na ngawu na vyombu vyoseri vya beyi nkulu. <verse eid="2CH 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 32:28" />Shakapanu kalinyawiriti hanja nkulu za kutulira viboga na divayi na lipaki lya mizeyituni na visasa vya kutulira wang'ombi na vya wakondolu. <verse eid="2CH 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 32:29" />Viraavirii kalinyawiriti miji ivuwa toziya yakuyi mweni na wang'ombi na wakondolu toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kampananiti ulunda uvuwa ng'anji. <verse eid="2CH 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 32:30" />Mfalumi Hezekia ndo yakagadiwiti mashi ga bwiru ya Gihoni, kabawa mifereji ya pasipasi mpaka uwega wa kwaguzyeta mshenji mwa mji gwa Dawudi. Hezekia katekelelitwi mu kila mlandu gwakatenditi, <verse eid="2CH 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 32:31" />kumbiti walagilagi wa Babuloni pawatumitwi kwakuyi kumkosiya visoweru vya makangashu yagalawiliti amu, Mlungu kamlekiti kaliamulili mweni, su kamjeri na kuvimana goseri yagawela mumoyu mwakuyi.<verse eid="2CH 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upeleru wa ukolamlima wa Hezekia</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 20:20-21">2 Wafalumi 20:20-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 32:32" />Mirandu imonga ya mfalumi Hezekia na maheri gakatenditi, galembitwi mumalola ga mbuyi Isaya mwana gwa Amozi na mushitabu sha wafalumi wa Yuda na Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 32:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 32:33" />Shakapanu Hezekia kahowiti na kufintirwa mulugongu pahala pa masembi ga wiwuka wa Dawudi gaweriti. Wantu woseri wa Yuda na wenikaya wa Yerusalemu wamfindiriti kwa ligoya. Nayomberi Manasi mwana gwakuyi, kakolamlima pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="2CH 32:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="2CH 33" />
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Manasi kankukolamlima Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 21:1-9">2 Wafalumi 21:1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 33:1" />Manasi kaweriti na vinja lilongu na mbili pakanjiti kukolamlima Yuda, kakolamlima Yerusalemu kwa vinja hamsini na mhanu. <verse eid="2CH 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 33:2" />Katenditi makontola kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu kajeriti galii yagatenditwi na wantu wa isi zimonga zyeni Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti kaziwingiti shaka wantu wa Israeli pawaweriti wankwingira muisi. <verse eid="2CH 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 33:3" />Toziya kapatenditi pahala pa kuguwira wamlungu wamonga papaweriti pabomolwa na Hezekia Tati gwakuyi, Manasi kanyawa shitalawanda sha kuguwira wamlungu Bahari, kanyawa na shinyagu sha Maashera. Shakapanu, kaviguwira vintu vyoseri vya kumpindi na kuvitendera. <verse eid="2CH 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 33:4" />Kanyawa vitalawanda avi Munumba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu pahala peni Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti kalonga, “Litawu lyangu haliguwirwi mashaka goseri mu Yerusalemu.” <verse eid="2CH 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 33:5" />Kanyawiti shitalawanda sha kuguwira vintu vyoseri vya kumpindi kumageleri mawili ga Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 33:6" />Shakapanu kawalunguziya wana wakuyi handa tambiku mu lulalanda lwa Hinomu. Katendera ndumba ata kutenda pamuhera na watunga wa mahoka na wahawi. Katenditi makontola gavuwa kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu na Mlungu kaniti maya nayu. <verse eid="2CH 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 33:7" />Shinyagu shakanyawiti, kashitula mu Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu pahala Mungu pakalongiti, kulongolu kwa Dawudi na Selemani mwana gwakuyi. “Munumba ayi na mu Yerusalemu na muwamu mwa makabila liliongu na mawili ga Israeli, hamunguwiri panu mashaka goseri. <verse eid="2CH 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 33:8" />Na payiwera wantu wa Israeli hawatendi ntambu yaniwagambiriti na pawajimira lagiru zoseri na matakulu na malagalira yagalaviwitwi kwa lihoku lya Musa, su hapeni niwaleki wawingwi kulawa muisi ayi yeni niwapananiti wambuyi wawu.” <verse eid="2CH 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 33:9" />Kumbiti Manasi kawazyanga wantu wa Yuda na wenikaya wa Yerusalemu, watenditi makontola nentu kuliku maisi gamonga geni Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti kagawinga muisi, wantu wa Israeli pawaweriti wankwingira.<verse eid="2CH 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Manasi kankulonga ndeka madoda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 33:10" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamberiziyiti Manasi na wantu wakuyi, kumbiti wampikanirandiri. <verse eid="2CH 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 33:11" />Hangu, Mtuwa Mlungu kawajegiti wakulu wa mashonta wa mfalumi gwa Ashuru. Wakulu awa wambatiti Manasi na wamkoweka ndoni mumpula na kumtawa nyororu za shaba, wamjegiti mpaka Babeli. <verse eid="2CH 33:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 33:12" />Pakaweriti muntabika, kamluwiti Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwakuyi, kalinanagaziya nentu kulongolu kwa Mlungu gwa wambuyi wakuyi. <verse eid="2CH 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 33:13" />Kamluwa Mlungu na Mlungu kanka kuluwa kwakuyi na kamwuziya Yerusalemu muufalumi wakuyi. Panu Manasi kavimana handa Mtuwa Mlungu ndo Mlungu gwa nakaka.<verse eid="2CH 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 33:14" />Pa aga, Manasi kanyawa shibambaza shimonga uwega wa kunja wa mji gwa Dawudi, kwaguzyeta mshenji kwa Gihoni, kulalanda, kendereya mpaka ligomi lya Somba na kashizyengeta mpaka papaweriti na ngereka na kagutenda guweri mtali ng'anji. Pamuhera na aga, kawatula wakulu wa mashonta mumiji yoseri ya Yuda yana boma. <verse eid="2CH 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 33:15" />Kayiwusiya Munumba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu wamlungu woseri wa shiyenga na vinyagu pamuhera na vitalawanda vyoseri vyakaweriti kavinyawa kuvigongu vya Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu na mu Yerusalemu, kavyasa kunja kumji. <verse eid="2CH 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 33:16" />Kawuziya shitalawanda sha kumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu na pampindi pakuyi kalaviya tambiku za ponga na za kulonga mayagashii, kawalagalira wantu wa Yuda wamguwiri Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 33:17" />Ata hangu wantu wendereyiti kulaviya tambiku pahala pa pampindi, kumbiti wamlavilira tambiku Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwawu hera.<verse eid="2CH 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upeleru wa ukolamlima wa Manasi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 21:17-18">2 Wafalumi 21:17-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 33:18" />Mirandu imonga ga Manasi, luwa yakuyi kwa Mlungu na visoweru vya wambuyi wa Mlungu vyawayoweriti nayu kwa litawu lwa Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu wa Israeli, goseri aga galembitwi mushitabu sha mirandu ya Shaka sha Wafalumi wa Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 33:19" />Kuluwa kwakuyi na Mlungu ntambu yakamwankuliti na vidoda vyakuyi vyoseri na kuwerandiri na waminika wakuyi na pahala pakanyawiti pa pampindi pa kuguwira wamlungu wamonga na ntambu yakanyawiti vinyagu vya Ashera na vinyagu pamberi pa kulinanagaziya, aga galembwa mumahoru ga wambuyi wa Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 33:20" />Manasi kahowiti na kufintirwa mu liboma lyakuyi na Amoni mwana gwakuyi, kakolamlima pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="2CH 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Amoni kankukolamlima Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 21:19-26">2 Wafalumi 21:19-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 33:21" />Amoni kaweriti na vinja ishilini na viwili pakanjiti kukolamlima Yuda, kakolitimlima vinja viwili pakawera Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 33:22" />Katenditi makontola kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, handa Manasi tati gwakuyi ntambu yakatenditi. Viraa kalaviya tambiku na kuvitendera vinyagu vyeni Manasi tati gwakuyi kavisongoliti. <verse eid="2CH 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 33:23" />Yomberi kalinanagaziyandiri kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, ntambu yakatenditi Manasi, kumbiti mweni kongeriti kutenda makontola nentu.<verse eid="2CH 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 33:24" />Shakapanu wantumintumi wakuyi watenda upyota na wamlaga muliboma lyakuyi. <verse eid="2CH 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 33:25" />Kumbiti wantu wa Yuda wawalaga woseri awa yawatenditi upyota kwa Amoni, Shakapanu wamlumika Yosia, mwana gwakuyi kuwera mfalumi pa yomberi.<verse eid="2CH 33:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="2CH 34" />
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Yosia kankukolamlima Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 22:1-2">2 Wafalumi 22:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 34:1" />Yosia kaweriti na vinja vinani pakanjiti kukolamlima, kakolitimlima vinja selasini na shimu pakawera Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 34:2" />Katenditi maheri kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. Kafatiti njira za Dawudi mbuyi gwakuyi na kukola lagiru za Mtuwa Mlungu kwa waminika.<verse eid="2CH 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yosia kankuvibomola vinyagu vya wamlungu wamonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 34:3" />Mu shinja sha nani sha ukolamlima wakuyi, mfalumi Yosia, pakawera kankali mntemba, kanjiti kumguwira Mlungu gwa Dawudi tati gwakuyi, shakapanu pakaweriti na vinja lilongu na viwili kanjiti kuyipunga Yuda na Yerusalemu kwa kuhalibisiya pahala pa pampindi pa kuguwira wamlungu wamonga na vinyagu vya Ashera na vinyagu vimonga vya kupondanda na za kuguwirwa. <verse eid="2CH 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 34:4" />Kalagaliriti wavibomoli vitalawanda vya kuguwira mlungu Baali na kuvidumulanga vitalawanda vya kutumiziya ubani yavinyasulitwi pampindi pa vitalawanda avi na wavipocholanga vinyagu vya mlungu Ashera na vimonga vya kusongola na vya kuguwirwa, kazitenditi kuwera madikudiku na madikudiku aga kagitanga pampindi pa masembi ga wantu walii yawalaviliriti tambiku kwa vinyagu avi. <verse eid="2CH 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 34:5" />Viraavirii, kalunguziyiti mihonju ya watambika wa wamlungu awa kuvitalawanda vyawu, hangu kayipunga Yuda na Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 34:6" />Katenditi ntambu iraaayi mumiji ya Manasi na Efraimu na Simeoni mpaka Nafutali na mumahami yagaweriti kumbwega mwa miji ayi. <verse eid="2CH 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 34:7" />Kavibomoliti vitalawanda na kuwapocholanga wamlungu wa Ashera na vinyagu vya kusongolwa ziwera madikudiku. Viraa kavidumulanga vitalawanda vya kutumiziya ubani muisi yoseri ya Israeli. Shakapanu kawuya Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2CH 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shitabu sha Lagiru shiwoneka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 22:3-20">2 Wafalumi 22:3-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 34:8" />Mu shinja sha lilongu na nani sha ukolamlima wakuyi, shaka pakaweriti kayipungakala isi na numba, katumiti wantu watatu: Shafani mwana gwa Azalia na Maaseya mlonguziya gwa mji na Yowa mwana gwa Yoahazi, yakaweriti mlemba su wagendi kuyinyawa kayi Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu, Mlungu gwakuyi. <verse eid="2CH 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 34:9" />Wamgenderiti Hilikia, mtambika mkulu, wampananiti mpiya yaziweriti zijegwa munumba nkulu ya Mlungu zeni zijojonilitwi na Walawi wayaweriti walolera ligomi kulawa Manasi na Efraimu na kulawa wega zoseri za Israeli, isi yoseri ya Yuda na Benjamini na viraa kulawa kwa mwenikaya wa Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 34:10" />Mpiya azi wapananitwi wanyawa walii yawagolokeriti manyawa ga numba nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu na wanyawa yawatenditi lihengu Munumba Nkulu ya Mlungu su kunyawa kayi numba. <verse eid="2CH 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 34:11" />Shakapanu wapanananitwi mpiya wasongola mbawu na wanyawa toziya ya kuhemelera mabuwi yagasongolitwi na mbawu za kutendera kwa kunyawira numba zyeni wafalumi wa Yuda wazibomoliti. <verse eid="2CH 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 34:12" />Wantu awa watenditi lihengu ali kwa waminika, pawawera pasi pa ulonguziya wa Walawi Yonatani na Obadia, hawa waweriti Walawi wa lukolu lwa Merari na Zakaria na Meshulamu yawalawiti mlukolu lwa Kohati. Walawi woseri waweriti na umani nentu mukugomba vyombu vya kwimbira, <verse eid="2CH 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 34:13" />wagolokeliti watola wa visanka na kuwalongolera woseri yawatenda mahengu gamonga. Walawi wamonga waweriti walemba na wakulu na ata walolera ligomi.<verse eid="2CH 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 34:14" />Pawaweriti wankuzilaviya kunja mpiya yaziweriti zilaviwitwi Munumba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu, mtambika Hilikia kashiwoniti shitabu sha lagiru lya Mtuwa Mlungu yashilaviwitwi kupitira Musa. <verse eid="2CH 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 34:15" />Shakapanu Hilikiya kamgambira Shafani mlemba, “Nishipata shitabu sha Lagiru munumba ya Mtuwa Mlungu.” Shakapanu Hilikiya kampanana shitabu ashi Shafani. <verse eid="2CH 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 34:16" />Yomberi Shafani kamjegera mfalumi shakapanu kamgambira, “Wantumintumi waku woseri watenda kila shintu ntambu yawagambilitwi kutenda. <verse eid="2CH 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 34:17" />Walaviya mpiya yaziweriti munumba nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu, shakapanu wawapanana wagolokera na wanyawa.” <verse eid="2CH 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 34:18" />Shakapanu mlemba Shafani kamgambira mfalumi, “Mtambika Hilakia kampananiti shitabu ashi.” Na Shafani kashigubuliti shitabu ashi kulongolu kwa mfalumi.<verse eid="2CH 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 34:19" />Mfalumi pakapikaniriti visoweru vya shitabu ashi sha lagiru kapapuliti nguwu zakuyi. <verse eid="2CH 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 34:20" />Panu kawalagalira Hilakia na Ahikamu mwana gwa Shafani na Abudoni mwana gwa Mika, mlemba Shafani na Asaya ntumintumi gwa mfalumi, kawagambira, <verse eid="2CH 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 34:21" />“Mgendi mwakakosiyi kwa Mtuwa Mlungu kwajili yaneni na kwajili ya wantu yawasigaliti Israeli na Yuda na virii yaviwera mushitabu shashiwonikaniti. Toziya maya ga Mtuwa Mlungu gatutulukira, toziya wambuyi wetu wakolitindiri shisoweru sha Mtuwa Mlungu, pota kutenda galii yagalembitwi amu.”<verse eid="2CH 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 34:22" />Su, Hilikia pamuhera na wantumintumi wamonga walii yakawatumiti wamgendera mbuyi gwa Mlungu Hulida, mdala gwa Shalumu na mwana gwa Tokati, mwana gwa Hasra, mtula nguwu yazitumikiti Munumba Nkulu ya Mlungu. Yomberi kaweriti kankulikala Yerusalemu pahala papanyawitwi kayi, naweni wayoweriti nayu galii yagalawiliti. <verse eid="2CH 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 34:23" />Su Hulida kawagambira, “Hangu ndo ntambu yakatakula Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli. Mumgambiri ayu yakawatumiti kwaneni, <verse eid="2CH 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 34:24" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu, hanjegi ntabiku mu Yerusalemu na kwa wantu wakuyi na viraavirii hanjegi pangira zoseri yazilembitwi mushitabu yashigubutulitwi kulongolu kwa mfalumi gwa Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 34:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 34:25" />Toziya wandeka neni na kutumiziya ubani wamlungu wamonga su wantendi nkalali nentu kwa wamlungu yawanyawiti kwa mawoku gawu, vinu mayagangu hagitwirwi pahala panu pota kunyamaziwa. <verse eid="2CH 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 34:26" />Kumbiti mfalumi gwa Yuda kawalagaliliti mwenga kusakula litakulu lya Mtuwa Mlungu, gumgambiri hangu ndo Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli ntambu yakalonga, kwa visoweru vyagupikiniriti. <verse eid="2CH 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 34:27" />Toziya guleka vidoda na gulinanagaziya kulongolu kwaneni, mpaka gupapula nguwu zaku na kulira pagupikaniriti visoweru vyangu kwajili ya pahala panu na kwajili ya wenikaya wakuyi na gulinanagaziya kulongolu kwangu na neni viraa nikupikanira. <verse eid="2CH 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 34:28" />Hangu hanikutendi guliwoni na wambuyi waku na gwenga hagufintirwi kwa ponga.” Masu gaku hapeniguwoni ntabiku zyanizijega pahala panu na kwa wenikaya yawalikala panu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 34:28">Wantu walii wawuka na kumgambira Yosiya shilii shakatakuliti Hulida<verse eid="2CH 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yosiya katenda lipatanu kumjimira Mtuwa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 23:1-20">2 Wafalumi 23:1-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 34:29" />Shakapanu mfalumi Yosia kawashemiti pamuhera wakulu woseri wa Yuda na Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 34:30" />Mfalumi kagenda Munumba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu pamuhera na wapalu woseri wa Yuda na wenikaya wa Yerusalemu pawalilongoziya na watambika na Walawi na wantu wamonga woseri kulawa kwa wakulu mpaka kwa wadidini. Panu kawagubutuliliti shisoweru sha shitabu sha lipatanu shashiwonikiti Munumba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 34:31" />Shakapanu mfalumi kagolokiti pa lupanda lwa shifalumi na katenda lipatanu na kugoloka kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu handa, hakamfati Mtuwa Mlungu na kukola lagiru na toza na mafundu gakuyi kwa moyu gwakuyi goseri na kwa rohu yakuyi yoseri na kujimira visoweru vya lipatanu vyavilembitwi mushitabu ashi. <verse eid="2CH 34:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 34:32" />Shakapanu kawatenditi wantu woseri yawaweriti mu Yerusalemu na Benjamini kufata lipatanu. Na wenikaya wa Yerusalemu walikaliti kwa kufuta lipatanu lya Mlungu, Mlungu gwa wambuyi wawu. <verse eid="2CH 34:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 34:33" />Shakapanu Yosia kawusiya vinyagu vyoseri vya kukaliziya vyaviweriti kila pahala mu Israeli na kuwahimiziya wantu woseri wa Israeli kumtendera Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwawu. Muukolamlima wakuyi woseri yawusigaliti kamlekitindiri Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa wambuyi wawu.<verse eid="2CH 34:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="2CH 35" />
  <para style="s">Yosiya kankutenda msambu gwa Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 23:21-23">2 Wafalumi 23:21-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 35:1" />Mfalumi Yosia katenditi msambu gwa pasaka kwa kumpana ligoya Mtuwa Mlungu aku Yerusalemu, walikitula wakondolu wa pasaka lishaka lya lilongu na msheshi lya mwezi gwa kwanja. <verse eid="2CH 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 35:2" />Kawasyagula watambika kwa lihengu lyawu lyawafiliwitwi kutenda Munumba Nkulu ya Mlungu na kuwapana moyu walitendi kwa waminika. <verse eid="2CH 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 35:3" />Shakapanu kawalagaliriti Walawi yawaweriti wankuwafunda wantu wa Israeli yawaweriti walumikwa kwajili ya Mtuwa Mlungu, kawagambira. “Mulituli Lisanduku Linanagala Munumba Nkulu ya Mlungu yakanyawiti Selemani mwana gwa Dawudi na mfalumi gwa Israeli, mfiruwandiri kayi kulipapa mmawega. Vinu mumtenderi Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu na wantu wakuyi woseri wa Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 35:4" />Mlitendi lihengu lyenu kulinganira na nkolu zyenu, kugenderana na malagaliru ga Dawudi, mfalumi gwa Israeli na ga Selemani mwana gwakuyi. <verse eid="2CH 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 35:5" />Viraa mgoloki pahala pananagala handa wagolokera wa walongu wa nkolu zyenu na kila yumu katangi kaya ya wantu wa Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 35:6" />Muwalikituli wana kondolu wa Pasaka na mlipungi, shakapanu myitandi toziya ya walongu wenu, su wawezi kutenda lilagaliru lya Mtuwa Mlungu lyalitakulitwi na Musa.”<verse eid="2CH 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 35:7" />Shakapanu mfalumi Yosia kawapananiti wantu, kondolu na wanambuzi yawaweriti elufu selasini na wang'ombi elufu tatu, woseri awa walaviyitwi muvigongolu vyakuyi mfalumi. <verse eid="2CH 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 35:8" />Na wakulu kwa nfilu zawu, walaviya mshangu gwawu wawapanana wantu na watambika na Walawi. Hilikia na Zakaria na Yehieli na wakulu wa Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu, wawapananiti kondolu na wambuzi elufu mbili na miya sita na ng'ombi shipalu miya tatu toziya ya tambiku za Pasaka. <verse eid="2CH 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 35:9" />Konaniya na walongu wakuyi wawili, Shemaya na Netaneli, pamuhera na Hashabia na Yeliyeli na Yozabadi yawawera wakulu wa Walawi, naweni viraa wawapananiti Walawi wanakondolu na wanambuzi elufu mhanu na ng'ombi shipalu miya mhanu, toziya ya tambiku za Pasaka.<verse eid="2CH 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 35:10" />Pawamaliriti matandiru goseri ga Pasaka, watambika wagolokiti pahala pawu na Walawi muvipinga vyawu, ntambu yakalagaliriti mfalumi. <verse eid="2CH 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 35:11" />Wawalikituliti kondolu wa Pasaka na watambika wamishira mwazi kushitalanda, yawagwankiti kulawa kwawu na Walawi wawambula likuli wankanyama awa. <verse eid="2CH 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 35:12" />Shakapanu watuliti gweka tambiku za kulunguziya tolosu su wavibagula kwa wantu kulinganira na kaya zawu wantu yawaweriti watambika su wamlaviliri Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yayilembitwi mushitabu sha lagiru lya Musa. Watenditi ntambu iraaayi kwa wang'ombi. <verse eid="2CH 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 35:13" />Wawabanikiti wanakondolu wa Pasaka pa motu ntambu yayilagaliritwi na viraa wapwasiyiti tambiku nanagala muviwiga vikulu na masufuliya makulu na muvikalangiru shakapanu wawabagulira kalongola wantu woseri. <verse eid="2CH 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 35:14" />Shakapanu Walawi walitandiriti pahala pawu na pa watambika, toziya watambika wa wiwuka wa Aruni waweriti na lihengu lya kulaviya tambiku za kulunguziya tolosu na vinofu vyana lipaki mpaka pashiru, hangu Walawi watandiri toziya yawu weni na toziya ya watambika wa wiwuka wa Aruni. <verse eid="2CH 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 35:15" />Wimba wiwuka wa Asafu wagolokiti pahala pawu ntambu ya kalagalira mfalumi Dawudi na Asafu na Hemani na Yedutuni, mbuyi gwa mfalumi. Na walolera yawaweriti kumigomi wafiluwitwindiri kuleka mahengu toziya walongu wawu Walawi wawatandiriti Pasaka. <verse eid="2CH 35:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 35:16" />Hangu lihengu lyoseri za Mtuwa Mlungu litanditwi lishaka ali, su kuyipunga Pasaka na kulaviya tambiku za kulunguziya tolosu kushitalawanda sha Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakatakuliti mfalumi Yosia. <verse eid="2CH 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 35:17" />Mushaka ashi wantu woseri wa Israeli yawasokiti wagutenditi msambu agu gwa Pasaka na msambu gwa mabumunda yagalekerwandiri simika kwa mashaka saba. <verse eid="2CH 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 35:18" />Pasaka handa ayi hayenitendwi mu Israeli yoseri kwanjira mashaka ga mbuyi Samueli. Hakeni lawiri mfalumi ata yumu gwa Israeli yakatenditi Pasaka handa ayi yayitenditwi na mfalumi Yosia pamuhera na watambika na Walawi na wantu woseri wa Yuda na wantu wa Israeli na wenikaya wa Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 35:19" />Pasaka ayi itenditwi mushinja sha kumi na nani sha ulokamlima wa mfalumi Yosia.<verse eid="2CH 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upeleru wa ukolamlima wa Yosia</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 23:28-30">2 Wafalumi 23:28-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 35:20" />Pa goseri aga gakatenditi mfalumi Yosia toziya ya Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu, Neko mfalumi gwa Misri, kalongoziyiti lishonta lyakuyi kugenda kukomanga aku Karkemishi kulushemba Eufrati. Mfalumi Yosia kalawiti kulikomanga nayu, <verse eid="2CH 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 35:21" />Kumbiti mfalumi Neko kamjegera ulagilagi yawulonga. “Nkondu azi zyagwengandiri gwee mfalumi gwa Yuda. Nizandiri kulikomanga na gwenga ila kulikoma na wankondu wangu na Mtuwa Mlungu kandagalira ntendi kalongola. Su goyi kumbera Mtuwa Mlungu, yakawera uwega waneni, hera hangu hakakulagi.” <verse eid="2CH 35:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 35:22" />Kumbiti Yosia kajimirandiri kumlekeziya. Kalemiti kuvipikinira vyakatakuliti Mlungu kwa njira ya Neko, hangu kalimpikanirandiri su nakamanika, shakapanu kingira kunkondu mululalanda lya Megidu.<verse eid="2CH 35:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 35:23" />Nawaguma misali, wamgumiti msali mfalumi Yosia, panu mfalumi Yosia kawagambira wantumintumi wakuyi, “Mumbusiyi panu! Ntenduwa ng'anji.” <verse eid="2CH 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 35:24" />Wantumintumi wakuyi wamwusiyiti mumbutuka yakuyi ya kukwengwa na farasi, wamjega na mbutuka yakuyi ya pili mpaka Yerusalemu. Panu kahowa na kufintirwa mumasembi ga shifalumi. Wantu woseri wa Yuda na Yerusalemu wamdayililiti Yosia.<verse eid="2CH 35:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 35:25" />Mbuyi gwa Mlungu Yeremia viraa katungiti lwimbu lwa kumdayilira Yosia na wimba woseri wapalu kwa wadala, wamkanta Yosia mumadaya gawu mpaka leru. Iwera shitiba kutenda madaya aga mu Israeli. Aga galembwa mushitabu sha Madaya.<verse eid="2CH 35:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 35:26" />Mirandu imonga ga Yosia na matendu gakuyi maheri ntambu yagalembitwi mumalagiru ga Mtuwa Mlungu, <verse eid="2CH 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 35:27" />na matendu gakuyi kwanjira kwanja mpaka upeleru, aga galembwa mushitabu sha lagiru lya wafalumi gwa Israeli na Yuda.<verse eid="2CH 35:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="2CH 36" />
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Yehowahazi kankukolamlima Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 23:30-35">2 Wafalumi 23:30-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 36:1" />Wantu wa Yuda wamtoriti Yehoahazi mwana gwa Yosia, wamtenda kaweri mfalumi pahala pa tati gwakuyi aku Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 36:2" />Yehowahazi kaweriti na vinja ishilini na vitatu pakanjiti kukolamlima, kakolitimlima kwa miyezi mitatu aku Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 36:3" />Shakapanu mfalumi gwa Misri kamwusiyiti muukolamlima wakuyi aku Yerusalemu na kuyitoza isi Yuda kodi ya kilu elufu tatu na miya msheshi za feza na kilu selasini na msheshi za zahabu. <verse eid="2CH 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 36:4" />Su mfalumi gwa Misri kamtula Eliyakimu, mlongu gwakuyi Yehoahazi kuwera mfalumi gwa Yuda na Yerusalemu, shakapanu kamgalambula litawu kamshema Yehoyakimu, kumbiti Neko kamtola Yehowahazi mlongu gwakuyi Eliyakimu mpaka Misri.<verse eid="2CH 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Yehoyakimu kankukolamlima Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 23:36-24:7">2 Wafalumi 23:36-24:7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 36:5" />Yehoyakimu kaweriti na vinja ishilini na mhanu kapanjiti kukolamlima, kakolitimlima kwa vinja lilongu na limu kulawa Yerusalemu. Katenda makontola kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwakuyi. <verse eid="2CH 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 36:6" />Nebukadineza mfalumi gwa Babuloni, kamkomangiti, kamtawa kwa nyoloru za shaba su kumjega lopola Babuloni <verse eid="2CH 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 36:7" />Nebukadineza viraa akatoliti vimu vya vyombu vya Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu kavijega Babuloni na kuvitula muliboma lyakuyi aku Babuloni. <verse eid="2CH 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 36:8" />Mirandu imonga ya Yehoyakimu, pamuhera na makaliziwu gakatenditi na gamonga yagawonikiti kwakuyi galembwa mushitabu sha Wafalumi wa Israeli na Yuda. Yehoyakini mwana gwakuyi kakolitimlima pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="2CH 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Yehoyakini kankukolamlima Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 24:8-17">2 Wafalumi 24:8-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 36:9" />Yehoyakini kaweriti na vinja vinani pakanjiti kukolamlima. Kakolitimlima kulawa Yerusalemu kwa miyezi mitatu na mashaka lilongu. Katenditi makontola kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="2CH 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 36:10" />Shinja pashanjiti, mfalumi Nebukadineza katumiti ulagilagi, wamtoliti Yehoyakini wamjega mpaka Babuloni, pamuhera na vyombu vya beyi nkulu vya numba nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu. Mfalumi Nebukadineza kamtula Sedekia mlongu gwakuyi kuweri mfalumi gwa Yuda na Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2CH 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Sedekia kankukolamlima Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 24:18-20">2 Wafalumi 24:18-20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:1-3">Yeremia 52:1-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 36:11" />Sedekia kaweriti na vinja ishilini na yimu pakanjiti kukolamlima, kakolitimlima kulawa Yerusalemu kwa vinja lilongu na yimu. <verse eid="2CH 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 36:12" />Katenditi makontola kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwakuyi, pota kulinanagaziya kulongolu kwa Yeremia, mbuyi gwa Mlungu mweni kalonga visoweru vyavilawiti kwa Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="2CH 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yerusalemu yankuhalibisiwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 25:1-21">2 Wafalumi 25:1-21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:3-11">Yeremia 52:3-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 36:13" />Sedekia kamgalambuka kayi mfalumi Nebukadineza yakaweliti kamtenda kalirapi kwa litawu lya Mtuwa Mlungu handa hapenikamgalambuki. Sedekia kaweriti kana mtiti na moyu gukamala kalemiti kumgalambukira Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli. <verse eid="2CH 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 36:14" />Nentu ya aga watambika na walonguziya wa Yuda pamuhera na wantu weritindiri waminika nakamu wajera kutenda ga kukaliziya ga wantu wa isi imonga, wapatenditi napajimirwa munumba ya Mtuwa Mlungu mweni yomberi kaweriti kayitakasiya aku Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CH 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 36:15" />Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa wambuyi wawu, katumiti kwa womberi walagilagi wakuyi kayi na kayi toziya kaweriti na lusungu kwa wantu wakuyi na pahala pakuyi pakalikala. <verse eid="2CH 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 36:16" />Kumbiti womberi wendereya kuwajongera walagilagi wa Mlungu na wavibeziya visoweru vyakuyi na kuwaseka wambuyi wakuyi mpaka maya ga Mtuwa Mlungu gawizira wantu wakuyi mpaka wawezitindiri kuganyamaziya.<verse eid="2CH 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 36:17" />Hangu, Mtuwa Mlungu kamjega mfalumi gwa Babuloni weni kawalagiti wantemba wawu kwa ligumba mpaka mu Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu, pota kumwonela lusungu muntu yoseri yakawera mpalu ama mdala ama mzewi ama yakahera makakala. Woseri Mtuwa Mlungu kawatenda wabatwi na Nebukadineza. <verse eid="2CH 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 36:18" />Kavitoliti vyombu vyoseri vya Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu vikulu na vididini na luhanja lwa numba wa Mtuwa Mlungu na lwa mfalumi na wakulu. Kavijegiti vyoseri mpaka Babuloni. <verse eid="2CH 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 36:19" />Kayipambiriti motu numba ya Mlungu na kashibomola shibambaza sha Yerusalemu na kazipambira motu numba zoseri za liboma na kuhalibisiya vyombu vyoseri vya beyi nkulu. <verse eid="2CH 36:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 36:20" />Wantu yawaponikiti munkondu wajegitwi Babuloni. Na womberi wawera wamanda wa Nebukadineza na wiwuka wakuyi wawera wamanda mpaka mwanjiru gwa ufalumi wa Uajemi. <verse eid="2CH 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 36:21" />Hangu shakalongiti Mtuwa Mlungu kupitira mbuyi gwakuyi Yeremia, shitendeka isi hayisigali hera pota kulimwa kwa vinja sabini, kulipa mashaka goseri isi payikaliti pota kutenda msambu gwa shaka sha kwoyela.<verse eid="2CH 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Koreshi kawalagalira Wayahudi wawuyi ukaya kwawu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EZR 1:1-4">Ezra 1:1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 36:22" />Mushinja sha kwanja sha ukolamlima wa Koreshi, mfalumi wa Uajemi, su shitendikiti shisoweri sha Mtuwa Mlungu yashitakulitwi kupitira mbuyi gwakuyi Yeremia, Mtuwa Mlungu kamtenditi Koreshi, mfalumi gwa Uajemi, kabweri lagiru ayi muufalumi wakuyi woseri na kuyilemba hangu:<verse eid="2CH 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 36:23" />“Ali ndo lyakatakula Koreshi mfalumi gwa Uajemi. Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa kumpindi, kampanana falumi zoseri za pasipanu na kandagalira nimnyawili numba mu Yerusalemu, muisi ya Yuda. Vinu kila muntu muwamu mwenu mwenga yamuwera wantu wakuyi Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwakuyi na kaweri pamuhera na yomberi na kagendi.”<verse eid="2CH 36:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 36" />
</usx>